{"ID":"20261006125149-sfvyo22","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20261006125149-sfvyo22","title":"AI 电影发现平台与Linux","type":"doc","updated":"20261006172424"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260516163414-ho0rwub","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260516163414-ho0rwub","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"介绍一下这个项目"}]},{"ID":"20260516163514-se5f1bp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516163514-se5f1bp","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目是一个 AI 电影发现平台\n前端用 React + Vite，后端用 FastAPI + SQLAlchemy\n核心目标不是只做一个电影列表页，而是把“自然语言找电影”这件事做成完整链路"}]},{"ID":"20260516163542-7j3l347","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516163542-7j3l347","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用户可以完成注册登录、JWT 鉴权、电影搜索、评分收藏、浏览记录这些基础功能\n在此之上，我做了 AI 找电影能力，支持用户直接输入“想看节奏快、不压抑的高分悬疑片”这类自然语言系统会先做语义解析，再做候选影片筛选，如果本地库里没有，再走远程补抓和降级展示"}]},{"ID":"20260516161850-e9ppd9j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260516161850-e9ppd9j","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么用 React+Vite+FastAPI 进行开发"}]},{"ID":"20260516163705-v3l534v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516163705-v3l534v","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先，这套技术栈前后端职责很清晰\nReact 适合做交互复杂的前端页面，组件化开发效率高，页面状态管理也比较自然\n后端我用 FastAPI，因为它写接口非常快，代码结构清楚，而且天然适合做前后端分离项目\n前端专注界面和交互，后端专注数据和业务逻辑"}]},{"ID":"20260516163705-txb71bj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516163705-txb71bj","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其次，Vite 主要解决的是前端开发体验问题\n它启动快、热更新快，项目一大优势会很明显，开发调试效率比传统脚手架高很多\n对我来说，这意味着能把更多时间放在业务实现上，而不是等编译、等构建"}]},{"ID":"20260516163705-s6c96wg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516163705-s6c96wg","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再一个，FastAPI 的优势是性能和规范性都比较好\n它基于 Python，开发效率高，接口定义清晰，还自带 Swagger 文档，这对前后端联调特别友好\n像电影评分这种项目，本质上就是用户、电影、评分、评论这些数据接口交互\nFastAPI 很适合快速搭建、后续扩展也方便"}]},{"ID":"20260516163705-fkjyejv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516163705-fkjyejv","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前端用 React + Vite 保证用户体验和开发效率，后端用 FastAPI 保证接口开发速度和可维护性\n对于一个电影评分网站来说，这套方案既能快速落地，也方便后面继续加功能\n比如搜索、推荐、用户画像这些"}]},{"ID":"20260516170103-9kfmq9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516170103-9kfmq9h","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SQLAlchemy 可以简单理解成："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Python 里专门用来操作数据库的工具"}]},{"ID":"20260516170108-9369fy8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260516170108-9369fy8","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么用 SQLite 不用 MySQL"}]},{"ID":"20260516181847-6ts2xzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516181847-6ts2xzi","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目我在开发阶段选择 SQLite，主要是因为它更轻量\n不需要单独安装和维护数据库服务，开箱即用，特别适合这种个人项目\n像电影评分网站前期重点其实是先把用户、电影、评分、评论这些核心功能跑通\n这时候用 SQLite 可以明显降低环境搭建成本，提高开发效率"}]},{"ID":"20260516181847-pppnf78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516181847-pppnf78","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外，这个项目早期并发量不高，数据规模也不算大，SQLite 已经能满足需求\n对当时的阶段来说，优先解决功能落地，比一开始就上更重的数据库更实际"}]},{"ID":"20260516181847-ms08lsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516181847-ms08lsi","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然，SQLite 更偏开发和小规模场景，如果后面项目要正式上线、用户量上来，或者并发写入变多我会再切到 MySQL 所以这不是说 MySQL 不好，而是我当时是根据项目阶段和实际需求做技术选型"}]},{"ID":"20260528104827-700217b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260528104827-700217b","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你这个项目里，影片的向量数据是怎么存储的？"}]},{"ID":"20260528104852-1efgh46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260528104852-1efgh46","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"影片的向量数据我没有放到独立的向量数据库，比如 Milvus、Pinecone 这种\n而是先做了一个更轻量、工程上更稳的方案：\n直接存到业务数据库的 movie_embeddings 表\n每部电影对应一条向量记录，跟电影主表是关联关系\n这样数据管理、回填、排查都比较直接"}]},{"ID":"20260528110614-wpc8y5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260528110614-wpc8y5a","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体存储上，当前实现是把 embedding 结果以 JSON 数组的形式落库\n开发环境默认是项目里的 movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"rating.db，也就是 SQLite\n如果后面切到 PostgreSQL，表结构和读写链路也能平滑迁过去"}]},{"ID":"20260528110807-a5ldgyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260528110807-a5ldgyv","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"现在的向量数据本质上是跟业务数据共库存储的"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n没有额外引入一套独立向量基础设施"}]},{"ID":"20260528111357-6zt3xnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260528111357-6zt3xnj","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整个链路是这样的：\n先把电影的标题、简介这些信息拼成文本，调用 embedding 接口生成向量\n然后通过离线脚本或后台接口批量写入 movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embeddings\n检索的时候，再把候选电影的向量读出来，在服务层做相似度计算，拿这个分数参与推荐排序"}]},{"ID":"20260516183501-8g0jejw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260516183501-8g0jejw","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这个项目里，你认为最有技术含量的点是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260516183502-xqhilrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516183502-xqhilrx","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目是一个 AI 电影发现平台，前端用 React + Vite，后端用 FastAPI + SQLAlchemy\n核心目标不是只做一个电影列表页，而是把“自然语言找电影”这件事做成完整链路"}]},{"ID":"20260516183516-qt20zlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260516183516-qt20zlp","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用户可以完成注册登录、JWT 鉴权、电影搜索、评分收藏、浏览记录这些基础功能\n在此之上，我做了 AI 找电影能力，支持用户直接输入“想看节奏快、不压抑的高分悬疑片”这类自然语言，系统会先做语义解析，再做候选影片筛选，如果本地库里没有，再走远程补抓和降级展示"}]},{"ID":"20260518093102-dbfo9vz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260518093102-dbfo9vz","updated":"20261006125153"}},{"ID":"20260518090746-ng6uw5e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518090746-ng6uw5e","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这个项目解决的核心问题是什么？为什么不只是电影评分站？"}]},{"ID":"20260518091552-fzekxts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518091552-fzekxts","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目表面上是电影评分网站，但我实际把它往“AI 电影发现平台”方向做了\n传统评分站更偏信息展示，用户仍然要自己筛片\n我想解决的是“我今晚想看什么”这个决策问题\n所以我在基础的电影列表、详情、评分、收藏、历史记录之上\n增加了自然语言搜索、相似电影推荐、个性化推荐和推荐理由生成\n这样用户不需要只靠片名搜索，可以直接输入模糊需求\n比如“想看节奏快、不压抑、适合晚上放松的电影”，系统会给出更接近真实观影场景的结果"}]},{"ID":"20260518091628-w97jjyr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518091628-w97jjyr","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"你整个系统的架构怎么分层"}]},{"ID":"20260518092742-ss0qpit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518092742-ss0qpit","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我按前后端分离和服务职责拆分\n前端是 React + Vite，负责路由、页面渲染、鉴权态管理和接口调用\n后端是 FastAPI，负责认证、电影数据查询、收藏/历史、AI 搜索、推荐、播放管理等 API\n数据库层用 SQLAlchemy 管理模型和持久化\n服务层再细分成认证服务、搜索解析、推荐、海报缓存、播放链接补全、电影同步等模块\n此外还有脚本层，负责批量导入电影、生成 embedding、重算相似电影、迁移 PostgreSQL\n这种分层的好处是控制器薄、业务逻辑集中、脚本任务和在线请求解耦，后续扩展更容易"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-empdzud","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-empdzud","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么前端选 React + Vite，后端选 FastAPI？"}]},{"ID":"20260518093148-7qwrr1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093148-7qwrr1c","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"React 适合组件化页面开发，路由和状态管理也成熟；Vite 冷启动快，适合这种中小型前后端分离项目\n后端选 FastAPI 是因为它对 REST API 场景非常高效，类型标注和 Pydantic 校验配合得很好\n接口定义清晰，开发速度快\n对我这个项目来说，FastAPI 很适合快速承载认证、电影查询、推荐和 AI 接口\n而且后续要接脚本和 AI 服务时也比较自然"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-vxqudlb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-vxqudlb","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"电影数据从哪里来？抓取、清洗、去重、入库怎么做？"}]},{"ID":"20260518124539-8kjwyv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518124539-8kjwyv1","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目的数据来源不是单一接口，而是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"通过抓取和同步逻辑"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"逐步构建本地电影库\n整体流程是先从外部源抓原始电影信息，再做字段标准化\n比如标题、原始标题、导演、演员、年份、简介、评分、海报等\n之后根据外部 ID 或标题做去重和匹配\n最后通过同步服务 upsert 到本地库\nupsert 就是 update + insert 的合并操作"}]},{"ID":"20260518124645-zhkgp2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518124645-zhkgp2r","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的目标不是每次请求都依赖外部接口，而是尽量沉淀到本地数据库里\n这样查询更快，也方便后续做 embedding、推荐和日志分析"}]},{"ID":"20260518140014-dvyttu1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518140014-dvyttu1","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"讲一下爬虫模块"}]},{"ID":"20260518140035-6le7w85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518140035-6le7w85","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的设计思路不是把它当成一个独立的小工具，而是把它当成电影网站后端的一个“数据供给模块”来做\n所以我一开始就明确，爬虫的目标不是单纯把网页内容抓下来，而是要稳定地给系统补充电影数据\n项目里核心实际放在 MovieSpider 这个类里，爬虫承担的是整个片库的冷启动和后续补充工作"}]},{"ID":"20260518140733-ekbcy13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518140733-ekbcy13","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实现上，我采用的是“能调接口就调接口，接口不行再抓页面”的策略\n因为接般直接返回 JSON，字段结构比较清晰，比如标题、评分、海报地址这些数据通常都是现成的\n解析成本低，也不太依赖页结构，所以稳定性更好"}]},{"ID":"20260518141705-t91uoye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518141705-t91uoye","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目里第三方站点并不稳定，页面会改、接口会变\n所以我不会把系统压在一个单一入口上，而是尽量做多方案兜底，保证片库同步能力尽可能可用"}]},{"ID":"20260518141825-2afua8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518141825-2afua8s","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"抓回来的数据我没有直接返回给前端，而是先进入同步层，也就是 MovieSyncService\n这一层很关键，因为爬虫原始数据通常都不够干净，也不够统一\n比如不同来源的电影 ID 格式不一样，有的是豆瓣 ID、有的是猫眼 ID，所以我会先做标准化\n除此之外，这一层还会顺带处理海报问题，比如有的电影只有标题没有海报地址\n我会再去调瓣的联想接口补海报，然后把海报缓存到本地\n这样做的好处是，爬虫抓到的数据不是次性的\n是会沉淀成系统的标准化库，后搜索、推荐、详情页都能反复复"}]},{"ID":"20260518142711-f6oicw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518142711-f6oicw7","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再往上一层是调度层，负责把爬虫能力接入到真实业务流程里\n比如项目启动时，如果数据库还是空的，就会自动在后台线程里预加载一批电影\n再比如用户在搜索页搜一部电影，本地数据库里查不到时，后端不会直接返回空\n而是触发远程搜索，把瓣搜索结果抓回来，同步进数据库，再重新查本地数据返回给前端"}]},{"ID":"20260518145916-m5t0iuw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518145916-m5t0iuw","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中怎么做反爬的"}]},{"ID":"20260518145923-oq1cznt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518145923-oq1cznt","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目里我没有做特别重的反反爬，对抗思路比较轻量\n主要做了几件事：\n第一，请求时加浏览器常用请求头，比如 User-Agent 和 Referer，让请求更像正常用户访问\n第二，优先调网站本身的接口，因为 JSON 比直接抓页面更稳定\n第三，尽量少抓，数据先落本地库，只有冷启动、本地搜不到或者后台刷新时才再去爬\n减少高频请求触发限流"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-fj9swde","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-fj9swde","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用户注册登录怎么做？JWT 放哪、怎么校验？"}]},{"ID":"20260522142919-v5336d9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522142919-v5336d9","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后端提供注册和登录接口，密码不明文存储，而是经过哈希后写入数据库\n登录成功后签发 JWT，前端保存 token，并在后续请求里通过 Authorization 头带上\n后端的依赖函数会解析和校验 token，拿到当前用户\n需要登录的接口通过受保护依赖强制鉴权，可选登录场景则允许匿名访问但能识别当前用户\n前端路由层也有 ProtectedRoute，避免未登录用户进入个人中心或后台页面\n这样做的好处是前后端职责明确，接口既支持鉴权又保留匿名访问能力"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-xbjl73g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-xbjl73g","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"你的数据库表为什么这样设计？"}]},{"ID":"20260522143143-oqhbjpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522143143-oqhbjpl","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我把核心实体和行为拆开设计"}]},{"ID":"20260522143528-2s9q5ps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522143528-2s9q5ps","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"users 管用户身份\nmovies 管电影主数据\nratings 存用户对电影的评分\n用 user"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"id + movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"id 做唯一约束，防止重复评分"}]},{"ID":"20260522143909-chu5rt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522143909-chu5rt8","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"favorites 和 watch"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"history 分别表示用户收藏和行为轨迹\nsearch"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"logs 记录搜索词、解析结果、结果数量和延迟，用来分析搜索效果\nrecommendation"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"logs 记录推荐场景和返回结果，用来评估推荐\nuser"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"profiles 存偏好画像 movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embeddings 存电影向量\n这样拆开后，模型职责清晰，既能支撑业务，也便于后续做推荐和分析"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-xy5wijh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-xy5wijh","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"AI 搜索和普通关键词搜索的区别是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260522145018-n2d7hhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522145018-n2d7hhs","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"普通搜索本质上是基于片名或关键词的匹配，适合用户知道电影名或者演员名的场景\nAI 搜索处理的是模糊意图，比如情绪、节奏、类型、观影场景\n我的 AI 搜索不是单纯让模型“聊天”，而是先把用户意图结构化\n再给出候选电影，并尽量映射回本地电影库"}]},{"ID":"20260522145107-ytzswtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522145107-ytzswtm","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样结果既保留自然语言理解能力，也能保持系统可控、可落库、可追踪"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-4iho4j7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-4iho4j7","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一次 AI 搜索请求的完整流程是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260522150722-ocj59ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522150722-ocj59ka","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一次 AI 搜索请求，前端会把用户输入的一句自然语言，比如“想看轻松一点的高分科幻片”\n发到后端的 /api/ai/search。如果用户已经登录，请求里还会带上 JWT；没登录也可以正常搜索"}]},{"ID":"20260522150722-i8yi965","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522150722-i8yi965","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后端拿到这句话后，直接调用大模型\n让 AI 按用户描述返回几部具体电影，以及每部的推荐理由\n也就是说，这一步本质上是“用户说需求，AI 直接给片单”"}]},{"ID":"20260522150722-v9kcg1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522150722-v9kcg1g","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拿到 AI 返回的候选电影后，后端会再去和本地电影库做匹配\n本地没有的话，就去远程数据源补库，再把真实电影数据返回给前端\n最后后端会记录这次搜索日志，前端再把结果和推荐理由展示出来"}]},{"ID":"20260522150824-v2lqfzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522150824-v2lqfzf","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体流程就是：用户提需求，AI 先选片，后端再把片单落成站内可展示的数据"}]},{"ID":"20260522151130-7oug5o5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260522151130-7oug5o5","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后端是怎么调用大模型的"}]},{"ID":"20260522151145-986zu5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522151145-986zu5c","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一次 AI 搜索请求进来后，后端直接把用户的自然语言需求交给大模型做“选片”\n调用 /api/ai/search 对应的服务层，把这句话原样作为 user prompt 发给模型"}]},{"ID":"20260522151145-40kwp5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522151145-40kwp5m","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在调用模型之前，后端会先准备好一个固定的 system prompt\n这个 prompt 的作用不是让模型自由聊天，而是把它约束成一个“电影选片助手”：\n要求它严格根据用户描述返回几部具体电影，而且输出必须是结构化的 JSON\n每一项都要包含片名、年份、导演和推荐理由\n这样做的目的，是把模型输出从“聊天文本”变成“可直接进入业务流程的候选片单”"}]},{"ID":"20260522151145-zvfa52e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522151145-zvfa52e","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际调用时，服务层会通过 OpenAI 兼容 client 去请求模型，优先走 chat.completions\n并且把温度设为 0，尽量保证结果稳定\n同时加上超时控制和格式约束，避免模型输出发散"}]},{"ID":"20260522153038-dkja0oj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522153038-dkja0oj","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大模型输出会作为接口响应内容返回给后端，后端再从响应对象里把文本取出来\n解析成 JSON，转换成程序内部可用的电影候选数据"}]},{"ID":"20260522153421-7etrk2n","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260522153421-7etrk2n","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260522153421-en7cb5l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260522153421-en7cb5l","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260522153421-rp16s68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522153421-rp16s68","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后端先主动发一个 HTTP/API 请求给大模型"}]}]},{"ID":"20260522153421-exzy1tt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260522153421-exzy1tt","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260522153421-y8p07d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522153421-y8p07d0","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大模型处理完后，把结果放在响应对象里返回"}]}]},{"ID":"20260522153421-0yzu0vw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260522153421-0yzu0vw","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260522153421-xy725fy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522153421-xy725fy","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后端代码再从这个响应对象里把文本取出来"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260522151841-bi868y4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260522151841-bi868y4","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"后端系统提示词：\n\n你是电影选片助手。你的任务不是泛泛推荐高分电影，而是严格根据用户描述挑出最符合条件的具体影片。\n\n请只返回 JSON 数组，不要输出任何解释、标题、代码块标记或 markdown。\n\n输出格式：\n[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"电影名\",\n    \"year\": \"电影年份\",\n    \"director\": \"导演名\",\n    \"reason\": \"一句简短中文理由\"\n  }\n]\n\n硬性规则：\n1. 返回 3 到 8 部电影。\n2. 每个元素都必须包含 title、year、director、reason。\n3. year 必须是整数；没有把握时填 null。\n4. director 没把握时可填空字符串。\n5. reason 只写 1 句中文，20 到 50 字，不要空话。\n6. 只推荐真实存在且较容易检索到的电影。\n7. 不要编造演员、导演、年份、剧情。\n\n筛选优先级：\n1. 如果用户提到了演员、导演、系列、国家、时代、风格、题材、情绪，这些约束优先于“高分”。\n2. 如果用户明确提到某个演员或导演，优先推荐此人参与的电影；不要忽略这个条件改推其他名片。\n3. 如果用户明确提到类型或风格，例如“搞笑”“喜剧”“悬疑”“科幻”，必须优先满足这个条件。\n4. 只有在同时满足人物和题材时才优先返回；不要因为影片更有名就放宽条件。\n\n严格限制：\n1. 当用户要求很具体时，不要退化成“高分电影榜单”。\n2. 如果某部电影与用户条件明显不相关，就绝对不要返回。\n3. 如果能确定的符合条件影片不足 3 部，可以少返回，宁可少也不要乱凑。\n4. 如果用户说“邓超的搞笑电影”，应优先考虑邓超主演或导演、且明显属于喜剧/搞笑方向的电影；不要返回与邓超无关的高分片。\n5. 如果用户说“周星驰的无厘头电影”，应优先返回周星驰相关且符合无厘头风格的作品；不要泛化成普通喜剧。\n\n输出前自检：\n1. 检查每一部电影是否真的符合用户描述。\n2. 删除所有不满足核心约束的影片。\n3. 再输出最终 JSON 数组。\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-hugn1aa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-hugn1aa","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么不直接让大模型输出最终答案，而是做候选推荐 + 本地匹配 + 补库？"}]},{"ID":"20260522153346-ioz0gbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522153346-ioz0gbh","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果完全让模型直接输出，问题是结果不可控\n也无法复用已有详情页、收藏、评分、播放链接这些能力"}]},{"ID":"20260522153626-docm2d5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522153626-docm2d5","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我采用“候选推荐 + 本地匹配”的方式，是为了让 AI 成为召回入口，而不是替代整个业务系统\n这样推荐结果最终仍然落在本地 movie 实体上\n能和现有页面、数据库、日志和推荐链路打通\n如果本地缺失，再补库，兼顾灵活性和可维护性"}]},{"ID":"20260522153648-msevqwz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260522153648-msevqwz","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果大模型返回库里没有的电影怎么办？"}]},{"ID":"20260522153650-eoretme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522153650-eoretme","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先尝试本地匹配，匹配不到就走 remote backfill\n去远程源按标题检索并拉取电影数据，然后 upsert 到本地"}]},{"ID":"20260522160337-ot470y5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522160337-ot470y5","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直接拿 AI 已经给出的电影片名去查远程数据源，这样目标更明确，噪声更小"}]},{"ID":"20260522160337-6fcktum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522160337-6fcktum","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实现上我优先调外部电影搜索 API，按标题去请求 TMDB 这类接口，拿到结构化的电影数据\n比如标题、原名、海报、简介、年份、评分这些字段\n这样比直接爬网页更稳定，也更方便后端处理\n如果 API 这条路拿不到结果，代码里还会再回退到网页搜索，用页面解析做兜底"}]},{"ID":"20260522160337-453nzgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522160337-453nzgm","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拿到远程结果后，后端会再做一次标题匹配，尽量确认补到的是同一部电影\n确认之后，我会把这些远程字段统一映射成项目内部的电影结构，然后用 upsert 写回本地库\n这样这次 AI 推荐不只是临时展示一下，而是真的沉淀成了一条本地电影数据\n后面详情、评分、收藏这些功能都能直接复用"}]},{"ID":"20260522154902-84on91x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522154902-84on91x","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果远程也找不到，我不会让接口直接报错，而是保留一个 direct AI 结果作为兜底\n让用户至少能看到候选信息和推荐理由\n也就是说我把“严格落库”和“用户体验兜底”都考虑了"}]},{"ID":"20260522160503-232jvdv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260522160503-232jvdv","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么控制 AI 返回格式稳定？"}]},{"ID":"20260522160507-kxpdmij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522160507-kxpdmij","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我在 prompt 里明确要求返回 JSON 结构，并且限制字段\n比如 title、year、director、reason\n实现上优先调用支持结构化输出的接口，并在服务层做 JSON 解析和字段校验\n如果不是列表或者缺少必要字段，就视为无效响应\n第一次失败还会重试一次，最终不行就降级"}]},{"ID":"20260522160655-1wmjduu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522160655-1wmjduu","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就是说，prompt 约束只是第一层，真正兜底的是程序解析和失败分支"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-sci5ioi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-sci5ioi","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"AI 超时、空结果、胡乱推荐时怎么降级？"}]},{"ID":"20260522160724-o5qiz3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522160724-o5qiz3j","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我做了几个层次的降级\n第一，调用设置超时，避免请求无限挂起\n第二，如果第一次空结果或非法 JSON，会自动重试\n第三，如果模型不可用或者超时，接口会返回明确的 provider/fallback 状态，而不是让前端无响应第四，即使无法落库，也可以返回 direct AI 候选结果"}]},{"ID":"20260522160745-vua6g2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522160745-vua6g2n","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心原则是：宁可降低智能程度，也不要让用户完全没有结果"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-4qkxuh7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-4qkxuh7","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"推荐系统怎么做？是纯规则、向量召回，还是 LLM 直接推荐？"}]},{"ID":"20260522161108-3542pdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522161108-3542pdf","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我没有直接用 LLM 做主推荐，而是把它放在理解和解释层\n推荐主链路分两类：\n未登录用户走高分热门兜底\n已登录用户先构建用户画像，再基于偏好生成查询，由向量检索在候选电影中打分召回\n同时结合评分和时间等因素排序"}]},{"ID":"20260522161455-95unlcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522161455-95unlcr","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相似电影推荐优先使用缓存好的相似度表，没有缓存时再用 embedding fallback 计算\n这样做的原因是推荐主逻辑需要稳定、可控、低成本"}]},{"ID":"20260522162719-fnd3s34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522162719-fnd3s34","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果 embedding 服务可用，系统会先把 query 转成向量\n再去数据库里取候选电影已经存好的 embedding\n最后用余弦相似度算 query 和每部电影之间的接近程度，按分数从高到低取 TopK\n这一步本质上是在回答一个问题：\n哪几部电影在“语义上”最接近这个用户当前的兴趣\n相比纯关键词匹配，它的好处是用户没明确说出完全一样的词，系统也可能找到意思接近的内容"}]},{"ID":"20260522162719-b7vcho0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522162719-b7vcho0","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我这里还专门做了降级设计\n因为线上不能把推荐链路完全绑死在 embedding 服务上，所以如果没有 embedding client\n或者某些电影还没生成向量，系统就会自动退回到 lexical fallback\n也就是基于标题、简介、导演、演员这些文本字段做词项匹配"}]},{"ID":"20260522162514-6rdk43u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522162514-6rdk43u","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相似电影推荐则是另一种思路\n这个场景很高频，比如用户看完一部电影，马上想知道“还有没有类似的”\n所以我优先用提前算好的相似度缓存表，查起来就是直接读结果，速度快、结果也稳定\n如果缓存里没有，再用 embedding 做一次 fallback 计算，临时找出内容最接近的电影\n这样设计的好处是，大部分请求都能低成本、低延迟返回，少数没命中的情况也不会功能失效"}]},{"ID":"20260522163259-u93f8ph","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260522163259-u93f8ph","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"电影的 embedding 是怎么算出来的"}]},{"ID":"20260522163259-usq93b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522163259-usq93b6","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"电影 embedding 这块，我不是实时现算的，而是离线提前算好\n具体做法是先把一部电影的标题、导演、演员、地区、年份、评分、剧情简介这些信息拼成一段文本\n相当于先把电影整理成一个完整的内容描述，再送去 embedding 模型转成向量，最后存到数据库里"}]},{"ID":"20260522163259-6uiwreo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522163259-6uiwreo","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样后面做推荐时，只需要把用户兴趣转成 query 向量，再和电影向量做相似度计算，就能找到语义上最接近的电影\n这样设计的好处是线上响应快、成本低，而且比纯关键词匹配更准确"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-eswpv4r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-eswpv4r","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"冷启动怎么解决？"}]},{"ID":"20260522163325-ld1ab1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522163325-ld1ab1t","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冷启动分两种"}]},{"ID":"20260522163502-ky05xku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522163502-ky05xku","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未登录冷启动，我直接返回高分热门电影，保证首页有稳定内容\n新登录但行为不足的用户，我会用初步画像或者高分电影作为默认召回\n再逐步用收藏、评分、历史、搜索行为更新画像\n冷启动阶段重点不是“绝对个性化”，而是先保证结果质量和可用性，随着行为积累再提高个性化程度"}]},{"ID":"20260522164336-idrid11","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260522164336-idrid11","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"相似电影推荐怎么做？"}]},{"ID":"20260522164336-auum48l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522164336-auum48l","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我有两层策略"}]},{"ID":"20260522164336-m1zr1k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522164336-m1zr1k7","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优先层是读取 movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"similarities 缓存表，直接返回已经计算好的相似电影，这样接口快\n如果缓存不存在，就用当前电影的标题和简介作为查询文本，对候选电影做向量检索，选出 topK 结果\n然后把结果带上解释，比如题材、剧情摘要和整体风格接近\n这个方案兼顾了性能和效果，也方便后续批量离线重算"}]},{"ID":"20260522164336-lecqg8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522164336-lecqg8g","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后端这边其实就是先把电影的标题、导演、演员、年份、简介这些信息拼成一段文本\n然后调用 embedding 接口把这段文本转成向量，存到 movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embeddings 表里"}]},{"ID":"20260522164336-wxn5s6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522164336-wxn5s6f","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"做推荐时，再把用户偏好生成的 query 用同样方式转成向量，和电影向量做余弦相似度计算\n找出最接近的电影如果接口调用失败，还有本地 fallback 兜底，保证推荐链路不会断"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-wpicun3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-wpicun3","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么要有"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"user_profile"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"和"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"movie_embeddings"}]},{"ID":"20260522163813-th3hbql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522163813-th3hbql","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embeddings 是把电影的文本信息转成可检索向量，解决“语义相近但关键词不重合”的问题\nuser"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"profile 则把用户的收藏、评分、历史等行为沉淀成偏好摘要\n比如喜欢的类型、国家、年份区间、时长偏好等\n两者配合后，推荐不再只是“全站高分”，而是“用用户偏好去检索更相关的电影”\n这也是从信息展示系统升级到推荐系统的关键"}]},{"ID":"20260522164057-vwey3vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260522164057-vwey3vt","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embedding 模型本质上是把文本映射到向量空间的编码模型\n我们把电影内容编码成 movie embedding，把用户偏好编码成 query embedding，再通过余弦相似度做召回\n这样解决的是语义匹配问题，而不是让大模型直接做推荐决策"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-usw0f27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-usw0f27","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"工程与设计"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17. 为什么"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"rating"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要单独成表？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：因为评分是用户和电影之间的多对多关系，而且会持续增长、更新，还有唯一性约束和时间维度。如果把评分塞进 users 或 movies，模型会失真，也不利于查询统计。单独成表后，可以方便做用户评分记录、电影平均分、用户偏好分析以及后续推荐特征抽取。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-tw2xtm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-tw2xtm4","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18. 为什么"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"favorites"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"和"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"watch\\_history"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要拆开？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：因为两者语义不同。收藏代表显式偏好，通常强于点击；观影历史代表行为轨迹，可能只是浏览、点击、想看或已看。拆开后可以给不同权重，也更方便做埋点分析和推荐建模。如果合成一张表，会导致业务含义混乱。"}]},{"ID":"20260528104814-80d9uxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260528104814-80d9uxg","updated":"20261006125153"}},{"ID":"20260518093051-f7s0lwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-f7s0lwv","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19. 为什么"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"MovieSimilarity"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要做缓存表？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：因为相似电影计算相对重，尤其候选集大了以后不适合每次实时算。把结果缓存到表里后，详情页查询会非常快，也便于离线批量重建。这个设计本质上是把“计算密集型逻辑”前移到后台任务，提高线上接口稳定性。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-v3malek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-v3malek","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20. 为什么 embedding 先存 JSON？优缺点是什么？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：当前阶段存 JSON 是为了开发简单，和 SQLite 兼容，便于先把 AI 检索链路跑通。优点是实现成本低、迁移快；缺点是数据库层无法高效做向量索引和相似度查询，所以真正规模化时我会迁到 PostgreSQL + pgvector，把 embedding 存成向量类型，让召回计算下沉到数据库层。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-5xdi30l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-5xdi30l","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21. 为什么写了这么多脚本？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：因为我不希望把数据准备、模型构建、补库、重算逻辑都塞进在线 API。比如初始化数据库、同步电影、导入播放链接、回填海报缓存、生成 embedding、重算相似度，这些都更适合作为离线或运维脚本。这样在线请求更轻，职责更清晰，线上故障面也更小。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-e53j4xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-e53j4xl","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22. 启动时为什么有 preload catalog 的后台线程？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：这是为了优化新环境初始化体验。如果数据库里还没有电影数据，而且也没有真实用户，我会在启动阶段异步预加载目录数据，让系统首次启动后能尽快有可浏览内容。之所以放后台线程，是为了避免阻塞 API 启动，保证服务先可用，再逐步补齐基础数据。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-i3u5o4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-i3u5o4b","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23. 你的 CORS、静态资源、接口路由怎么组织？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：CORS 通过环境变量优先配置，开发阶段允许本地多个前端端口访问；静态资源通过 /static 挂载，主要承载本地海报缓存；接口按业务域拆成多个 router，比如 auth、users、movies、favorites、history、ai、recommendations、admin"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ai、proxy。这样做的目的是让入口文件只负责装配，业务逻辑落在各自模块里。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-vxh34n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-vxh34n6","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24. SQLite 为什么不够？你怎么迁到 PostgreSQL？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：SQLite 适合本地开发和单机验证，但在并发写入、复杂查询、扩展性和向量能力上都有限。我的迁移思路是先保持 SQLAlchemy 模型层稳定，再切换数据库连接，并提供迁移脚本把电影、用户、评分、收藏、历史、日志等数据导入 PostgreSQL；随后引入 pgvector，把 embedding 和相似检索下沉到数据库层。也就是说我会尽量保持应用层 API 不变，先替换存储能力。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-k6ezb58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-k6ezb58","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"风险与优化"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"/admin/playback"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"现在只是登录保护，管理员权限怎么补？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：这是我当前实现里一个明确可以继续完善的点。现在前端路由是受保护的，但严格来说这不等于管理员鉴权。更完整的方案是在 users 表增加角色字段，比如 user / admin，后端管理接口增加角色校验依赖，前端只是做展示层拦截，真正权限控制必须以后端为准。面试里我会主动指出这一点，说明我区分了“登录态校验”和“授权控制”。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-p5ra9w1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-p5ra9w1","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26. AI 搜索成本和延迟怎么控制？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：我的策略是把 AI 放在必要环节，而不是每次都全链路依赖模型。比如 query summarize 可以走本地规则解析，只有 curated search 才调用模型；同时设置超时、限制候选数量、失败重试次数有限，结果再尽量映射到本地库减少后续外部依赖。后续如果要进一步控成本，我会加缓存、热门 query 预计算和埋点分析，识别高频需求。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-pw4x6ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-pw4x6ui","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27. 在线请求里触发抓取/补库会不会拖慢接口？为什么不做异步任务队列？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：会，所以这是一个典型的 MVP 和生产化之间的权衡。当前 remote backfill 的好处是链路闭环快，能快速验证“AI 推荐到本地落库”的流程；缺点是外部依赖会拉长接口耗时。生产化时我会把补库改成异步任务，接口先返回已有结果或占位信息，再由任务队列补齐数据。也就是说我知道现在方案的边界，它是为了先验证业务闭环，而不是最终形态。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-21c1yol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-21c1yol","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28. 当前系统最大的性能瓶颈在哪？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：当前最明显的瓶颈不是普通电影列表，而是 AI 搜索和相似推荐链路中的外部依赖与 Python 层计算。具体包括模型调用延迟、remote backfill、embedding 检索未下沉数据库、相似电影 fallback 的候选遍历等。短期优化我会先做缓存和离线预计算；中期会迁 PostgreSQL + pgvector；长期再考虑异步任务和更细的埋点监控。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-gj37l2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-gj37l2i","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29. 如果明天要上线，你最先补哪三件事？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：第一，补齐管理员角色和后端权限控制；第二，把高耗时的补库和重算逻辑改成异步任务，减少接口抖动；第三，上 PostgreSQL，并增加日志监控、限流和错误告警。如果只能再补一点，我会加搜索和推荐效果埋点，因为没有数据闭环就无法持续优化。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-5o3ovu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-5o3ovu6","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"测试与项目亮点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30. 你怎么做测试？前后端分别测了什么？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：前端我用 Vitest 和 Testing Library，覆盖了页面、组件、AuthContext、API 封装以及部分集成行为；后端我用 pytest，测试了启动、数据库、电影 API、AI 搜索、推荐、播放管理、海报缓存、补库脚本等关键链路。我的测试思路不是只测纯函数，而是优先覆盖“最容易回归、最影响用户体验”的路径，比如登录态、搜索结果、推荐接口和后台能力。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-et1xbx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-et1xbx8","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31. 你最有价值的一条测试是什么？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：如果只选一条，我会选 AI 搜索或推荐链路的接口测试。因为这类功能跨了请求参数、服务编排、数据库读取和返回结构，最容易因为改动某一层而破坏整体契约。测这种接口比只测单个工具函数更能反映系统稳定性。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-jwt7x0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-jwt7x0t","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32. 你遇到的最难问题是什么？怎么解决的？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：最难的不是把页面写出来，而是把“AI 推荐”从一个演示能力做成系统能力。核心难点是模型输出不稳定、库内电影不完整、外部数据质量不一致。我最后的解决思路是把链路拆成几步：模型负责给候选，本地库负责承接，匹配不到再补库，同时全程记录日志和延迟，并为超时、空结果、无效 JSON 做降级。这个过程让我比较明确地把“智能能力”和“工程可控性”分开了。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-1f24ngp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-1f24ngp","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33. 这个项目里，普通搜索、AI 搜索、推荐，这三者的边界是什么？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：普通搜索解决“我知道我要找什么”的问题，重在精确查找；AI 搜索解决“我不知道片名，但知道需求”的问题，重在意图理解；推荐解决“系统主动给我可能喜欢什么”的问题，重在个性化召回。三者都服务于找片，但触发方式、输入类型和系统责任不同。我在架构上也把它们拆成独立接口和服务，避免逻辑混在一起。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-zbelmsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-zbelmsx","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34. 你说用了向量搜索，那 embedding 怎么生成和更新？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：电影 embedding 不是在线现算，而是通过离线脚本批量构建。输入通常是电影标题、简介、导演、演员、类型等文本拼接，然后调用 embedding 模型生成向量，写入 movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embeddings。当电影主信息发生明显变化，或者模型版本升级时，我会通过 content"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"version 和脚本重建向量，避免线上接口承担高成本计算。"}]},{"ID":"20260518093051-82exbp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260518093051-82exbp9","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35. 你说有推荐理由，这个 reason 是规则生成还是模型生成？为什么这么选？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n答：当前更偏规则和模板生成，而不是每条都调用 LLM。原因很直接：推荐理由的价值是帮助用户理解结果，不需要每次都付出高延迟和高成本。规则生成能结合类型、画像、查询意图和电影元数据做出足够可读的解释，稳定、快、便宜。如果后续要增强表达自然度，我会把 LLM 放在离线生成或可选增强层，而不是主链路强依赖。"}]},{"ID":"20260604211000-yg19llm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260604211000-yg19llm","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中影片向量数据是怎么算的"}]},{"ID":"20260604211000-48wlki9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260604211000-48wlki9","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目里的影片向量，本质上是把一部电影的文本信息整理成一段描述\n然后送给 embedding 模型生成一个数字向量\n参与拼接的字段主要有片名、原标题、导演、演员、国家、语言、年份、时长、豆瓣评分和简介\n也就是说，它不是直接拿某一个字段算\n而是先把整部电影的关键信息合成一段文本，再做向量化"}]},{"ID":"20260604211000-rlv9e74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260604211000-rlv9e74","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生成时优先走配置好的 embedding 接口，模型名来自环境变量\n默认是 doubao-embedding-vision\n如果接口没配好、没有 API Key，或者请求失败，代码就会降级到一个本地的 deterministic"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embedding 方案，用哈希函数生成固定 64 维的伪向量\n这个降级方案能保证系统继续跑，但语义效果肯定不如真实 embedding"}]},{"ID":"20260604211000-l64jp6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260604211000-l64jp6m","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生成好的结果会存进 movie"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embeddings 表\n里面除了向量本身，还会保存当时用于生成向量的原始文本 content"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"text 和模型名 model"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"name\n向量通常是通过离线脚本或后台接口批量回填，不是每次用户请求时临时给所有电影重算"}]},{"ID":"20260604211000-vemkztw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260604211000-vemkztw","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后续在搜索和推荐里，会把用户查询也转成向量，再和影片向量做余弦相似度计算，相似度越高\n说明语义上越接近"}]},{"ID":"20260604211000-j1imvtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260604211000-j1imvtv","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这套逻辑的核心可以概括成一句话：\n先把电影内容文本化，再做 embedding，最后用向量相似度支撑搜索和推荐"}]},{"ID":"20260604211002-fc1ov2t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260604211002-fc1ov2t","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"向量模型和降级策略具体是怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260604211410-dgtgxuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260604211410-dgtgxuv","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"embedding 直接调用，不需要 system prompt\n因为它不是聊天模型，不负责回答问题，也不会生成一段话，它只做一件事\n就是把输入文本转成一个向量"}]},{"ID":"20260604211410-arpmsyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260604211410-arpmsyv","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我的做法很简单：\n先把电影的标题、导演、演员、年份、简介这些信息拼成一段文本\n然后直接传给 embeddings.create()，模型返回一串向量，这一步就结束了\n没有角色设定，没有提示词，也不用控制输出格式"}]},{"ID":"20260604211430-21fvej7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260604211430-21fvej7","updated":"20261006125153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降级思路：\n先把文本标准化，然后做 sha256 哈希，再把哈希结果切成若干段\n映射成 -1 到 1 之间的数，最后凑成固定 64 维向量\n它不是真正理解语义的 AI 向量，但优点是同一段文本每次都会得到同一个结果\n所以系统还能继续完成排序、推荐和检索流程"}]},{"ID":"20261006172412-2fcgssy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261006172412-2fcgssy","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Linux"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-673mi8b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-673mi8b","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Github"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-fxfr1la","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fxfr1la","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Git 关联设置"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jb7r6ro","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jb7r6ro","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.设备与 github 账号关联"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-pen3a5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-pen3a5v","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1）ssh -T git@github.com\t#测试本机是否与某个账号绑定过\n2）git config –list  \t\t\t\t#查看 git 相关配置文件列表\tgit config –global user.name 用户名\tgit config –global user.email 邮箱\n3）git  init 创建本地仓库\n4）ssh-keygen -t  rsa -C “邮箱”\t#生成本地密文\n5）git remote add origin ssh 地址\t#为仓库 ssh 创建别名，名 origin\n6）git remote remov origin   \t\t#删除别名"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-wmv23hd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-wmv23hd","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.git 三要素"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jffopfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jffopfk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1）仓库\n每个仓库中存储一个工程，包含工程的源代码，工程资源文件，配置文件，许可证，自述文档，逻辑存储结构"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-g7zanms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-g7zanms","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2）分支\n分支用于存储工程实际内容，实际存储单元，每个仓库都会自带一个默认的主分支，可能 master，也可能是 main\n一般分支用于多人协作开发，包含分支创建，分支删除，分支合并，分支选择等\tbrach 相关命令"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xu9z42f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xu9z42f","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3）提交\ncommit 提交习惯，可以帮助开发者很好的备份代码，有完整的开发的流程和脉络，可以保证开发进度，而且配备份代码，可能回溯\n需要拥有良好的提交习惯"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-o60he98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o60he98","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.了解掌握 git 命令，才能很好的使用 git 软件进行版本控制"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xbaehsu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xbaehsu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.本地内容上传云端仓库的过程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nc1igdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nc1igdt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260106204631652"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260106204631652.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3ujn2hd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3ujn2hd","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"git add test.cpp \t#向缓冲区添加数据\ngit rm test.cpp\t   ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"将数据从缓冲区删除"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\ngit restore file \t   ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"将数据还原"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6c71bpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6c71bpq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果云端的版本与本地不一致，导致本地内容无法成功 push，这时先 pull，将版本一致化，而后再推\ngit pull –rebase origin master\n三种方式处理：\tgit rebase –skip\tgit rebase –continue\tgit rebase –abort\ngit push origin master\t#版本处理完毕之后"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-67kg7cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-67kg7cn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"删除\nrm 代码  -rf\ngit rm 代码\ngit commit\ngit push\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t本地仓库内容删除，会同步到云端"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-2lof81q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-2lof81q","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"git clone HTTPS 地址\t\t#打包下载开源工程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cekxugi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cekxugi","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正则技术"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-s4osjwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-s4osjwc","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般用于数据查询，数据匹配，采用贪心算法完成数据的匹配模式\n传统 str 函数，strcmp,strncmp,strstr\n正则语句由特殊符号和表达式构成的特殊语句，采用这个语句匹配目标数据\n支持绝对查询，支持模糊查询\n正则语句是一个描述数据规则的字符串，数据的规则越清晰，使用正则越方便"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-l8mck37","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-l8mck37","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正则表达式符号"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-fl0v8jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fl0v8jo","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"grep\t‘表达式’\t文件名\ngrep  -v \t输出"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不包含"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"指定匹配模式的所有行"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xa51e8m","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xa51e8m","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"c2hlbGw="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"* \t一般以前一个表达式为参照，表示该表达式出现0次或多次\ngrep 'a*' test\t\n\n\\+   以前一个表达式为参照，表示该表达式出现1次或多次    #必须使用转义\ngrep 'a\\+' test\n\n.\t无需参照物，可以表示任意字符一次\n\n？\t表示字符0次或1次\n\n^\t以后一个表达式为参照，该表达式为行首\ngrep '^h' test\n\n$\t以前一个表达式为参照，该表达式为行尾最后一个字符\ngrep 'l$' test\n\n[]\t表达式集合(字符集合)，集合中可以有多个原子，当此集合出现时 表示任意一个元素\ngrep '[abc]' test\ngrep '[a-zA-Z0-9]ood' test\ngrep '[^A-Z]' test\na-z A-Z 0-9 表示不同集合 [^]集合元素取非\n\n\\{n\\}\t 以前一个表达式为参照，表示该表达式连续出现n次\n\\{n,m\\}\t指定频率，n最少连续出现次数，m最大次数\t按最大m匹配，从大到小\n\n\\(power\\)\\+\t创建表达式\ngrep '\\(power\\)\\+'  test\ngrep '^\\(power\\)\\+$'  test\t找行头行尾power\n\ngrep '^1[3-9][0-9]\\{9\\}$'\t找正确手机号\ngrep '^[a-zA-Z0-9]\\{8,15}@[^\\.]\\+\\.(com\\)$'\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4oo7key","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4oo7key","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"匹配模式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1b9nayv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1b9nayv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贪婪模式，非贪婪模式\n贪婪模式：尽可能匹配多个结果返回\n非贪婪模式：匹配一个结果返回\n？可以用于切换非贪婪"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-63c7xis","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-63c7xis","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"程序中使用正则表达式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-60rs9gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-60rs9gq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"include"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ \u003cregex.h\u003e\nregex_t \t#正则类型\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260127142926560"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260127142926560.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n成功返回 0，如果没有结果返回 REG_NOMATCH"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-mpusgvk","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-mpusgvk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003cfcntl.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/mman.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/stat.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cregex.h\u003e\n\nint main(void)\n{\n    // 定义正则表达式字符串，用于匹配HTML中的\u003ca\u003e标签\n    // 正则解读：\n    // \u003ca[^\u003e]+        匹配\u003ca开头，后面跟任意非\u003e的字符（至少1个）\n    // \\?href=\"       匹配href=\"（转义是为了符合C语言字符串语法，实际正则中是href=\"）\n    // \\([^\\\"]\\+\\?\\)  捕获组1：匹配href属性内的内容（任意非\"的字符，至少1个），对应链接地址\n    // \"[^\u003e]+\\?\u003e      匹配href闭合后的剩余标签内容，直到\u003e结束\n    // \u003c\\([^\u003c]\\+\\?\\)  捕获组2：捕获\u003ca\u003e标签内的文本内容，对应链接标题\n    // \u003c/a\u003e           匹配\u003c/a\u003e闭合标签\n    char * regstr = \"\u003ca[^\u003e]+\\\\?href=\\\"\\\\([^\\\"]\\\\+\\\\?\\\\)\\\"[^\u003e]+\\\\?\u003e\u003c\\\\([^\u003c]\\\\+\\\\?\\\\)\u003c/a\u003e\";\n    // -------------- 第一步：文件操作 - 打开文件并获取文件大小 --------------\n    int fd;\n    fd = open(\"test\",O_RDWR);\n    // 通过将文件指针移动到文件末尾，获取文件的总字节大小（lseek返回偏移量，即文件大小）\n    int size = lseek(fd,0,SEEK_END);\n    // -------------- 第二步：内存映射 - 将文件数据映射到进程内存空间 --------------\n    // 定义指向映射内存区域的指针，初始化为NULL\n    char * data = NULL;\n    data = mmap(NULL,size,PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE,MAP_PRIVATE,fd,0);\n    // 文件映射完成后，文件描述符可关闭，不影响已建立的内存映射\n    close(fd);//关闭文件描述符，释放文件相关资源\n    // -------------- 第三步：正则表达式初始化 - 编译正则表达式 --------------\n    // 定义regex_t类型变量，用于存储编译后的正则表达式数据\n    regex_t reg;\n    // 定义正则匹配的捕获组数量（捕获组0是整个匹配的内容，1和2是自定义捕获组，共3个）\n    int regnum = 3;\n    // 定义regmatch_t数组，用于存储每个捕获组的匹配结果（起始偏移量和结束偏移量）\n    regmatch_t match[regnum];\n    regcomp(\u0026reg,regstr,0);\n    // -------------- 第四步：数据存储 - 定义数组存储提取的href和标题 --------------\n    char href[8192];\n    char title[1024];\n    // -------------- 第五步：循环匹配 - 遍历内存中的文件数据，提取所有符合条件的\u003ca\u003e标签 --------------\n    // regexec函数：执行正则匹配，返回0表示匹配成功\n    // 循环条件：只要能从当前data指针位置匹配到符合正则的内容，就继续循环\n    while((regexec(\u0026reg,data,regnum,match,0))==0)\n    {\n        // 匹配成功，先清空href和title数组的原有数据（避免残留脏数据）\n        bzero(href,sizeof(href));  // bzero：将指定内存区域填充为0（字符串结束符'\\0'）\n        bzero(title,sizeof(title));\n        // 提取捕获组1的内容（href链接地址）到href数组\n        // match[1].rm_so：捕获组1匹配内容的起始偏移量（相对于当前data指针）\n        // match[1].rm_eo：捕获组1匹配内容的结束偏移量\n        // 第三个参数：缓冲区大小（匹配内容长度+1，预留字符串结束符位置）\n        // data+match[1].rm_so：指向捕获组1匹配内容的起始地址\n        snprintf(href,match[1].rm_eo - match[1].rm_so + 1,\"%s\",data+match[1].rm_so);\n        // 提取捕获组2的内容（\u003ca\u003e标签内标题文本）到title数组\n        snprintf(title,match[2].rm_eo - match[2].rm_so + 1,\"%s\",data+match[2].rm_so);\n        // 打印提取到的href链接和标题，用制表符分隔\n        printf(\"%s\\t%s\\n\",href,title);\n        data+=match[0].rm_eo;\n    }\n\n    // -------------- 第六步：资源释放 - 释放编译正则表达式占用的内存 --------------\n    regfree(\u0026reg);\n\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-984bg7l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-984bg7l","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Process 进程基础"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-2u9jd6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-2u9jd6e","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单任务操作系统(单进程模式，一个时刻只能执行一个任务)\n如果要在古早时期电脑中执行多个软件， 需要将当前占用的交换出来存储在软盘中，而后执行新任务\n需要让电脑中多个执行单位合理共享使用硬件资源，这也是多任务操作系统的前提"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-686uzy5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-686uzy5","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Process 进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1jduonw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1jduonw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"操作系统默认的执行单元，可以使用 CPU，内存，磁盘等等系统设备完成特定任务\n在早期操作系统中，进程确实是最经典的调度单位，在现代操作系统中，线程才是最经典的调度单位"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ff3tjf1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ff3tjf1","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程的创建"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-reg79t7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-reg79t7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260107221313891"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260107221313891.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rzzu0e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rzzu0e4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可执行文件启动后创建进程\t\t进程是程序的动态表现，进程创建后占用系统资源，完成特定任务"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9zlmka4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9zlmka4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程属于系统中的逻辑单位，没有实体"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vxp8mwv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vxp8mwv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程的生存空间"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-u4z1k60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-u4z1k60","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260107223231870"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260107223231870.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ypak6hf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ypak6hf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PCB 进程控制块\nPCB 中包含了 384 项进程信息，其中 pid 是进程 id 操作系统唯一的进程身份标识 ps aux"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1bspsrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1bspsrx","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内核空间：存储身份信息\t\t\t\t用户空间：存储执行信息\n进程创建时分配的内存地址是虚拟地址"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-mq27evc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-mq27evc","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存的基本单位是 Page，1 页等于 4096 字节\n四种内存的基本权限，PROT_READ（读） \tPROT_WRITE（写）\tPROT_EXEC（执行权限）\tPROT_NONE（无）"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-at9boqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-at9boqi","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260107230049947"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260107230049947.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-dar7vjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-dar7vjk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"32 位操作系统内存申请时采用 3 级间接寻页(GB)\n64 位采用 4 级(TB)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vbmaekh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vbmaekh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"系统中庞杂的映射关系存储在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"虚拟内存映射表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中，内存管理器负责"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"维护和修改"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vb60dka","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vb60dka","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"保存与恢复处理器现场"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-em5l4gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-em5l4gq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260107231057708"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260107231057708.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1ancz88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1ancz88","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"分时复用原则"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"保存和恢复现场"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"才算是一个合格的多任务系统"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0v2gx2c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0v2gx2c","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面试：什么是进程什么是线程？"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-7e6uma3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-7e6uma3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"答：进程，线程就是寄存器和栈，能使用寄存器表示能使用 CPU，CPU 遵循分时复用原则，栈表示 PCB 的内核栈,既可以依照分时复用原则使用 CPU 又可以保存和恢复现场,表示这个东西是一个合格的执行和调度单位"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-s76b9y1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-s76b9y1","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Linux 进程状态"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-mkfn3dj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-mkfn3dj","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就绪态，运行态，睡眠态，挂起态，终止态，僵尸态，孤儿态"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1sygh69","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1sygh69","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Linux 进程开发，进程源语"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gu4s7dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gu4s7dm","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"操作系统提供的一系列 API 函数接口，开发者可以使用完成进程功能开发任务、"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8bjdb6a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8bjdb6a","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"fork()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//进程创建调用一次创建一个进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-673mrog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-673mrog","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260107234032894"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260107234032894.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gksi4ff","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gksi4ff","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"int main(void)\n{\n    pid_t pid;\n    pid = fork();\n    //fork创建成功，在父进程中返回子进程的pid\n    //在子进程中返回0，如果创建失败返回-1\n    //pid == 33366\n    if(pid \u003e 0){\n        //父进程工作区\n        printf(\"parent Runing...\\n\");\n        while(1);\n    }\n    //pid == 0\n    else if(pid == 0){\n        //子进程工作区\n        printf(\"Child Runing....\\n\");\n        while(1);\n    }else{\n        perror(\"fork call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9cw6z00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9cw6z00","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"关于父子进程一起执行 fork 函数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260108111127733"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260108111127733.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n父子进程可以共享 fork 函数栈帧，一人执行函数的一部分，得到两个不同的返回值，便于区分父子进程任务\n不允许子进程踏出自己的工作区（else if 代码块），子进程执行完自己的代码块通过 exit()结束进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5xelnk5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5xelnk5","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"父子进程的继承与拷贝"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5o6plxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5o6plxx","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260108131542942"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260108131542942.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4bvidud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4bvidud","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一版 fork：父进程创建子进程后，将所有的用户层资源拷贝给子进程，如果子进程不需要拷贝继承用户数据，父进程进行了拷贝，这些拷贝开销对子进程，没有任何意义，无意义开销"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6e0loxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6e0loxk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二版 vfork：通过 vfork 创建的子进程是没有 0~3G 用户层数据的，需要使用者自行准备加载进程 0 ~3G 之后才可以使用，vfork 结合 exec 一起使用"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-se1vmrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-se1vmrh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三版 fork: "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"读时共享，写时复制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"机制对父子进程都有效，父进程修改映射数据也要进行复制操作"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vz67a44","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vz67a44","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于多次执行 fork，进程创建数量"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ile1v97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ile1v97","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"fork();fork(); fork(); fork();\t答：二的三次方减一\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260108151858523"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260108151858523.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-137yp0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-137yp0d","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"fork();\nfork()\u0026\u0026fork()||fork()；\nfork();\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t答：23"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qfd8jvy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qfd8jvy","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"execl()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//进程重载"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-s3th9tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-s3th9tv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260108152540328"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260108152540328.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-q01efyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-q01efyh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"execl(const char*path,”firefox”,”www.baidu.com”,NULL)\t\t//进程重载，最后一个参数一定要传 NULL，表示命令参数传递完毕，不写函数失败"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-yomlyot","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-yomlyot","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"zombie process 僵尸进程"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260108204159201"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260108204159201.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-lpc1iu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-lpc1iu2","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子进程退出，资源没有清理完毕(PCB 残留)，子进程为僵尸进程\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"僵尸进程危害："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t\n1.内存泄漏，进程结束后内存没有释放完毕，其他人使用此内存产生异常\n2.每个僵尸进程会持续占用一个 PCB，影响新进程创建"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ne86m9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ne86m9c","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"wait 函数在释放 PCB 之前可以从 PCB 中提取子进程退出信息，父进程可以进行验尸操作，进行校验"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-aunexfq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-aunexfq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"wait()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t //进程回收"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hq8k1qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hq8k1qe","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"wait 函数是一个阻塞函数，父进程执行后，阻塞等待子进程结束，子进程结束后，wait 回收成功，释放 PCB 资源，返回僵尸进程的 pid\n如果 wait 返回-1，表示回收失败，例如没有子进程却尝试回收\n子进程成为僵尸进程，父进程也退出，系统会回收僵尸进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cjnm2t6","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cjnm2t6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"int main(void)\n{\n    pid_t pid;\n    pid_t zpid;\n    pid=fork();\n    if(pid\u003e0){\n        printf(\"Parent pid %d Waiting\\n\",getpid());\n        zpid=wait(NULL);\n        printf(\"Parent wait success,zpid %d\\n\",zpid);\n        while(1)sleep(1);\n    }else if(pid==0){\n        printf(\"Child pid %d Running\\n\",getpid());\n        sleep(5);\n          exit(0);\n    }else{\n        perror(\"fork call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-dlqty5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-dlqty5q","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"wait 函数，阻塞回收子进程(僵尸进程)，主动回收方案，阻塞回收会影响父进程任务的执行，在等待过程中无法进行其他操作\nzpid=wait(int * status)\t//进程回收，调用一次只回收一个僵尸进程，如果有多个僵尸进程，需要循环调用 wait"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-m5gijb6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-m5gijb6","updated":"20261006172412"}},{"ID":"20260505170804-cl3yocq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cl3yocq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"waitpid()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//进程回收"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-q05nx4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-q05nx4c","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"pid_t zpid=waitpid(pid_t pid ,int *status,int opt)\t//进程回收"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cow09fq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cow09fq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pid \t指定回收方式"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t\npid\u003e0,指定一个子进程 pid，回收这个子进程\n-1,回收任意子进程\t\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260108220613603"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260108220613603.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vyz2j66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vyz2j66","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0，同组回收，只能回收掉与父进程同组的所有子进程\n\u003c-1,指定组 id，实现跨组回收"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9jlssj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9jlssj0","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"int"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em em","TextMarkTextContent":"status,暂时传 null"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260108222829020"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260108222829020.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hjn5qfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hjn5qfy","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"int opt , 工作模式"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" \t\nWNOHANG,非阻塞关键字，可以让 waitpid 进行非阻塞回收\t非阻塞回收，可以让父进程在回收过程中穿插执行自身的任务"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-j913qti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-j913qti","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"waitpid 返回值，\t\u003e0 表示回收成功，\t-1 表示回收失败，非阻塞返回 0"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ieoeake","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ieoeake","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"while((zpid=waitpid(-1,NULL,WNOHANG))!=-1){\n    if(zpid==0){\n        //执行一次父进程\n    }else if(zpid\u003e0){\n        printf(\"回收成功，僵尸进程pid %d\\n\",zpid);\n        break;\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-atcru7a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-atcru7a","updated":"20261006172412"}},{"ID":"20260505170804-7gx9q52","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-7gx9q52","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实践：多进程拷贝 Demo"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3wbmz6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3wbmz6g","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"process_copy\t#代码编译后\n./process_copy 1.jpg 2.jpg 进程数量(缺省值)\t*用户不填写进程数量创建 5 个进程\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260109131426346"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260109131426346.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-epmaist","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-epmaist","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"并发程序：根据进程的数量计算任务量\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260109131537140"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260109131537140.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-t1foo1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-t1foo1x","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260109172516374"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260109172516374.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gzxrjp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gzxrjp7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主控型 makefile 复制跳转到变异型 makefile 位置并执行"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-m6hejqa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-m6hejqa","updated":"20261006172412"}},{"ID":"20260505170804-fub5ka3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fub5ka3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"IPC 进程间通信"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-uo3nhby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-uo3nhby","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程间通信的简写是 IPC，可以利用这种技术完成多个进程间的数据传递，信息收发\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260110201058507"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260110201058507.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-o4wj23g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o4wj23g","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"匿名管道(pipe)\t有名管道(fifo)\tPosix 消息队列\tSystemV 消息队列\tMMAP 内存共享映射\tSignal 信号\tSocket 套接字技术"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8n6rpdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8n6rpdl","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"绝大多数的进程间通信技术都是利用内核层实现的(内核层共享内存)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1a237u9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1a237u9","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PIPE 匿名管道"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-iugmfn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-iugmfn7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.流通性(传输介质)\t2.方向性\t3.暂存能力\n管道：先进先出，暂存能力\t\t老版本的 ubuntu 管道大小都是 64k"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-13d8fdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-13d8fdo","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260110221102310"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260110221102310.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qfmyum5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qfmyum5","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"管道创建成功，系统将读写管道的两个文件描述符传出到 fds 中，让用户可以读写适用管道\n匿名管道具有亲源限制，只有亲源进程间可以利用完成进程通信\n管道使用前要确定通信方向，管道要单工使用，让进程关闭无用的描述符\t\n*单工：定义通信方向，不可改变，非读即写\n*可调节单工：在一个时刻非读即写，不同时刻可切换\n*全双工：可以同时读写\n每一个指向管道的描述符都是一个引用计数，当管道引用计数为 0，系统会自行释放管道空间"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6txsz9a","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6txsz9a","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Q1BQ"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/wait.h\u003e\n#define MSG \"Can u here Me?\"\nint main(void){\n    int fds[2];\n    pipe(fds);\n    pid_t pid;\n    pid=fork();\n    if(pid\u003e0){\n        printf(\"parent %d Send Msg\\n\",getpid());\n        close(fds[0]);\n        write(fds[1],MSG,strlen(MSG));\n        wait(NULL);\n        close(fds[1]);\n    }else if(pid==0){\n         close(fds[1]);\n         char buffer[1024];\n         bzero(buffer,sizeof(buffer));\n         read(fds[0],buffer,sizeof(buffer));\n         printf(\"child Read MSG=%s\\n\",buffer);\n         close(fds[0]);\n         exit(0);\n    }else{\n        perror(\"fork call failed\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9ndasdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9ndasdr","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"管道为空，写端未写数据，读端读取管道，读阻塞\n管道为满，读端未读数据，写端写管道，写阻塞\n写端关闭，如果管道有数据，读端读取完管道剩余数据后再次读取返回 0；管道为空，直接返回 0\n管道读端关闭，写端尝试向管道写数据，系统会向写端进程发送 SIGPIPE，杀死写端进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qauk9z3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qauk9z3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面试题：编写一个服务端客户端模型(CS)，可以进行连接和基本数据收发，客户端异常退出，服务器也异常退出，为什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5p5c95s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5p5c95s","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"send(int sockfd,buffer,len,MSG_NOSIGNAL)\t//如果系统给服务端(写端)发送 SIGPIPE 信号，可以利用 MSG_NOSIGNAL 忽略信号"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ocuklg0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ocuklg0","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"匿名管道的缺点"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jvrz2hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jvrz2hu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亲源限制，只能亲源进程可以使用其完成通信\n默认情况下管道使用无格式字节流传输，需要用户自行封装"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-mxeuxy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-mxeuxy8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"管道这种进程间通信方式，效率较好\n在所有的 unix 或 linux 系统，管道都是可以使用的，但是其他系统？"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-t8n29aq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-t8n29aq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"FIFO 有名管道"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-lccyt3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-lccyt3n","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"mkfifo 测试管道\t\t\t//创建管道文件\n管道文件没有存储能力，无法编辑\t\n创建管道文件后，系统会在内核层创建一个管道缓冲区\n管道文件被删除，立即清理释放管道缓冲区\n命名管道使用时也是单工方式\n匿名管道的四种情况适用于有名管道"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ifm72mz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ifm72mz","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260110231521153"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260110231521153.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-c34xsto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-c34xsto","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260110234559102.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8gmbo1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8gmbo1k","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"访问命名管道必须满足两种权限(读，写)，才可以成功的打开和使用管道，如果只有一种访问权限，会阻塞等待另一种\n单进程只要满足两种访问权限(O_RDWR)，可以直接打开和使用管道"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-aurr241","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-aurr241","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有名管道使用时的特殊情况"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9es2v3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9es2v3i","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\t\t权限要求，有名管道要求满足两种访问权限才可以打开使用管道，否则要阻塞等待另一种\n​\t\t如果在一个进程中有多个读序列，阻塞只会对第一个读序列生效，其他都会设置非阻塞（多线程为进程读取数据，一个线程阻塞等待即可，其他线程设置非阻塞立即返回，执行其他任务，避免阻塞开销）"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-in4f7y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-in4f7y9","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260110232752209"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260110232752209.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ylz5mcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ylz5mcb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​       "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原子使用管道"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (传输速度较慢，但是数据的完整性比较好) 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"非原子使用管道"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (传输效率高，无法保证数据的完整性)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6y74w5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6y74w5s","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260110235558267"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260110235558267.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-zdt4frq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-zdt4frq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原子写管道，一次写的大小小于等于管道大小(原子访问)\n系统会检测管道余量，如果写端的大小大于管道余量，系统会挂起写端进程，等管道余量满足写需求大小，再唤醒写端继续写"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-uqchfsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-uqchfsg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非原子写管道，每次写的大小大于等于管道大小，非原子访问情况下，系统不会控制写端，只要管道缓冲区有余量，写端可以立即写入数据。管道满时才挂起。传输效率高，但是读端读取数据后要校验完整性，避免数据包的异常"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-97b5gx5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-97b5gx5","updated":"20261006172412"}},{"ID":"20260505170804-fn67p18","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fn67p18","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MMAP 文件共享映射"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-mooswk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-mooswk1","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"void *ptr =mmap(NULL,映射大小，PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE ，映射方式，文件描述符，映射偏移量)\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260113143817550"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260113143817550.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-z9a6djf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-z9a6djf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"私有映射：拷贝映射，将映射文件的数据拷贝一份到映射内存，两份数据独立无关联\n共享映射：同步映射，将映射文件的数据映射一份给进程，两份数据建立同步机制，对一份数据的修改马上更新给另一份"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jwjubh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jwjubh6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.映射内存的地址，如果传 null，系统自行分配映射内存\n2.映射内存大小一般是文件大小\n3.映射内存的权限 PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE|PROT_EXEC|PROT_NONE\n4.共享映射(MAP_SHARED)\t私有映射(MAP_PRIVATE)\n5.映射文件的描述符，映射时使用访问磁盘数据\n6.映射偏移量，mmap 支持偏移映射，每次映射一部分"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3gwbp50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3gwbp50","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"释放映射：munmap(void *ptr,映射大小)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1qxqw7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1qxqw7o","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 mmap 完成通信，也是确定通信方向，一个负责编辑修改映射内存，一个负责显示打印映射内存数据，不要让两端同时修改访问映射内存，会出现数据异常"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-66zuk9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-66zuk9e","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"映射成功返回 ptr，映射内存地址，失败返回 MAP_FAILED 关键字"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bm23wly","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bm23wly","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"int main(void){\n    int fd = open(\"Map_File\", O_RDWR);\n    int size;\n    size = lseek(fd, 0, SEEK_END);//获取文件大小\n    int * ptr = NULL;\n    if((ptr = mmap(NULL, size, PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE, MAP_SHARED, fd, 0))==MAP_FAILED){\n        perror(\"mmap call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    close(fd);\n    //修改映射内存数据， 让它同步给文件\n    ptr[0] = 0x34333231;\n    munmap(ptr,size);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3ak2fc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3ak2fc8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260113160637459"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260113160637459.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9u6nyxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9u6nyxb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MMAP 是否可以读写映射，取决于文件的打开权限，如果打开文件时有足够的权限，那么可以进行读写映射，映射的权限小于等于文件的权限\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260113161844989"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260113161844989.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-f6z5j8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-f6z5j8l","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"/0 截断\n映射文件拓展为结构体消息大小。\t想缓存 4K 条数据：结构体大小乘 4096"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-07vqbhi","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-07vqbhi","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"写端代码\n//0x1000 = 4096\n//0x10000 = 65536\n//0x100000 = 1m\n\ntypedef struct\n{\n    int id;\n    char date[1024];\n}msg_t;\n\nint main(void){\n    int fd = open(\"Map_File\",O_RDWR);\n    //拓展文件\n    ftruncate(fd,sizeof(msg_t));\n    msg_t * ptr = NULL;\n    if((ptr = mmap(NULL,sizeof(msg_t),PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE,MAP_SHARED,fd, 0))==MAP_FAILED){\n        perror(\"mmap call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    close(fd);\n    //持续向映射内存写入数据\n    ptr-\u003eid = 0;\n    bzero(ptr-\u003edate,1024);\n    while(1){\n        ++(ptr-\u003eid);\n        sprintf(ptr-\u003edate,\"test message , msg id %d\",ptr-\u003eid);\n        sleep(1);\n    }\n    munmap(ptr,sizeof(msg_t));\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-py69oqh","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-py69oqh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"读端\ntypedef struct\n{\n    int id;\n    char date[1024];\n}msg_t;\n\nint main(void){\n    int fd = open(\"Map_File\",O_RDWR);\n\n    msg_t * ptr = NULL;\n    if((ptr = mmap(NULL,sizeof(msg_t),PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE,MAP_SHARED,fd, 0))==MAP_FAILED){\n        perror(\"mmap call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    close(fd);\n\n    //持续显示映射内存数据\n    while(1){\n        printf(\"msgid = %d , msg = %s\\n\",ptr-\u003eid,ptr-\u003edate);\n        sleep(1);\n    }\n    munmap(ptr,sizeof(msg_t));\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-myjbklw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-myjbklw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于 MMAP 的同步机制"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qg0o5qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qg0o5qi","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260113202032446"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260113202032446.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5kuz5zu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5kuz5zu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从文件中读取数据 read"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8g80gxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8g80gxd","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260113203000212"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260113203000212.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-36p05io","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-36p05io","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ZERO-COPY 零拷贝"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8zsdhx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8zsdhx2","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"零拷贝技术在网络通信时可以减少网络开销\nSend File\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260113210312800"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260113210312800.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-n22p3ku","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-n22p3ku","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 mmap 引发的异常"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gs784jq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gs784jq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"映射内存的大小不要大于文件实际大小，因为在映射时要加载文件大小来设置映射内存的可用大小\n在进行映射时，一般要看映射文件的大小，如果映射内存与映射文件大小不符，在访问内存时产生总线错误，系统向进程发送 SIGBUS，杀死进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gyrzgrk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gyrzgrk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程关系"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5as70hb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5as70hb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亲缘关系"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-my5djtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-my5djtp","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Linux 操作系统下，进程间的关系是强亲缘(父子),弱亲缘(爷孙)\n爷爷进程与孙子进程最低限度亲缘(继承关系)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-7zmx2rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-7zmx2rh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"强亲缘关系(父子进程),子进程被父进程创建,子进程的任务被父进程指定，继承父进程数据，子进程结束后，父进程负责回收避免僵尸进程问题，整个子进程的生命周期父进程要全程参与\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114202520098"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260114202520098.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-s8rx2io","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-s8rx2io","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Process Group 组关系"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1gmdtju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1gmdtju","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个进程组一般由一个组长进程和若干组员进程构成\n组长被创建出来，就产生一个进程组\n终端进程被创建，默认为进程组的组长进程(系统会分配一个进程组)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3m7u71c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3m7u71c","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组长进程的唯一标志： 组 ID==进程 ID\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114204334543"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260114204334543.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gwo0j6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gwo0j6z","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"getpid()\t//返回进程 pid\ngetppid()\t//返回父进程 id\ngetpgrp()\t//返回进程进程组 id"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-kfazw11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-kfazw11","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"进程组的销毁："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组中的最后一个进程结束或转移，进程组中没有进程时，系统会释放进程组\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"就近原则："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子进程被创建后，默认归纳到父进程同组成为组员\n子进程一定是父进程的组员进程，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这个概念是错误的"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为组员是可以变动的，可以将组员进程转移到其他组中去\n组长是不允许转移的"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sdyyp0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sdyyp0k","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组长进程无法创建进程组，组员进程可以创建新租，脱离原有进程组成为新组长\n子进程成立新组后，亲缘关系不变，子进程结束后依然由父进程回收(子进程脱离原有进程组，父进程可以通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"waitpid"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 跨组回收)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-32w3l60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-32w3l60","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"setpgid(pid_t pid , pid_t gid)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t可以让组员创建新组，也可以让组成员转移到其他组\n组转移时目标必须存在，需要对目标组有访问权限才可以完成转移"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-pezufiq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-pezufiq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Process Session 会话关系"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1gyo0zi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1gyo0zi","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会话是一种终端进程管理的组织结构\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114212743971"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260114212743971.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n会话发起者结束时，会以组为单位杀死全部的会话参与者；会话发起者这杀一组，瞄准终端子进程的一组。\n会话发起者结束，终端子进程必然被杀死\n会话发起者杀死是按组杀死，如果子进程创建新组可以存活，但它并没有脱离会话"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3vgmw29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3vgmw29","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让子进程脱离会话，创建新会话，避免被终端杀死(脱离控制终端)\ngetsid(getpid());\t//返回会话 sid\nsetsid();\t创建进程组并创建新会话，脱离控制终端"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hkou5op","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hkou5op","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Orphan 孤儿进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8ukp6lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8ukp6lf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孤儿进程：父进程先于子进程退出，子进程被托管给托管进程，子进程属性活态进程，失去管理"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-lfq6pnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-lfq6pnd","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114225036181"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260114225036181.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n孤儿进程这种活态进程的危害是有弹性的，取决于孤儿进程的作业，如果孤儿进程被设置大量频繁的申请占用系统资源，那么这种孤儿进程危害极大\n孤儿进程是异常多进程模型的残留，会影响新进程的创建与使用"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-lf0prke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-lf0prke","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开发者创建父子进程模型，让父进程退出，子进程变为守护进程\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114232932954"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260114232932954.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-tj794ja","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-tj794ja","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Deamon Process 守护进程/精灵进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-myeg5gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-myeg5gk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"shell 设置进程开机启动\n守护进程是经典的后台服务进程，持续在后台执行完成特定服务，执行特定功能，不干预前台任务\n普通的软件进程随用户的使用持续，生命周期较短\n守护进程生命周期较长，开机启动关机结束，持续服务于后台\n守护进程不能持续占用系统资源(cpu,内存等)，长时间处于低开销模式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-lllpbxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-lllpbxr","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"守护进程的工作模式：\n间隔执行(sleep)\t定时启动，条件触发，低消模式(大多数时间进程处于睡眠态)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-mt66ndk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-mt66ndk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后台服务进程不允许访问前台，标准输入标准输出不使用，标准出错(dup2 实现重定向)\n守护进程其实是孤儿进程，人为的孤儿进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hyi8bzt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hyi8bzt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"守护进程的实现流程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5ydfeb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5ydfeb3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260115111620726"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260115111620726.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-x4sklyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-x4sklyy","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初次启动进程的工作路径在 USB 中，修改到目标主机中根目录下即可\n进程默认的工作路径在 USB 中，要将路径改为用户主机，对 USB 接触占用"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-68jx41r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-68jx41r","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改变守护进程的 umask 掩码，避免进程执行因不同平台 umask 不同导致文件权限异常"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-w4biyes","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-w4biyes","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建一个守护进程 Demo"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-mysebys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-mysebys","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.创建一个 Deamon_process 文件夹，在此文件夹中开发守护进程\n2.编译后，守护进程的程序名为 Deamon_process\n3.守护进程创建日志文件，文件名为 time.log\n4.守护进程间隔执行，每间隔 3s 向日志文件中写入系统时间\n5.守护进程后台运行"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-193gtci","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-193gtci","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/stat.h\u003e\n#include \u003cfcntl.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003ctime.h\u003e\n#include \u003cerrno.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/types.h\u003e\n\n// 守护进程的业务逻辑：每隔3秒将当前时间写入time.log文件\nvoid Daemon_business(void)\n{\n    int fd;\n    time_t tm; // 时间种子类型\n    char time_buffer[1024];\n    // 打开/创建日志文件，权限为0664\n    if((fd = open(\"time.log\", O_RDWR|O_CREAT, 0664)) == -1){\n        perror(\"open failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    while(1){\n        bzero(time_buffer, sizeof(time_buffer)); // 清空缓冲区\n        tm = time(NULL); // 获取当前时间戳\n        ctime_r(\u0026tm, time_buffer); // 线程安全的时间格式化函数\n        write(fd, time_buffer, strlen(time_buffer)); // 写入日志文件\n        sleep(3); // 每隔3秒执行一次\n    }\n    close(fd); // 理论上不会执行到这里，仅做规范补充\n}\n\n// 创建守护进程的核心函数\nvoid Daemon_create(void)\n{\n     // 1. 创建子进程，父进程退出，脱离终端控制\n    pid_t pid;\n    pid = fork();\n    if(pid \u003e 0){\n        exit(0); // 父进程退出\n    }else if(pid == 0){\n        // 2. 创建新会话，彻底脱离原终端会话\n        setsid();\n        // 3. 改变进程工作目录（这里设为当前目录，也可改为绝对路径如/var/log）\n        chdir(\"./\");\n        // 4. 修改进程umask，让创建的文件权限更灵活\n        umask(0002);\n        // 5. 关闭无用的文件描述符，释放资源\n        close(STDIN_FILENO);  // 关闭标准输入\n        close(STDOUT_FILENO); // 关闭标准输出\n        // 可选：将标准错误重定向到日志文件（补充原代码缺失部分）\n        int err_fd = open(\"daemon_err.log\", O_RDWR|O_CREAT|O_APPEND, 0664);//创建重定向错误文件\n        if(err_fd != -1){\n            dup2(err_fd, STDERR_FILENO);\n            close(err_fd);\n        }\n        // 6. 执行守护进程的核心业务\n        Daemon_business();\n        //7.守护进程退出处理\n    }else{\n        perror(\"fork call failed\");\n        exit(EXIT_FAILURE);\n    }\n}\n\n// 主函数：程序入口\nint main(void)\n{\n    Daemon_create();\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vp996wd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vp996wd","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重定向"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-v8jv3bn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-v8jv3bn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"STDIN_FILENO\t标准输入流\t读取外部数据\nSTDOUT_FILENO\t标准输出流\t显示数据\nSTDERR_FILENO\t标准出错流"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ftj2qew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ftj2qew","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260115121234413"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260115121234413.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-o6ezca4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o6ezca4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开机启动"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-o9ndc2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o9ndc2i","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"shell 脚本是一个逻辑和命令的集合，可以将大量的命令封装到脚本中，批量执行"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-98dcqnj","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-98dcqnj","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"c2hlbGw="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#!/bin/bash\n# 脚本名称：基础系统信息查看脚本\n# 功能：展示常用的Linux系统操作命令示例\n# 作者：自定义\n# 日期：2026-01-15\n\n# ==================== 脚本核心功能区 ====================\ndata\n\nls-a\n\nps aux\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-urfop7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-urfop7m","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建完 shell 文件不能立即执行，需要 sudo chmod 0775 文件名"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-b5tnwov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-b5tnwov","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"开机启动："}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-2xaczsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-2xaczsg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260115123511840"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260115123511840.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6ikpbau","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6ikpbau","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"c2hlbGw="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#!/bin/bash\n### BEGIN INIT INFO\n# Provides:          shell_start\n# Required-Start:    $remote_fs $syslog\n# Required-Stop:     $remote_fs $syslog\n# Default-Start:     2 3 4 5\n# Default-Stop:      0 1 6\n# Short-Description: set upstart shell\n# Description:       Provide a socket for X11, hald and others to multiplex kernel ACPI events.\n### END INIT INFO\n\n#跳转位置，到程序路径\ncd \"/home/colin/colinSoft/20220524/IPC/Daemon_process\"\n./Daemon_process\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-fr4hv2z","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fr4hv2z","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"c2hlbGw="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"此外执行\t\nsudo cp shell_start /etc/init.d\t\t#把当前目录下的`shell_start`脚本文件，复制到`/etc/init.d/`目录下\nsudo update -rc.d shell_start start 99 2. \t#让`shell_start`服务在运行级别 2 下，以优先级 99（较晚）开机启动。\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-h952nqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-h952nqa","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"系统开机启动脚本序列\t/etc/init.d/\n1.将其他脚本的启动块信息，复制到自定义脚本中\n2.将自定义脚本复制到/etc/init.d/目录\n3.通过命令将脚本加入开机启动序列 \tsudo update -rc.d shell_start start 99 2."}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-kr2frsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-kr2frsi","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过命令删除开机启动序列中的脚本\tsudo update-rc.d shell_start remove"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nmoypoa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nmoypoa","updated":"20261006172412"}},{"ID":"20260505170804-nss1zd6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nss1zd6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1f0muo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1f0muo3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"信号是 Linux 系统下的经典技术，一般操作系统利用信号杀死违规进程，典型进程干预手段，信号除了杀死进程外也可以挂起进程"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nkill\t-l ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"查看系统支持的信号"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n32,33 号预留给线程库 NTPL"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-by5gisg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-by5gisg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两种信号:\t经典信号/实时信号\n1"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"sub","TextMarkTextContent":"31 是 unix 经典信号，软件开发工程师使用，例如进程通信，信号捕捉等等 34"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"64 是自定义信号，一般驱动开发使用，偏底层"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gew5uyy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gew5uyy","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号触发的几种方式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ae2drf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ae2drf6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、终端组合按键触发信号"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nctl+c \t(SIGINT/2)\n终端组合按键触发的信号会发给唯一的前台进程\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260116121057596"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260116121057596.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-scx4ln4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-scx4ln4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ctl+/ \t(SIGQUIT/3) \t系统向唯一的前台进程发送 3 号信号，杀死目标进程\nctr+z\t(SIGTSTP/20)\t系统向唯一的前台进程发送 20 号新号，挂起目标进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ivaqsza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ivaqsza","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.命令发送信号"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nkill\t-signo \tpid \t#此命令可以向任意进程发送任意信号"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1g38jc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1g38jc2","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.函数发送信号"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"include"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ \u003csignal.h\u003e\nkill(pid_t pid , int signo)\t#向任意进程发送任意信号\nraise (int signo)\t#向自身进程发送任意信号\nvoid abort(void)\t#向自身进程发送 sigabrt/6 号信号"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ieh3ez3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ieh3ez3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.硬件异常产生信号"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n1.对只读内存进行写操作，属于违规操作硬件，系统向违规进程发送 SIGSEGV(11)信号，杀死违规进程\nSIGSEGV 信号可能是系统发出，也有可能是其他用户发出\n2.SIGBUS(总线错误)，越界访问，无效访问内存，系统向违规进程发送 SIGBUS(7)信号，杀死违规进程\n3.SIGFPE(浮点数例外)\tcpu 违规运算，运算异常，系统向违规进程发送 SIGFPE(8),杀死进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1g9vjzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1g9vjzz","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5.软条件触发信号"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n1.Alarm 定时器\t\t\t\t\talarm(10)\n软条件触发信号，在使用系统某个组件时，例如定时器，定时到时触发软条件，系统向进程发送信号\n2.管道读端结束，写端向管道写数据(触发软条件)系统向写端进程发送 SIGPIPE13 信号杀死写端进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ga8vg5j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ga8vg5j","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号的三大行为，与五种处理动作"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qqge8kh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qqge8kh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260116133634326"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260116133634326.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-851itwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-851itwy","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"默认行为 SIG_DFL"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3iaasiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3iaasiu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"TERM：直接杀死目标进程\tSIGKILL SIGINT\nCORE：直接杀死进程，但是转储核心处理文件\t(dump core)，SIGQUIT ，SIGSEGV SIGFPE SIGBUS\nIGN：通知回收信号\tSIGCHLD 忽略信号，发到进程不会影响进程\nSTOP：挂起进程，SIGSTP，SIGTSTP\nCONT：唤醒进程，SIGCONT\n信号处置进程后，可以通过结果分析信号的默认动作"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hv9y6v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hv9y6v1","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"忽略行为 SIG_IGN"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ok5vf5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ok5vf5d","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"忽略行为没有处理动作，直接丢弃，不会影响进程\n忽略行为的优先级比动作要高"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-f32oaio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-f32oaio","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"捕捉行为 SIG_ACTION"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nz4n6z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nz4n6z3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自定义动作\n捕捉函数：    例 printf(“hahaha\\n”);\n捕捉行为可以实现信号绑定自定义任务，信号触发执行捕捉函数，执行自定义任务"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-tijfm36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-tijfm36","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捕捉技术在开发中广泛使用"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-x4vqexg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-x4vqexg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"让信号失效的三种方式：屏蔽，忽略，捕捉"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-y1u5nwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-y1u5nwp","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"系统保留高权级信号，这类信号无法被屏蔽，捕捉和忽略，服务于内核，只要发出必然递达\nSIGKILL(9)，无法被屏蔽，捕捉，忽略，只要发出必然杀死\nSIGSTOP(19)，无法被屏蔽，捕捉，忽略，只要发出必然挂起"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xo68d8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xo68d8q","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"信号的传递过程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-k9xd7xm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-k9xd7xm","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260116235109550.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-wyqe433","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-wyqe433","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号集是一个位图，每一位表示一个信号，位码是 0 或者 1\n如果信号无法通过未决信号集，位码是 1，此信号直接丢弃\n如果信号通过未决信号集，系统将对应的位码设置 1，标记为未决态信号，表示此信号正在传递，还未处理\n屏蔽字信号集，用户自行设置，可以屏蔽阻塞信号，使其无法递达\n信号屏蔽字对应的位变为 1，可以实现阻塞信号"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-g6qt0mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-g6qt0mg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果信号通过屏蔽字进入 handler 处理流程，系统会将未决信号集对应位码翻转回 0，表示从未决态信号切换为递达态信号\n信号屏蔽是延迟处理，此信号未消失，某一刻屏蔽解除，此信号马上递达，处置进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-o1v4abk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o1v4abk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"忽略信号，信号没有处理流程，只传递不处理\n可以实现自定义动作，也可以捕捉函数为空"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-zc9rur7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-zc9rur7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"unix 经典信号 不支持信号排队\n自定义信号实现了排队序列，多个相同信号触发也可以排队依次处理"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-42eotga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-42eotga","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"系统为了避免相同的信号同时进入处理流程所以进行临时屏蔽，只让一个信号抵达\n捕捉函数\t1.扫描磁盘\t2.缓存垃圾文件位置\t3.批处理删除文件\n捕捉函数中访问共享数据，嵌套执行产生冲突"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rlj00ad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rlj00ad","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经典信号因为系统设置临时屏蔽的关系，两个相同信号触发，可以最大排队一次"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-w34cg9f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-w34cg9f","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号屏蔽实现"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0h4jw40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0h4jw40","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"include\u0026lt;signal.h\u0026gt;\tsigset_t"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ oldset\nsigset_t set;\t//信号集类型\nsigempty(sigset_t * set);\t//将 set 信号集中所有位初始化为 0\nsigfillset(sigset_t * set);\t//将 set 信号集中所有位初始化为 1\nsigaddset(sigset_t *set,int signo);\t//将 set 集合中某个信号的对应位设置为 1\nsigdelset(sigset "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"set, int signo);\t//将 set 集合中某个信号的对应位设置为 0bitcode=sigismember(sigset_t * set,int signo);\t//查看某个信号集中，对应信号的位码并直接返回 0 or 1sigprocmask(SIG_SETMASK , sigset_t"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" newset , \u0026oldset);\t//可以替换进程信号集,并将原有的 oldset 传出保存，便于复位\n设置方式：\tint how = SIG_SETMASK(替换覆盖)\tSIG_BLOCK(位或)  SIG_UNBLOCK(取反求与)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5gs1ycc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5gs1ycc","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"查看信号的屏蔽情况"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sx82p5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sx82p5q","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号已经被发出，递达进程，进程中被屏蔽，要观察这种已触发被屏蔽的信号只能查看未决信号集\n获取进程的未决信号集，而后输出未决的每一位，0 or 1 查看信号屏蔽\nsigpending(\u0026pset)\t//调用此函数，系统将进程的未决信号集传出到 pset 中\n使用遍历循环结合 sigismember，查看每一位的情况并输出"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rx4p20y","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rx4p20y","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e\n// 查看信号的屏蔽情况，遍历打印未决信号集\nvoid print_pset(sigset_t pset)\n{\n    int i=1;\n    for(i; i\u003c32; i++){\n        if((sigismember(\u0026pset, i))){\n            putchar('1');\n        }else{\n            putchar('0');\n        }\n    }\n    putchar('\\n');\n}\nint main(void)\n{\n    sigset_t set, oset, pset;\n    sigemptyset(\u0026set); // 初始化 0\n    sigaddset(\u0026set, SIGINT); // 设置屏蔽SIGINT\n    sigaddset(\u0026set, SIGQUIT); // 设置屏蔽SIGQUIT\n    sigprocmask(SIG_SETMASK, \u0026set, \u0026oset);\n    while(1){\n        sigpending(\u0026pset);\n        print_pset(pset);\n        sleep(1);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-p3fr4qn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-p3fr4qn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号行为修改"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-aksrj22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-aksrj22","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"struct sigaction act;\t//信号行为结构体\nact.sa_handler=SIG_DFL(默认行为) | SIG_IGN(忽略行为) | 传递函数指针 -\u003e 自定义捕捉函数\nact.sa_flags=0\t//此成员与行为接口绑定，如果使用 sa_handler 那么 sa_flags 为 0，如果使用 sa_sigaction ,flags 为 SA_SIGINFO\nact.sa_mask \t//sigset_t 信号集类型，为临时屏蔽字，使用 sigemptyset 初始化"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qm32c26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qm32c26","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"sigaction(int signo(要设置处理规则的信号编号),struct sigacion *newact ,sigacion *oldact);\t\n//替换进程的信号行为结构体，用 newact 替换，传出 oldact(进程原有结构体)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-h79gwel","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-h79gwel","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e\n// 自定义捕捉函数\n// sa_handler = void (*sa_handler)(int)\n// sa_handler是一个函数指针类型，但是捕捉函数定义必须与其一致\nvoid sig_do(int n){\n    // 系统调用捕捉函数时，系统向n传递捕捉的信号编号\n    printf(\"SIGINT %d 捕捉成功..\\n\", n);\n}\n// 修改信号行为\nint main(void)\n{\n    struct sigaction act, oact;\n    // act.sa_handler = SIG_DFL; // 默认行为\n    // act.sa_handler = SIG_IGN; // 忽略行为\n    act.sa_handler = sig_do;    // 捕捉行为\n    act.sa_flags = 0;\n    sigemptyset(\u0026act.sa_mask);\n    sigaction(SIGINT, \u0026act, \u0026oact); // 行为替换\n    while(1){\n        sleep(1);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xjrvrsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xjrvrsw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117001645786"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117001645786.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ai9tcox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ai9tcox","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了避免不同信号绑定相同的捕捉函数引发冲突\t设置临时屏蔽字 SA_MASK\n在进程处理某一个信号时，可以使用 SA_MASK 临时屏蔽其他信号，等信号处理完再解除屏蔽，避免不同信号调用相同捕捉的冲突"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8l5xd00","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8l5xd00","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dump Core"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-2fagkuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-2fagkuf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号的默认行为中有五种处理动作\nTERM CORE IGN STOP CONT\nCORE：杀死进程的同时，传储核心文件\n如果进程因硬件异常被系统杀死，那么会(Dump Core),错误原因 xxx(核心已转储)\nulimit -a 查看系统限制\nulimit -c 4096(允许生成 core)\t让进程产生错误，生成 core 文件，后续调试通过 gdp app core\n在编译阶段 gcc *.c -g -o app ,编译时加入调试信息才可以使用 gdb"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-a4v5emm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-a4v5emm","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号回收"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-w31a08u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-w31a08u","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117105820021"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117105820021.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-lgzppte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-lgzppte","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"wait()\t//阻塞回收(主动回收)\nwaitpid()\t//非阻塞回收(主动回收)\n信号回收(被动回收方案)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-w5f2zzh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-w5f2zzh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捕捉函数执行流程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-2idiv3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-2idiv3j","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号的处理是实时的吗？\t信号的处理不是实时的\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117110407529"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117110407529.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-adk449r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-adk449r","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"软件中断触发层级转换，系统调用触发层级转换，软件异常调用层级转换\n1.进程在用户层执行逻辑单元\n2.系统发送信号到内核层(等待处理)\n3.进程要触发层级转化，从用户空间切换到内核空间\n4.切换到内核层后先完成系统调用\n5.完成调用后，返回用户空间前，检测一下是否有未处理信号，有则处理\n6.察觉信号的处理行为为捕捉行为，携高权限切换到用户层\n7.捕捉执行完毕，SIG_RETURN 指令，返回内核空间\n8.系统调用完毕，返回用户空间\n9.从 main 被中断的位置继续执行"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-j2rdbhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-j2rdbhh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内核切换到用户层执行捕捉函数，使用进程本身资源(时间片或内存)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-il1yymo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-il1yymo","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般 main 先执行，过程中产生信号，系统执行捕捉函数，捕捉函数先执行完，稍后回到主函数继续执行"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-u7qg8uk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-u7qg8uk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117115439291"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117115439291.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8ysvl6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8ysvl6i","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"cup 环路设计"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xbvzy46","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xbvzy46","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于捕捉函数的可重入不可重入问题"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ywk7se3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ywk7se3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全局变量\tint a =1024，此数据被捕捉函数和主函数同时使用\t全局变量会引发不可重入问题\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117121452292"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117121452292.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-22aip6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-22aip6t","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捕捉函数和 main 函数同时使用全局链表的 insert 操作，必然引发内存泄漏，链表中的节点异常\n使用全局资源或静态资源的函数称为不可重入函数，这种函数信号捕捉函数与主函数同时使用会引发异常"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bnflkwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bnflkwj","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可重入概念：访问的数据也好，函数也罢，都不访问共享资源，不会引发冲突，这种函数称为可重入函数，信号使用可重入内容是安全的\n信号捕捉开发不允许使用不可重入内容"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6c4jtuv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6c4jtuv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时序竞态(不常考)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-v3a8g35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-v3a8g35","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117161101536"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117161101536.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117161205574"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117161205574.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ia6duw5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ia6duw5","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程间通信\t(用信号)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-at45fiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-at45fiz","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117123030545"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117123030545.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1mc0oc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1mc0oc4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用时选择一种数据进行通信"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bw5l3nv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bw5l3nv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"info-\u003esi_int\t接收整形数据\ninfo-\u003esi_ptr\t接收指针数据\nact.sa_flags =SA_SIGINFO"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-fok8b58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fok8b58","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"父进程中屏蔽 SIGUSR1 然后将这个屏蔽继承给子进程，子进程被创建就默认屏蔽 SIGUSR1，然后子进程完成信号捕捉，捕捉设定完毕\n解除 SIGUSR1 屏蔽，这样就可以避免子进程没有捕捉完毕，信号递达，杀死子进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-f7n61dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-f7n61dk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号通信亲缘间使用比较简单，但是不相干的进程要想办法获取目标 pid\n父进程关于子进程 pid 的问题，可以将 pid 存储在全局变量，便于捕捉函数使用，也可以使用 getpid()+1，定位子进程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hlo7cv8","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hlo7cv8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e      // 标准输入输出库\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e     // 标准库（exit等函数）\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e     // 字符串处理库\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e     // 系统调用库（fork、getpid、usleep等）\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e     // 信号处理库\npid_t child_pid;  // 全局变量：保存子进程PID，供父进程信号处理函数使用\nvoid Parent_sig(int n, siginfo_t *info, void *arg)\n{\n    // 打印父进程PID和接收到的数值\n    printf(\"Parent pid [%d] , %d\\n\", getpid(), info-\u003esi_int);\n    // 定义信号携带数据的联合体（sigqueue要求使用该类型传递数据）\n    union sigval val;\n    val.sival_int = ++(info-\u003esi_int);  // 数值自增   \n    // 向子进程发送SIGUSR1信号，并携带自增后的数值\n    sigqueue(child_pid, SIGUSR1, val);\n    usleep(50000);  // 休眠50毫秒，避免信号发送过快导致输出刷屏\n}\nvoid Child_sig(int n, siginfo_t *info, void *arg)\n{\n    // 打印子进程PID和接收到的数值\n    printf(\"Child pid [%d] , %d\\n\", getpid(), info-\u003esi_int);\n    // 定义信号携带数据的联合体\n    union sigval val;\n    val.sival_int = ++(info-\u003esi_int);  // 数值自增\n    // 向父进程发送SIGUSR2信号，并携带自增后的数值（getppid()获取父进程PID）\n    sigqueue(getppid(), SIGUSR2, val);\n    usleep(50000);  // 休眠50毫秒\n}\nint main(void)\n{\n    pid_t pid;  // 保存fork返回的进程ID\n    // ===================== 父进程信号配置：捕捉SIGUSR2 =====================\n    struct sigaction act, oact;  // 信号动作结构体（act：新规则，oact：旧规则）\n    act.sa_sigaction = Parent_sig;  // 指定SIGUSR2的处理函数\n    act.sa_flags = SA_SIGINFO;     // 开启\"带详细信息\"模式，支持传递附加数据\n    sigemptyset(\u0026act.sa_mask);     // 清空信号屏蔽集（处理函数执行时不屏蔽其他信号）\n    sigaction(SIGUSR2, \u0026act, \u0026oact);  // 生效：设置SIGUSR2的处理规则\n    // ===================== 父进程信号屏蔽：屏蔽SIGUSR1 =====================\n    sigset_t set, oset;            // 信号集（set：新屏蔽集，oset：旧屏蔽集）\n    sigemptyset(\u0026set);             // 清空信号集\n    sigaddset(\u0026set, SIGUSR1);      // 将SIGUSR1加入屏蔽集\n    // 生效：设置进程的信号屏蔽字，子进程会继承该屏蔽集\n    sigprocmask(SIG_SETMASK, \u0026set, \u0026oset);\n    // ===================== 创建子进程 =====================\n    pid = fork();\n    if (pid \u003e 0)  // 父进程分支\n    {\n        // 初始化信号携带的数据（起始值为1）\n        union sigval val;\n        val.sival_int = 1;\n        child_pid = pid;  // 保存子进程PID到全局变量        \n        // 父进程主动发送第一个信号：向子进程发送SIGUSR1，携带数值1\n        sigqueue(pid, SIGUSR1, val);\n        // 无限循环：保持父进程存活，等待子进程的信号\n        while (1)\n        {\n            sleep(1);  // 休眠等待，避免CPU空转\n        }\n    }\n    else if (pid == 0)  // 子进程分支\n    {\n        // ===================== 子进程信号配置：捕捉SIGUSR1 =====================\n        struct sigaction act, oact;\n        act.sa_sigaction = Child_sig;  // 指定SIGUSR1的处理函数\n        act.sa_flags = SA_SIGINFO;     // 开启\"带详细信息\"模式\n        sigemptyset(\u0026act.sa_mask);     // 清空屏蔽集\n        sigaction(SIGUSR1, \u0026act, \u0026oact);  // 生效：设置SIGUSR1的处理规则\n        // ===================== 子进程解除屏蔽：取消SIGUSR1屏蔽 =====================\n        // 用空的屏蔽集（act.sa_mask）替换当前屏蔽集，解除SIGUSR1的屏蔽\n        sigprocmask(SIG_SETMASK, \u0026act.sa_mask, NULL);\n        // 无限循环：保持子进程存活，等待父进程的信号\n        while (1)\n        {\n            sleep(1);  // 休眠等待\n        }\n    }\n    else  // fork失败分支\n    {\n        perror(\"fork call failed\");  // 打印错误信息\n        exit(0);                     // 退出程序\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nl9ihtw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nl9ihtw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实现进程的外部控制"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-fl919gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fl919gt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260117162646212"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260117162646212.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sdtorwg","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sdtorwg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/types.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/stat.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/fcntl.h\u003e\n#include \u003cpthread.h\u003e\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e\n// 捕捉SIGUSR1信号\nvoid sig_stop(int n)\n{\n    pause();\n}\nvoid sig_cont(int n)\n{\n    // null\n}\nvoid server_sigaction(void)\n{\n    struct sigaction act, bct, oact;\n    act.sa_handler = sig_stop;\n    act.sa_flags = 0;\n    sigemptyset(\u0026act.sa_mask);\n    sigaction(SIGUSR1, \u0026act, \u0026oact);\n    bct.sa_handler = sig_cont;\n    bct.sa_flags = 0;\n    sigemptyset(\u0026bct.sa_mask);\n    sigaction(SIGUSR2, \u0026bct, NULL);\n}\nint main(void)\n{\n    server_sigaction(); // 捕捉设定\n    while(1)\n    {\n        // 服务器主要业务\n        printf(\"Server service Demo , version 0.0.1 , Listen epoll , Wait Client...\\n\");\n        sleep(1);\n    }\n}\n\n信号注册：程序启动时注册两个自定义信号的处理规则：\n收到 SIGUSR1 信号 → 执行 sig_stop()，调用 pause() 暂停进程；\n收到 SIGUSR2 信号 → 执行空函数 sig_cont()，仅唤醒被暂停的进程（无额外操作）。\n主逻辑：无限循环打印服务器运行提示（模拟业务），每秒输出一次，保持进程一直运行。\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9fot9la","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9fot9la","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于阻塞函数和信号处理冲突"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-d844y42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-d844y42","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阻塞函数处于等待状态，等待系统通知或事件消息"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cxwb317","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cxwb317","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118101159969"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118101159969.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4ljfev1","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4ljfev1","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e\n#include \u003cerrno.h\u003e\nvoid sig_int(int n)\n{\n    printf(\"成功捕捉SIGINT %d 信号\\n\", n);\n}\nint main(void){\n    int len;\n    struct sigaction act, oact;\n    act.sa_handler = sig_int;\n    act.sa_flags = 0;\n    sigemptyset(\u0026act.sa_mask);\n    sigaction(SIGINT, \u0026act, \u0026oact);\n    char buf[1024];\n    bzero(buf, sizeof(buf));\ntryagain:\n    while((len = read(STDIN_FILENO, buf, sizeof(buf))) \u003e 0)\n    {\n        write(STDOUT_FILENO, buf, strlen(buf));\n        bzero(buf, sizeof(buf));\n    }\n    if(len == -1){\n        if(errno == EINTR){\n            printf(\"read函数被强制中断，TryAgain..\\n\");\n            goto tryagain;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n信号捕捉：程序会捕捉 SIGINT（Ctrl+C 触发）信号，收到后执行 sig_int() 函数，打印捕捉成功的提示。\n中断恢复：read() 系统调用在被信号中断时会返回 -1，并将 errno 设置为 EINTR。代码检测到这个情况后，会通过 goto tryagain 重新进入 read() 循环，保证程序不会因为 Ctrl+C 而退出。\n回显功能：程序从标准输入读取内容，并原样输出到标准输出，类似一个简单的回显程序。\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5r9t0br","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5r9t0br","updated":"20261006172412"}},{"ID":"20260505170804-9rjol0x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9rjol0x","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-uhjfozz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-uhjfozz","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程基本概述"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-p9i79hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-p9i79hq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经典的并发模型 多进程模型 占用大量的内存开销，庞大的进程间调度开销，提供一种开销更小，更轻量的并发解决方案，多线程技术\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118103946243"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118103946243.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-779115a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-779115a","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"线程在进程中，与进程共享资源和数据，进程是容器，线程是执行单元，进程退出可能导致所有线程退出"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n进程是最小的资源分配单位，线程最小的执行单位\n线程就是寄存器和栈"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-js8i2kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-js8i2kb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118105144446"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118105144446.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0c8ze8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0c8ze8f","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"多线程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-na9okq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-na9okq8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118105502940"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118105502940.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8h7jw3t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8h7jw3t","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程的 CPU 分配"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-73uieqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-73uieqf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"内核级线程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-tjsey5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-tjsey5v","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118110721290"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118110721290.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-82b87sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-82b87sr","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"操作系统中每创建一个线程，系统都会为其创建一个内核对象，此线程系统可以识别支持，会为线程执行资源(时间片)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nf02d56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nf02d56","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用户级线程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-fne3kv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fne3kv9","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118111741239"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118111741239.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jxrxa7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jxrxa7n","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用户级线程，可以利用第三方库的形式在不支持线程技术的系统下安装和使用线程，用户级线程的调度开销更小，因为大部分的操作都在用户层完成，无需内核干预"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qcoukaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qcoukaj","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118112803139"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118112803139.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-p0pr0nk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-p0pr0nk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程的蜕化"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0egsf7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0egsf7r","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程内资源的独占，不与其他人共享，进程是独立的调度单位(无需考虑线程问题)\n进程中出现了多个执行单元，讨论考虑线程问题\n讨论和分析的蜕化，讨论线程，进程的讨论变为主线程和普通线程的讨论(讨论点的转移)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0vil9m3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0vil9m3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多线程在进程中的资源共享"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0dn99rn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0dn99rn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118114913452"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118114913452.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-pr5k65q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-pr5k65q","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PCB 是共享空间\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"线程栈的栈空间非共享，每个线程创建后，会分配 8M 线程栈"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n库资源共享\n共享堆空间\n全局资源共享\n代码段共享\n文件描述符表共享\n信号的处理行为共享(某个线程改变信号行为)对所有线程生效\t\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"信号屏蔽字非共享，普通线程拥有独立的屏蔽字，拷贝继承于主线程"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"TCB 非共享，每个线程拥有独立的线程控制块，独立的 tid"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ldu4j5k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ldu4j5k","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程开发相关的 API 接口"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-q66scfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-q66scfu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"NPTL 线程库是典型的内核级线程库，创建的线程可以被系统识别分配 cpu 资源(轻量级进程)\n(nativ Posix thread library)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-63kawn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-63kawn6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ps aus 进程查看  \tps ajx 进程关系查看\tps -elf 所有线程查看\tps -Lf pid 进程中线程查看\n每个线程都会被系统分配 lwp 调度编号，便于系统管理调度线程，但是线程拥有独立的 tid 线程 id"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-t45j6so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-t45j6so","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"include\u0026lt;pthread.h\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\npthread_t tid;\t//线程 tid 类型\n*"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"int err=pthread_create(pthread_t * tid,NULL,void"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"( "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"thread_job)(void"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em em","TextMarkTextContent":"),void * arg)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//线程创建并指定任务"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sd10pk0","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sd10pk0","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003cpthread.h\u003e\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e\n// 线程工作函数\nvoid * thread_job(void * arg)\n{\n    printf(\"普通线程被创建，参数为 %d\\n\", *(int *)arg);\n    return NULL;\n}\n// 主线程（主控线程）\nint main(void)\n{\n    pthread_t tid;\n    int code = 1024;\n    // 创建新线程\n    pthread_create(\u0026tid, NULL, thread_job, (void*)\u0026code);\n    printf(\"主线程创建普通线程成功...\\n\");\n    // 主线程进入无限休眠，防止进程退出\n    while(1)\n        sleep(1);\n    return 0;\n}\n\n编译时需链接动态库 gcc thread_create.c -lpthread -o app\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nosn61j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nosn61j","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于线程函数的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"错误处理"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，线程函数会返回错误号(err\u003e0),使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"char * errstr=strerror(err);"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-c0w3go1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-c0w3go1","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_join(pthread_t tid,void  reval);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//线程回收函数，可以回收线程资源的同时获取线程的返回值\n*经典的阻塞回收函数，会一致等待普通线程结束后，进行回收\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_cancel(pthread_t tid);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t\t//指定线程 tid，取消结束线程\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_testcancel(void);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//产生一次系统调用"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ebj7zy8","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ebj7zy8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/types.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/stat.h\u003e\n#include \u003csys/fcntl.h\u003e\n#include \u003cpthread.h\u003e\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e\n// 普通线程的工作函数\nvoid * thread_job(void * arg)\n{\n    while(1)\n    {\n        printf(\"普通线程Running...\\n\");\n        sleep(1);\n    }\n    return (void*)126;\n}\n// 主线程（主控线程）\nint main(void)\n{\n    pthread_t tid;\n    int code = 1024;\n    int flags = 0;\n    int err;\n    void * reval = NULL;\n    // 创建新线程，并检查是否创建成功\n    if((err = pthread_create(\u0026tid, NULL, thread_job, (void*)\u0026code)) \u003e 0)\n    {\n        printf(\"pthread_create call failed: %s\\n\", strerror(err));\n        exit(0); // 创建失败则退出进程\n    }\n   \tprintf(\"Monster thread 0x%x, 普通线程id 0x%x\\n\", (unsigned int)pthread_self(), (unsigned int)tid);\n\tsleep(5);\n\tpthread_cancel(tid);\n\t//pthread_join(tid,\u0026reval);\n\t//printf(\"thread exit code %ld\\n\", (long int)reval);\nwhile(1)\n    sleep(1);\nreturn 0;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6dylbv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6dylbv9","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号处理的三个切换条件：系统调用，软件中断，软件异常\ncancel 取消事件的处理条件，必须有系统调用\n线程指定退出码时不允许用-1，保留给 pthread_cancel\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118222506486"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118222506486.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gu1iuig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gu1iuig","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"修改线程退出状态，从回收态改为分离态，此操作不可逆，不能将分离线程变为回收\n如果对一个分离态线程进行回收操作，pthread_join 会失败返回\n不允许对一个已经处于回收阶段(join 已经开始阻塞等待了)的线程设置分离，分离设置失败\n一个自行回收，一个系统回收，一个可以得到线程退出码，一个无法得到"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bvvjs7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bvvjs7t","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"pthread_detach(pthread_t tid);\t//将一个线程设置为分离态线程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sjd7sig","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sjd7sig","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 普通线程的工作函数\nvoid * thread_job(void * arg)\n{\n    // 将当前线程设置为分离状态，结束后自动释放资源\n    pthread_detach(pthread_self());\n    printf(\"普通线程 tid 0x%x 被创建\\n\", (unsigned int)pthread_self());\n    return (void*)126;\n}\n// 主线程（主控线程）\nint main(void)\n{\n    pthread_t tid;\n    int code = 1024;\n    int flags = 0;\n    int err;\n    void * reval = NULL;\n    // 创建新线程，并检查是否创建成功\n    if((err = pthread_create(\u0026tid, NULL, thread_job, (void*)\u0026code)) \u003e 0)\n    {\n        printf(\"pthread_create call failed: %s\\n\", strerror(err));\n        exit(0); // 创建失败则退出进程\n    }\n    // 打印主线程和新创建线程的ID\n    printf(\"Monster thread 0x%x, 普通线程id 0x%x\\n\", (unsigned int)pthread_self(), (unsigned int)tid);\n    // 等待普通线程结束，并获取其返回值\n    if((err = pthread_join(tid, \u0026reval)) \u003e 0)\n    {\n        printf(\"join failed: %s\\n\", strerror(err));\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    // 打印普通线程的退出码\n    printf(\"thread exit code %ld\\n\", (long int)reval);\n    // 主线程进入无限休眠，保持进程运行\n    while(1)\n        sleep(1);\n    return 0;\n}\n\n子线程 thread_job 中调用了 pthread_detach(pthread_self())，将自己设置为分离状态。\n主线程随后又调用了 pthread_join(tid, \u0026reval)，尝试等待并回收这个线程。\n在 POSIX 线程标准中，分离状态的线程是不能被 pthread_join 的，这会导致 pthread_join 调用失败，程序会打印 join failed: Invalid argument 并退出。\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-o3sm8gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o3sm8gf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以通过线程属性，批量创建分离态线程，这些线程诞生即是分离态\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_attr_setdetachstate(\u0026amp;attr, PTHREAD_CREATE_DETACHED)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：设置线程为分离态（另一个取值是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"PTHREAD_CREATE_JOINABLE"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，默认可连接态）；"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4hz34lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4hz34lj","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em em","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_exit((void"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":")126);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*\t//线程退出函数，结束当前线程，与进程无关，退出码可以被 join 获取"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ulkdn8s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ulkdn8s","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程的退出方式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rreojpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rreojpn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118230927261"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260118230927261.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ydu4ndt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ydu4ndt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程属性"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-r7su7e5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-r7su7e5","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"pthread_create(\u0026tid,pthread_attr_t * attr,thread_job,NULL);\npthread_attr_t * attr;\t线程属性类型"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-wzaytyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-wzaytyv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本段内容作为指引性介绍，默认的线程属性已经能满足绝大多数开发要求，只有极特殊情况可能修改属性"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260119103355789"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260119103355789.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rbgr9rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rbgr9rl","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本段内容作为指引性介绍，默认的线程属性已经能满足绝大多数开发要求，只有极特殊情况可能修改属性"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-82w1d0b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-82w1d0b","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程安全"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5biq0zb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5biq0zb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"访问互斥"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8tt9aqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8tt9aqm","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多线程访问全局资源或静态资源，多线程访问文件数据，多线程适用共享数据引发异常\n线程产生的开销占用的资源没有任何意义"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-dgs0zif","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-dgs0zif","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"互斥锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nqfzviw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nqfzviw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260119112046085"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260119112046085.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-yjjcrz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-yjjcrz8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_mutex_t lock"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//互斥锁\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_mutex_init(\u0026amp;lock,NULL)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//互斥锁初始化\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_mutex_destroy(\u0026amp;lock)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//释放互斥锁\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026amp;lock);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//申请锁\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_mutex_trylock();"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//非阻塞申请，锁被占用不会阻塞，立即返回\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026amp;lock);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//释放锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-i9mh1yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-i9mh1yg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加锁的位置问题，可能改变线程执行流程\n*参考：只有全局资源读写时需要上锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-d2lf64r","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-d2lf64r","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003cpthread.h\u003e\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e\n// 全局共享变量\nint number;\n// 互斥锁，保护共享变量\npthread_mutex_t lock;\n// 线程工作函数\nvoid * thread_job(void * arg)\n{\n    int tmp;\n    // 将当前线程设置为分离态，结束后自动释放资源\n    pthread_detach(pthread_self());\n    // 循环5000次，对共享变量进行累加操作\n    for(int i=0; i\u003c5000; i++)\n    {\n        // 加锁，确保同一时间只有一个线程访问共享变量\n        pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);\n        tmp = number;\n        printf(\"thread 0x%x ++number %d\\n\", (unsigned int)pthread_self(), ++tmp);\n        number = tmp;\n        // 解锁，允许其他线程访问共享变量\n        pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);\n    }\n    // 线程退出\n    pthread_exit(NULL);\n}\n// 主线程\nint main(void)\n{\n    pthread_t tid;\n    // 初始化互斥锁\n    pthread_mutex_init(\u0026lock, NULL);\n    // 创建两个线程，执行同一个工作函数\n    pthread_create(\u0026tid, NULL, thread_job, NULL);\n    pthread_create(\u0026tid, NULL, thread_job, NULL);\n    // 主线程进入无限休眠，保持进程运行\n    while(1)\n        sleep(1);\n    // 销毁互斥锁（注：由于while(1)，这行代码永远不会执行）\n    pthread_mutex_destroy(\u0026lock);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5iz6ld3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5iz6ld3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260119115729364"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260119115729364.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ubw42e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ubw42e8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"惊群问题：多线程争抢资源，因资源有限，未捡到的线程付出了无意义的系统开销\nflag 标记在某线程占用锁资源时自动分发\n*就近原则：某个线程释放了锁立即申请，它还会占用锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-j12pef6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-j12pef6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"读写锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rhgefer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rhgefer","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"互斥锁不允许多个线程同时访问资源，资源的利用率较低，读写锁可以解决这个问题，它支持一个线程写资源，多个线程可以同时读资源，提高资源利用率\t\t读写锁读写互斥"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-so387hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-so387hn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"读共享，写独占，读写互斥\n// 定义读写锁\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_rwlock_t lock;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" // 读写锁\n**pthread_rwlock_init(\u0026lock, NULL);\t**\t// 初始化读写锁\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_rwlock_rdlock(\u0026amp;lock);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t\t// 申请读锁（允许多个线程同时持有读锁）\n**pthread_rwlock_wrlock(\u0026lock);\t**\t// 申请写锁（同一时间只能有一个线程持有写锁）\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_rwlock_unlock(\u0026amp;lock);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t\t// 释放锁（读锁和写锁都用同一个 unlock 函数释放）\n**pthread_rwlock_destroy(\u0026lock);\t**\t// 销毁读写锁，释放资源"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5z7usoi","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5z7usoi","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003cpthread.h\u003e\n// 全局共享变量和读写锁\nint number = 0;\npthread_rwlock_t lock;\n// 写线程函数\nvoid * thread_wr(void * arg)\n{\n    while (1)\n    {\n        // 申请写锁（互斥访问）\n        pthread_rwlock_wrlock(\u0026lock);\n        printf(\"write thread 0x%x ++number = %d\\n\", (unsigned int)pthread_self(), ++number);\n        // 释放锁\n        pthread_rwlock_unlock(\u0026lock);\n        // 模拟写操作间隔\n        usleep(100000);\n    }\n    return NULL;\n}\n// 读线程函数\nvoid * thread_rd(void * arg)\n{\n    while (1)\n    {\n        // 申请读锁（共享访问）\n        pthread_rwlock_rdlock(\u0026lock);\n        printf(\"read thread 0x%x number = %d\\n\", (unsigned int)pthread_self(), number);\n        // 释放锁\n        pthread_rwlock_unlock(\u0026lock);\n        // 模拟读操作间隔\n        usleep(100000);\n    }\n    return NULL;\n}\nint main(void)\n{\n    pthread_t tids[8];\n    int i;\n    // 初始化读写锁\n    pthread_rwlock_init(\u0026lock, NULL);\n    // 创建 3 个写线程\n    for(i=0; i\u003c3; i++)\n    {\n        pthread_create(\u0026tids[i], NULL, thread_wr, NULL);\n    }\n    // 创建 5 个读线程\n    for(; i\u003c8; i++)\n    {\n        pthread_create(\u0026tids[i], NULL, thread_rd, NULL);\n    }\n    // 主线程等待所有子线程结束（防止进程提前退出）\n    for (i = 0; i \u003c 8; i++)\n    {\n        pthread_join(tids[i], NULL);\n    }\n    // 销毁读写锁\n    pthread_rwlock_destroy(\u0026lock);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hbs7zrt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hbs7zrt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"读写锁是怎么实现的？"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ecba266","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ecba266","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"读写锁核心：读共享、写独占，基于互斥锁 + 两个条件变量 + 读写计数实现"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-z67n1q6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-z67n1q6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用一把互斥锁保护所有计数和状态\n维护读等待数、当前读线程数、写等待数、是否正在写 几个变量\n加读锁：有正在写或有等待写线程，就阻塞等待；否则读计数 + 1，直接进入读。\n解读锁：读计数减到 0，唤醒所有等待的写线程。\n加写锁：有在读或正在写，就阻塞等待；否则标记写占用。\n解写锁：释放写标记，优先唤醒写等待线程，再唤醒所有读线程，避免写饥饿。"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-n03xyi4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-n03xyi4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"旋转锁/自旋锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bbycy9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bbycy9g","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不会挂起等待锁，一直重复请求，直到获取成功位置，请求旋转锁的线程不会挂起，一直处于运行态 R"}]},{"ID":"20260507215500-ffh99ec","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260507215500-ffh99ec","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从需求角度看，什么场景必须用自旋锁？"}]},{"ID":"20260507215500-vi25a5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260507215500-vi25a5s","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临界区执行时间极短\n代码很快就能执行完释放锁，原地空等比线程切换开销更小"}]},{"ID":"20260507215500-zr5reus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260507215500-zr5reus","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"锁竞争不激烈\n大概率一次就能抢到锁，不会长时间空转浪费 CPU"}]},{"ID":"20260507215500-l3k9e8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260507215500-l3k9e8e","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不能线程休眠阻塞的场景\n比如内核中断、底层数据结构，不允许线程挂起切换，只能用自旋锁"}]},{"ID":"20260507215500-mksnq0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260507215500-mksnq0v","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追求低延迟，不想触发内核态上下文切换，需要快速抢锁、快速释放"}]},{"ID":"20260507215617-3cxe0bb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260507215617-3cxe0bb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"操作系统 / 内核"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n硬软中断处理（网卡、定时器、外设中断）\n系统全局计数、设备状态位更新\n内核网络 / 日志 / IO 环形队列读写\nPer-CPU 私有数据并发保护"}]},{"ID":"20260507215617-zdinr6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260507215617-zdinr6f","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"后端高并发"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n网络框架 TCP 连接、FD 映射表管理\n内存池 / 对象池节点存取\nQPS 限流、令牌桶、熔断状态计数\n高性能无锁队列头尾指针保护"}]},{"ID":"20260507215617-n4ixkyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260507215617-n4ixkyv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中间件组件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n本地缓存 LRU 链表维护\n时间轮定时任务挂载与摘除\n线程池、连接池空闲状态与链表管理"}]},{"ID":"20260507215617-djfu6r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260507215617-djfu6r4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"客户端 / 嵌入式 / 游戏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nUI 线程与工作线程共享状态、进度、开关标记\n嵌入式传感器、串口实时高频数据采集\n游戏帧同步、角色 Buff / 状态、对象池、网络帧队列"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sm7p7nm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sm7p7nm","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件读写锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rldkm9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rldkm9j","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一把写锁，N 把读锁，读共享，写独占，读写互斥\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260119143153362"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260119143153362.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-zitsp22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-zitsp22","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件锁通过修改文件锁属性实现上锁和解锁效果，用户需要自定义锁结构体并赋值，而后对文件默认锁结构进行替换，实现文件锁操作\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"fcntl(fd,F_GETLK,struct flock * lock);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//将文件默认的锁结构体传出到 lock 变量中\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"fcntl(fd,F_SETLK,struct flock * newlock);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t//将自定义的 newlock 替换文件原有的结构体，实现上锁效果\tF_SETLK 是非阻塞上锁\nF_SETLKW \t//阻塞上锁关键字，如果文件锁被占用，则会挂起等待"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cdb16gd","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cdb16gd","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"A代码\nint main(void)\n{\n    // 判断文件锁属性，查看是否可以上锁\n    struct flock old;\n    int fd = open(\"pthread_test.c\", O_RDWR);\n    fcntl(fd, F_GETLK, \u0026old);\n    if(old.l_type == F_UNLCK)\n    {\n        printf(\"process A %d get flock successfully , lock status is unlock.\\n\",getpid());\n        struct flock new;\n        new.l_type = F_WRLCK;\n        new.l_whence = SEEK_SET;\n        new.l_start = 0;\n        new.l_len = 0;\n        fcntl(fd, F_SETLKW, \u0026new);\n        printf(\"process A %d Set write lock successfully.\\n\",getpid());\n        sleep(10);\n        new.l_type = F_UNLCK;\n        fcntl(fd, F_SETLKW, \u0026new);\n        printf(\"process A %d unlock\\n\",getpid());\n    }\n    else\n    {\n        printf(\"pthread_test lock status is not unlock.\\n\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n\nB代码\nint main(void)\n{\n    // 判断文件锁属性，查看是否可以上锁\n    struct flock old;\n    int fd = open(\"pthread_test.c\", O_RDWR);\n    fcntl(fd, F_GETLK, \u0026old);\n    if(old.l_type == F_UNLCK)\n    {\n        printf(\"process A %d get flock successfully , lock status is unlock.\\n\",getpid());\n        struct flock new;\n        new.l_type = F_WRLCK;\n        new.l_whence = SEEK_SET;\n        new.l_start = 0;\n        new.l_len = 0;\n        fcntl(fd, F_SETLKW, \u0026new);\n        printf(\"process A %d Set write lock successfully.\\n\",getpid());\n        sleep(10);\n        new.l_type = F_UNLCK;\n        fcntl(fd, F_SETLKW, \u0026new);\n        printf(\"process A %d unlock\\n\",getpid());\n    }\n    else\n    {\n        printf(\"pthread_test lock status is not unlock.\\n\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n\n这是两个独立的程序，用于演示 fcntl 文件锁的抢占和互斥效果。\n进程 A 会先检查文件是否解锁，如果是就加写锁，持有 10 秒后再释放。\n进程 B 会直接尝试加写锁，如果文件已被进程 A 锁住，它会阻塞等待直到锁被释放。\nF_SETLKW 中的 W 表示 “等待（wait）”，如果锁被占用则阻塞，直到获取到锁。\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-38mysdb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-38mysdb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"死锁问题"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3dgkamq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3dgkamq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"锁资源有限，但多线程相互请求锁资源导致线程永久阻塞，这种现象称为死锁\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260119152821097"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260119152821097.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-d5jflge","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-d5jflge","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"死锁发生的四个必要条件"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-if8a0ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-if8a0ul","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"请求与保持条件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\t某个线程在占用一把锁后还要请求新锁，容易引发死锁问题\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不可剥夺条件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\t    除了占用资源的线程外，其他人无法解锁资源\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"互斥条件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\t\t\t   某个线程占用锁资源后，其他线程申请则挂起等待\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"环路等待条件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\t\t每个线程都在等待相邻线程手中的资源，这种称为等待环路"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xw5behz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xw5behz","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"死锁处理"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9btanra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9btanra","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产生死锁后，杀死死锁线程，解除死锁，而后再创建\t(死锁频繁，创建销毁线程开销较大)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-fwv1480","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fwv1480","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"死锁检测"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-f02xdo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-f02xdo2","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"有向图检测"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t\n广度，深度优先算法\t\n可以通过图遍历算法，检测出图中是否出现环路，如果是则已发生死锁，可以通过杀死线程的方式杀死某个节点，解除死锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4v7swtl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4v7swtl","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"死锁预防"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-t2j771m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-t2j771m","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260119155324250"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260119155324250.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4xctas3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4xctas3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哲学家只有两种工作模式：思考和进食\t\t思考不占资源，进餐时每个哲学家先获取左手的筷子，再获取右手的筷子\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"死锁现象："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5 名哲学家同时进餐，分别拿起左手筷子，等待获取右手的筷子，产生死锁问题，永久挂起"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-txieeiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-txieeiw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"礼貌策略："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当某个哲学家拿起左手的资源，发现无法获取右手的资源，它会放下左手资源，让其他人进餐\n活锁问题：如果哲学家同时频繁触发礼貌机制，导致所有哲学家拿起放下餐具，无法进食，饿死"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-idiswsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-idiswsq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"高权级策略:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"选中一名哲学家提高权限，此哲学家要进餐时，向相邻哲学家发送通知，让其放下资源\n高权策略，由于优先级转换，可能导致多数时间，只有超级哲学家在进食"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bkt04rc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bkt04rc","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多线程情景下，资源有限，多线程合理的规避问题，合理使用资源\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"服务者模式："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t服务者记录资源占用情况\t\t\t\t每一个哲学家进餐时要询问服务者是否可以，允许则获取资源，不允许放弃本次进餐，进入下一轮行为选择\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"银行家算法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t银行家算法将资源都抽象为银行资产，每个用户借款，银行进行借款风险评估，如果风险超出阈值，禁止放款"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-n2rqzs8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-n2rqzs8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程控制（条件变量）"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vuvgfrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vuvgfrh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120114844396"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260120114844396.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-entl1ss","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-entl1ss","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-c36eq6b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-c36eq6b","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-15crllu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-15crllu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"条件变量技术实现线程的挂起和唤醒"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sz5yxya","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sz5yxya","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-wg4vhno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-wg4vhno","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为线程指定执行条件，按执行条件挂起唤醒控制线程"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qtme5bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qtme5bq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_cond_t cd"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ // 条件变量类型，线程可以挂起在条件变量中，也可以从中唤醒\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_cond_init(pthread_cond_t * cd,NULL);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​// 初始化条件变量\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_cond_destroy(pthread_cond_t * cd);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ // 销毁释放条件变量\npthread_cond_wait(pthread_cond_t * cd ,pthread_mutex_t * lock)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ymeqhk7","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ymeqhk7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-e92mfnd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-e92mfnd","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-dw0e16y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-dw0e16y","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两次执行："}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ohdbsb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ohdbsb7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程第一次执行 wait 函数，挂起线程的同时解锁互斥锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-i5u4806","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-i5u4806","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程被唤醒执行 cond_wait，上锁互斥锁\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_cond_signal(pthread_cond_t * cd);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​// 唤醒一个挂起在 cd 中的线程\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pthread_cond_broadcast(pthread_cond_t * cd);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​// 唤醒所有挂起在 cd 中的线程"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-zmgqysn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-zmgqysn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-o02vqt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o02vqt7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"signal 函数的误唤醒，如果系统是多核处理器 cpu，signal 函数可能唤醒多个线程，导致误唤醒"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4u2bqnb","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4u2bqnb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 全局变量：0表示夜晚，1表示白天\nint day_night = 1; // 初始化为白天\npthread_mutex_t lock;\npthread_cond_t cd;\n\n// 线程A：白天执行巡逻任务，夜间休息\nvoid *thread_a(void *arg)\n{\n    // 白天执行巡逻任务，夜间休息\n    while (1) {\n        pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);\n        // 等待条件：如果是夜晚（day_night == 0）则挂起\n        while (day_night == 0) {\n            pthread_cond_wait(\u0026cd, \u0026lock);\n        }\n        printf(\"thread_A cid 0x%x , 白天 %d 完成巡逻任务\\n\", \n               (unsigned int)pthread_self(), day_night);\n        // 切换到夜晚\n        day_night = 0;\n        pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);\n        // 唤醒等待在条件变量上的线程B\n        pthread_cond_signal(\u0026cd);\n        sleep(1); // 模拟任务执行时间\n    }\n    return NULL;\n}\n// 线程B：夜间执行巡逻任务，白天休息\nvoid *thread_b(void *arg)\n{\n    // 夜间执行巡逻任务，白天休息\n    while (1) {\n        pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);\n        // 等待条件：如果是白天（day_night != 0）则挂起\n        while (day_night) {\n            pthread_cond_wait(\u0026cd, \u0026lock);\n        }\n        printf(\"thread_B cid 0x%x , 夜间 %d 完成巡逻任务\\n\", \n               (unsigned int)pthread_self(), day_night);\n        // 切换到白天\n        day_night = 1;\n        pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);\n        // 唤醒等待在条件变量上的线程A\n        pthread_cond_signal(\u0026cd);\n        sleep(1); // 模拟任务执行时间\n    }\n    return NULL;\n}\nint main(void)\n{\n    pthread_t tid_a, tid_b;\n    // 初始化互斥锁和条件变量\n    pthread_mutex_init(\u0026lock, NULL);\n    pthread_cond_init(\u0026cd, NULL);\n    // 创建线程\n    pthread_create(\u0026tid_a, NULL, thread_a, NULL);\n    pthread_create(\u0026tid_b, NULL, thread_b, NULL);\n    // 等待线程结束（这里用死循环保持主线程运行）\n    while (1) {\n        sleep(1);\n    }\n    // 销毁资源（实际不会执行到这里，仅作示范）\n    pthread_mutex_destroy(\u0026lock);\n    pthread_cond_destroy(\u0026cd);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-n89asc3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-n89asc3","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生产者消费者模型"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nvpnqyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nvpnqyp","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经典的数据传递或任务传递模型\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120115035672"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260120115035672.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-umyx3qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-umyx3qw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"环形队列，设置头尾索引，\t遍历时也要环形队列"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-y3332dr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-y3332dr","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Socket 套接字"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jenzyga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jenzyga","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般用于网络应用开发，系统提供的一套 API 函数接口，称为套接字函数，网络应用开发是软件工程师开发必备技能\neverything is file,将所有的设备访问方式抽象为文件，可以通过文件描述符访问大多数 Linux 设备"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-iv8ssca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-iv8ssca","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120150141678"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260120150141678.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6ikbhda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6ikbhda","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"int sockfd = socket(AF_INET,SOCK_STREAM,int protocol);\t//成功返回 sock_fd,失败返回-1,errno 被设置"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-pgad2yu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-pgad2yu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"struct sockaddr_in addr\t//网络信息结构体类型\naddr.sin_family =AF_INET\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\naddr.sin_port =大端(8080)\naddr.sin_addr.s_addr=大端(ip)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cppc89j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cppc89j","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"bind(sock_fd,struct sockaddr * addr,socklen_t addrlen);\t//成功返回 0 失败返回-1\t\n绑定可以对 socket 设置自定义的 ip 和端口号，其次当绑定某端口的进程退出，可以临时禁用端口号，时长为 2MSL"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4trrceh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4trrceh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"listen(int sockfd,int backlog)\t//成功返回 0\t失败返回-1\n//backlog:监听序列数\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120153751840"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260120153751840.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-oluzrot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-oluzrot","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"htons()\t小端转大端端口\nhtonl()\t小端转大端 IP\nntohs()\t大端转小端端口\nntohl()\t大端转小端 IP"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-7hvvcer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-7hvvcer","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"inet_pton(AF_INET,char *ip,void *addr)\ninet_ntop(AF_INET,void *addr ,char *ip,16)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-nb8bjza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-nb8bjza","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"connect(int sockfd,struct sockaddr* dest ,socklen_t addrlen);\t//请求连接函数，成功返回 0 失败返回-1\nint Csockfd=accept(int Ssockfd, struct sockaddr* addr, socklen_t *addrlen);\t//成功返回 sockfd，失败返回-1\nssize_t recv (int sockfd,void * buf ,size_t *size ,int flag);\tMSG_DONTWAIT , 成功返回读取的数据量，失败返回-1\nssize_t send(int sockfd,void *buf ,size_t size ,int flag);\t MSG_NOSIGNAL(避免信号杀死)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6dcoqqh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6dcoqqh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务器"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-pfg71z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-pfg71z4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务器是经典的后台服务软件，各个互联网公司与产品都需要后台服务器进行支持，提供业务支持，数据支持等等，服务后台相关领域提供大量就业岗位，服务器概念也是互联网不可或缺的一部分\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260121105212788"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260121105212788.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0w72dtl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0w72dtl","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务器操作系统"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sa5774f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sa5774f","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unix，Linux，Windows Server\n在服务器基础系统领域，Linux 和 unix 还是独占较大的市场份额"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-q6g4zei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-q6g4zei","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Apache Nginx tomcate\t经典的 Web 服务器，用于网页网站的后台支持"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hon7ysd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hon7ysd","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"集群概念/分布式结构"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cijgeqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cijgeqf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260121111508424"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260121111508424.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gssep9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gssep9y","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布式概念是一种硬件的横向扩展策略，可以提高集群主机的物理性能\n分布式策略可以通过 socket 技术将各种设备连接起来，统一调度，资源管理，资源共享"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-tlr0jtf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-tlr0jtf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"APUE 经典的几种服务器软件开发模式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1t7rsgt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1t7rsgt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.单进程服务器(本章节样例)"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-yzi1zus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-yzi1zus","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260121114413717"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260121114413717.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-q9kpj0n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-q9kpj0n","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.多进程并发模型"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6hjeav0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6hjeav0","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260121144701178.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n实现一对多处理业务\n父子进程实现业务分离，父进程负责连接，子进程负责处理\n多进程稳定性更强\n系统开销较大(进程开销)，处理进程随用户持续，频繁创建销毁进程开销\n僵尸回收较为麻烦\n缺乏进程管理，并发数量是进程数量"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-uopqked","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-uopqked","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.多线程并发模型"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bnmzxy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bnmzxy8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260121154849321"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260121154849321.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-t5ka2up","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-t5ka2up","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.IO 复用模型/多路 IO 转接：可以同时监听多个 socket 事件"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jcggsa9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jcggsa9","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于 recv 和 accept 工作流程"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-lejwl9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-lejwl9c","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"传统阻塞监听，处理就绪"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260122110449878"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260122110449878.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260122110512109"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260122110512109.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260122110555343"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260122110555343.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n*? 监听到 socket 事件就绪后，直接调用 accept 或 recv 即可，直接完成 tcp 连接或者数据读取，两个函数不会阻塞\n可以实现单进程一对多效果，但是没有使用并发效果，处理的业务复杂度不能过高，要在极短时间内处理若干任务，处理第二次监听\n处理的业务复杂度不能过高，要在极短的时间内处理若干任务，投入第二次监听"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bydyxiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bydyxiv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"传统阻塞：线程和单个 socket “强绑定”，只能串行处理，无并发能力；\nIO 复用：线程和内核 epoll “交互”，内核替线程管理所有 socket，就绪才通知处理，实现高并发 + 高效 CPU 利用。"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-p39m44k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-p39m44k","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"select 模型"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hruqvpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hruqvpk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最大监听数量 1024 个(实际达不到 1024 个)\t\nfd_set set;\t//监听集合类型\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260122120013749"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260122120013749.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n文件描述符与监听集合有对应关系，基础描述符占用监听位，导致 socket 监听集合中最大只能监听 1021 个用户 socket"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-as62zbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-as62zbt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Select 模型的工作流程"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260122151657845"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260122151657845.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-p3mv7vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-p3mv7vg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"struct timeval val;\t//时间结构体\ntimeval * val =NULL\t//阻塞监听\n定义时间结构体初始化为 0，传入，则表达式非阻塞工作，定义时间结构体，设定固定时长，实现定时阻塞"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-tk21pjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-tk21pjk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"int\tready = select(maxfd+1,\u0026set ,\u0026set,\u0026set，NULL);\t//\u0026set 传时间(读，写，异常)\t最后一个参数传工作方式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-u1yyxko","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-u1yyxko","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e          // 标准输入输出头文件\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e         // Unix 标准函数头文件 (close, read, write 等)\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e         // 字符串处理函数头文件 (memset, strcmp 等)\n#include \u003csys/socket.h\u003e     // socket 相关函数头文件\n#include \u003carpa/inet.h\u003e      // 网络地址转换相关函数头文件 (inet_ntop, htons 等)\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e         // 标准库函数头文件 (exit, malloc 等)\n#include \u003csys/time.h\u003e       // 时间相关函数头文件 (select 依赖)\n#include \u003ctime.h\u003e           // 时间处理函数头文件 (time, ctime 等)\n\n// 服务器运行状态标记: 1-运行中, 0-停止\nint Shutdown = 1;\n// 客户端 socket 数组, 存储所有已连接的客户端文件描述符\n// 初始值设为 -1 (无效值), 最大支持 1020 个客户端连接\nint client_array[1020];\nint socket_init(void);\nint return_response(int clientfd, const char *clientip);\n\n//拼接包含客户端 IP 地址的欢迎字符串，并将该字符串发送给刚建立连接的客户端\nint return_response(int clientfd, const char *clientip) {\n    char response[4096]; // 存储欢迎消息的缓冲区\n    bzero(response, sizeof(response)); // 清空缓冲区\n    // 拼接欢迎消息 (包含客户端 IP)\n    sprintf(response, \"hi %s welcome test TCP server!\\n\", clientip);\n    // 发送欢迎消息给客户端 (最后一个参数 0 表示默认发送方式)\n    send(clientfd, response, strlen(response), 0);\n    return 0;\n}\n    \nint socket_init(void) {\n    int sockfd;                     // 监听 socket 描述符\n    struct sockaddr_in sockaddr;    // 服务器地址结构体\n    // 清空地址结构体内存 (等同于 memset(\u0026sockaddr, 0, sizeof(sockaddr)))\n    bzero(\u0026sockaddr, sizeof(sockaddr));\n    sockaddr.sin_family = AF_INET;  // 设置地址族为 IPv4\n    sockaddr.sin_port = htons(8080); // 设置监听端口 8080 (htons 转换为网络字节序)\n    // 设置监听的 IP 地址为 0.0.0.0 (INADDR_ANY), 即监听所有网卡\n    sockaddr.sin_addr.s_addr = htonl(INADDR_ANY);\n    // 创建 TCP socket (SOCK_STREAM 表示流式套接字, 对应 TCP)\n    if ((sockfd = socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, 0)) == -1) {\n        perror(\"socket call failed\"); // 打印 socket 创建失败原因\n        exit(0);                      // 退出程序\n    }\n    // 将 socket 绑定到指定的 IP 和端口\n    if ((bind(sockfd, (struct sockaddr *)\u0026sockaddr, sizeof(sockaddr))) == -1) {\n        perror(\"bind call failed\"); // 打印 bind 失败原因\n        exit(0);                    // 退出程序\n    }\n    // 开始监听 socket, 最大待处理连接数为 128\n    listen(sockfd, 128);\n    return sockfd; // 返回监听 socket 描述符\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int serverfd;          // 服务器监听 socket 描述符\n    int maxfd;             // 用于 select 的最大文件描述符 (select 需监听 maxfd+1 个描述符)\n    int clientfd;          // 新连接的客户端 socket 描述符\n    int ready;             // select 返回的就绪文件描述符数量\n    struct sockaddr_in clientaddr; // 客户端地址结构体\n    socklen_t addrlen;     // 客户端地址结构体长度\n    char recv_buf[1500];    // 接收客户端数据的缓冲区\n    char client_ip[16];    // 存储客户端 IP 地址 (IPv4 地址最长 15 位 + 结束符)\n    time_t t;              // 时间戳变量\n    char time_buf[1024];   // 存储时间字符串的缓冲区\n    fd_set set, oset;      // select 用的文件描述符集合: \n                           // oset-原始集合 (保存所有需要监听的描述符), set-临时集合 (每次 select 前拷贝)\n    // 初始化监听 socket\n    serverfd = socket_init();\n    // 清空文件描述符集合\n    FD_ZERO(\u0026oset);\n    // 将监听 socket 加入原始集合 (监听新连接)\n    FD_SET(serverfd, \u0026oset);\n    // 初始化客户端 socket 数组 (所有元素设为 -1, 表示无有效连接)\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 1020; i++) {\n        client_array[i] = -1;\n    }\n    // 初始最大文件描述符为监听 socket\n    maxfd = serverfd;\n    // 打印服务器启动提示\n    printf(\"testing Select server service Running...\\n\");\n    // 服务器主循环 (Shutdown 为 1 时持续运行)\n    while (Shutdown) {\n        // 每次 select 前, 将原始集合拷贝到临时集合 (select 会修改传入的集合)\n        set = oset;\n        if ((ready = select(maxfd + 1, \u0026set, NULL, NULL, NULL)) == -1) {\n            perror(\"select call failed\"); // 打印 select 失败原因\n            exit(0);                      // 退出程序\n        }\n        // 处理所有就绪的文件描述符 (ready 为就绪数量, 处理一个减一个)\n        while (ready) {\n            // 1. 处理新客户端连接 (监听 socket 就绪)\n            if (FD_ISSET(serverfd, \u0026set)) {\n                addrlen = sizeof(clientaddr); // 设置地址结构体长度\n                // 接受新连接 (返回客户端 socket 描述符)\n                if ((clientfd = accept(serverfd, (struct sockaddr *)\u0026clientaddr, \u0026addrlen)) == -1) {\n                    perror(\"accept call failed\"); // 打印 accept 失败原因\n                    exit(0);                      // 退出程序\n                }\n                // 将客户端网络字节序的 IP 转换为字符串格式 (存储到 client_ip)\n                inet_ntop(AF_INET, \u0026clientaddr.sin_addr.s_addr, client_ip, 16);\n                // 打印客户端连接信息 (IP + 端口, ntohs 转换为主机字节序)\n                printf(\"Listen server socket success, call Accept, client ip %s client prot %d\\n\", \n                       client_ip, ntohs(clientaddr.sin_port));\n                // 向新客户端发送欢迎消息\n                return_response(clientfd, client_ip);\n                // 更新最大文件描述符 (select 需要)\n                if (maxfd \u003c clientfd) {\n                    maxfd = clientfd;\n                }\n                // 将新客户端 socket 加入客户端数组 (找第一个空闲位置)\n                for (int i = 0; i \u003c 1020; i++) {\n                    if (client_array[i] == -1) {\n                        client_array[i] = clientfd;\n                        break;\n                    }\n                }\n                // 将新客户端 socket 加入原始集合 (监听其读事件)\n                FD_SET(clientfd, \u0026oset);\n                ready--; // 就绪数减 1\n            } \n            // 2. 处理已连接客户端的读事件 (客户端发数据/断开连接)\n            else {\n                // 遍历客户端数组, 找到就绪的客户端 socket\n                for (int i = 0; i \u003c 1020; i++) {\n                    // 跳过无效连接, 检查当前客户端 socket 是否在就绪集合中\n                    if (client_array[i] != -1 \u0026\u0026 FD_ISSET(client_array[i], \u0026set)) {\n                        // 接收客户端数据 (recvlen 为实际接收的字节数)\n                        ssize_t recvlen = recv(client_array[i], recv_buf, sizeof(recv_buf), 0);\n                        // 情况1: 成功接收数据 (recvlen \u003e 0)\n                        if (recvlen \u003e 0) {\n                            recv_buf[recvlen] = '\\0'; // 手动添加字符串结束符 (避免乱码)                            \n                            // 判断客户端是否发送 \"gettime\\n\" 命令 (获取当前时间)\n                            if (strcmp(recv_buf, \"gettime\\n\") == 0) {\n                                bzero(time_buf, sizeof(time_buf)); // 清空时间缓冲区\n                                t = time(NULL);                   // 获取当前时间戳\n                                ctime_r(\u0026t, time_buf);            // 将时间戳转换为字符串 (线程安全版本)\n                                // 发送时间字符串给客户端\n                                send(client_array[i], time_buf, strlen(time_buf), 0);\n                                bzero(time_buf, sizeof(time_buf)); // 清空缓冲区\n                            } \n                            // 其他命令: 提示重试\n                            else {\n                                send(client_array[i], \"Please Try Again...\\n\", 20, 0);\n                            }\n                        } \n                        // 情况2: 客户端断开连接 (recvlen == 0)\n                        else if (recvlen == 0) {\n                            // 从原始集合中移除该客户端 socket (不再监听)\n                            FD_CLR(client_array[i], \u0026oset);\n                            close(client_array[i]); // 关闭客户端 socket\n                            client_array[i] = -1;    // 标记为无效连接\n                            printf(\"User exiting, delete this listen item.\\n\"); // 打印断开提示\n                        }\n                        ready--; // 就绪数减 1\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    // 服务器停止: 打印提示并关闭监听 socket\n    printf(\"server down...\\n\");\n     // 优化：关闭所有客户端连接\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 1020; i++) {\n        if (client_array[i] != -1) {\n            close(client_array[i]);\n        }\n    }\n    close(serverfd);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4zyzkgm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4zyzkgm","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"select 模型利弊"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-4cbmpcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-4cbmpcn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以通过简单的代码实现一对多效果，比较轻量\nselect 模型拥有很强的兼容性，各个平台和语言都有实现\n支持微秒级别的定时阻塞监听，如果对时间精度有需求，select 可以满足\n较为适合监听数量较小(局域网)等场景"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-uwpust9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-uwpust9","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：\n监听数量较小，最大只能监听 1024，无法满足高并发需求\n轮询问题，随着轮询数量的增长，IO 处理性能呈线性下降\n用户需要对传入传出监听集合进行分离设置\nselect 只返回就绪的数量，没有反馈就绪的 socket，需要用户自行遍历查找，开销较大\nselect 可以监听的事件较少，select 设置监听是批处理以集合为单位的，无法对不同的 socket 设置不同的事件监听\nselect 多轮使用会出现大量重复的拷贝开销和挂载监听开销"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-p4625tt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-p4625tt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260122230305941"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260122230305941.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-eld1bps","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-eld1bps","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"POLL 模型"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sj66ax1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sj66ax1","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"poll 模型允许用户自定义长度数组，作为监听集合，每个元素都是 struct pollfd node\nstruct pollfd listen_array[100000];\t//自定义长度\nstruct pollfd node;\nnode.fd=sockfd;\t//存储监听的 socket,取消监听设成-1\nnode.event=POLLIN || POLLOUT || POLLERR\t//设置要监听的 socket 事件\nnode.revents= POLLIN\t//当 socket 就绪后，传出就绪事件，后续使用 revents 判断 socket 就绪"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vuzs5yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vuzs5yt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"int ready=poll(listen_array, int nfds, int timeout);\ttimeout(-1 阻塞)\t(\u003e0 定时阻塞)\t(0 非阻塞)\n//poll 默认阻塞监听，监听到就绪后返回就绪的数量，用户处理就绪即可"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-igb43lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-igb43lm","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以用 poll 的监听数组，存储所有客户端 socket"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3ui23if","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3ui23if","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e          // 标准输入输出头文件\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e         // Unix 标准函数头文件 (close, read, write 等)\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e         // 字符串处理函数头文件 (memset, strcmp 等)\n#include \u003csys/socket.h\u003e     // socket 相关函数头文件\n#include \u003carpa/inet.h\u003e      // 网络地址转换相关函数头文件 (inet_ntop, htons 等)\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e         // 标准库函数头文件 (exit, malloc 等)\n#include \u003cpoll.h\u003e           // poll 模型核心头文件 (替代 sys/time.h)\n#include \u003ctime.h\u003e           // 时间处理函数头文件 (time, ctime 等)\n// 服务器运行状态标记: 1-运行中, 0-停止\nint Shutdown = 1;\n// 最大支持的连接数\t\n#define MAX_CONNECTIONS 4000\n// pollfd 结构体数组: 存储所有要监听的文件描述符及事件 (替代 select 的 fd_set 和 client_array)\nstruct pollfd fds[MAX_CONNECTIONS];\t\t//即是监听集合又是socket数组\n// 已连接的客户端数量 (用于维护 pollfd 数组)\nint client_count = 0;\nint socket_init(void);\nint return_response(int clientfd, const char *clientip);\n// 拼接包含客户端 IP 地址的欢迎字符串，并将该字符串发送给刚建立连接的客户端\n\nint return_response(int clientfd, const char *clientip) {\n    char response[4096]; // 存储欢迎消息的缓冲区\n    bzero(response, sizeof(response)); // 清空缓冲区\n    // 拼接欢迎消息 (包含客户端 IP)\n    sprintf(response, \"hi %s welcome test TCP server!\\n\", clientip);\n    // 发送欢迎消息给客户端 (最后一个参数 0 表示默认发送方式)\n    send(clientfd, response, strlen(response), 0);\n    return 0;\n}\n\nint socket_init(void) {\n    int sockfd;                     // 监听 socket 描述符\n    struct sockaddr_in sockaddr;    // 服务器地址结构体\n    // 清空地址结构体内存 (等同于 memset(\u0026sockaddr, 0, sizeof(sockaddr)))\n    bzero(\u0026sockaddr, sizeof(sockaddr));\n    sockaddr.sin_family = AF_INET;  // 设置地址族为 IPv4\n    sockaddr.sin_port = htons(8080); // 设置监听端口 8080 (htons 转换为网络字节序)\n    // 设置监听的 IP 地址为 0.0.0.0 (INADDR_ANY), 即监听所有网卡\n    sockaddr.sin_addr.s_addr = htonl(INADDR_ANY);\n    // 创建 TCP socket (SOCK_STREAM 表示流式套接字, 对应 TCP)\n    if ((sockfd = socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, 0)) == -1) {\n        perror(\"socket call failed\"); // 打印 socket 创建失败原因\n        exit(0);                      // 退出程序\n    }\n    // 将 socket 绑定到指定的 IP 和端口\n    if ((bind(sockfd, (struct sockaddr *)\u0026sockaddr, sizeof(sockaddr))) == -1) {\n        perror(\"bind call failed\"); // 打印 bind 失败原因\n        exit(0);                    // 退出程序\n    }\n    // 开始监听 socket, 最大待处理连接数为 128\n    listen(sockfd, 128);\n    return sockfd; // 返回监听 socket 描述符\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int serverfd;          // 服务器监听 socket 描述符\n    int ready;             // poll 返回的就绪文件描述符数量\n    int clientfd;          // 新连接的客户端 socket 描述符\n    struct sockaddr_in clientaddr; // 客户端地址结构体\n    socklen_t addrlen;     // 客户端地址结构体长度\n    char recv_buf[1500];   // 接收客户端数据的缓冲区\n    char client_ip[16];    // 存储客户端 IP 地址 (IPv4 地址最长 15 位 + 结束符)\n    time_t t;              // 时间戳变量\n    char time_buf[1024];   // 存储时间字符串的缓冲区\n    // 1. 初始化监听 socket\n    serverfd = socket_init();\n    // 2. 初始化 pollfd 数组 (核心改造点：替代 select 的 fd_set)\n    // 先清空整个 pollfd 数组\n    bzero(fds, sizeof(fds));\n    // 配置监听 socket 的 pollfd 结构体 (数组第 0 位固定给监听 socket)\n    fds[0].fd = serverfd;\n    fds[0].events = POLLIN; // 监听读事件 (新连接到来属于读事件)\n    fds[0].revents = 0;     // 实际发生的事件，由 poll 填充，初始化为 0\n    \n    // 3. 初始化剩余 pollfd 项 (fd = -1 表示该位置空闲，不监听)\n    for (int i = 1; i \u003c MAX_CONNECTIONS; i++) {\n        fds[i].fd = -1;\n        fds[i].events = 0;\n        fds[i].revents = 0;\n    }\n    // 4. 打印服务器启动提示\n    printf(\"testing Poll server service Running...\\n\");\n    // 5. 服务器主循环 (Shutdown 为 1 时持续运行)\n    while (Shutdown) {\n        // 调用 poll 监听所有有效文件描述符 (核心改造点：替代 select)\n        // 参数说明：\n        // 1. fds: pollfd 数组首地址\n        // 2. MAX_CONNECTIONS: 要监听的 pollfd 数组长度\n        // 3. -1: 超时时间 (永久阻塞，直到有事件就绪，等同于 select 的 NULL)\n        if ((ready = poll(fds, MAX_CONNECTIONS, -1)) == -1) {\n            perror(\"poll call failed\"); // 打印 poll 失败原因\n            exit(0);                    // 退出程序\n        }        \n        // 6. 处理所有就绪的文件描述符 (遍历 pollfd 数组，处理就绪事件)\n        for (int i = 0; i \u003c MAX_CONNECTIONS \u0026\u0026 ready \u003e 0; i++) {\n            // 跳过空闲的 pollfd 项 (fd = -1)\n            if (fds[i].fd == -1) {\n                continue;\n            }          \n            // 检查当前 pollfd 是否有就绪事件 (revents 与 events 匹配)\n            if (!(fds[i].revents \u0026 POLLIN)) {\n                continue;\n            }           \n            // 就绪数减 1 (处理一个就绪事件)\n            ready--;   \n            // 7. 处理新客户端连接 (监听 socket 就绪，对应 pollfd 数组第 0 位)\n            if (fds[i].fd == serverfd) {\n                addrlen = sizeof(clientaddr); // 设置地址结构体长度\n                // 接受新连接 (返回客户端 socket 描述符)\n                if ((clientfd = accept(serverfd, (struct sockaddr *)\u0026clientaddr, \u0026addrlen)) == -1) {\n                    perror(\"accept call failed\"); // 打印 accept 失败原因\n                    exit(0);                      // 退出程序\n                }              \n                // 将客户端网络字节序的 IP 转换为字符串格式 (存储到 client_ip)\n                inet_ntop(AF_INET, \u0026clientaddr.sin_addr.s_addr, client_ip, 16);               \n                // 打印客户端连接信息 (IP + 端口，ntohs 转换为主机字节序)\n                printf(\"Listen server socket success, call Accept, client ip %s client port %d\\n\", \n                       client_ip, ntohs(clientaddr.sin_port));           \n                // 向新客户端发送欢迎消息\n                return_response(clientfd, client_ip);              \n                // 8. 找到 pollfd 数组中的空闲位置，配置新客户端的监听事件\n                int free_index = -1;\n                for (int j = 1; j \u003c MAX_CONNECTIONS; j++) {\n                    if (fds[j].fd == -1) {\n                        free_index = j;\n                        break;\n                    }\n                }                \n                // 检查是否超出最大连接数\n                if (free_index == -1) {\n                    printf(\"Max connections reached, reject client %s\\n\", client_ip);\n                    close(clientfd);\n                    continue;\n                }               \n                // 配置新客户端的 pollfd 结构体\n                fds[free_index].fd = clientfd;\n                fds[free_index].events = POLLIN; // 监听客户端的读事件 (发数据/断开连接)\n                fds[free_index].revents = 0;\n                // 更新已连接客户端数量\n                client_count++;\n            } \n            // 9. 处理已连接客户端的读事件 (客户端发数据/断开连接)\n            else {\n                // 接收客户端数据 (recvlen 为实际接收的字节数)\n                ssize_t recvlen = recv(fds[i].fd, recv_buf, sizeof(recv_buf) - 1, 0); // 留 1 位给 '\\0'\n                // 情况1: 成功接收数据 (recvlen \u003e 0)\n                if (recvlen \u003e 0) {\n                    recv_buf[recvlen] = '\\0'; // 手动添加字符串结束符 (避免乱码)                    \n                    // 判断客户端是否发送 \"gettime\\n\" 命令 (获取当前时间)\n                    if (strcmp(recv_buf, \"gettime\\n\") == 0) {\n                        bzero(time_buf, sizeof(time_buf)); // 清空时间缓冲区\n                        t = time(NULL);                   // 获取当前时间戳\n                        ctime_r(\u0026t, time_buf);            // 将时间戳转换为字符串 (线程安全版本)\n                        // 发送时间字符串给客户端\n                        send(fds[i].fd, time_buf, strlen(time_buf), 0);\n                        bzero(time_buf, sizeof(time_buf)); // 清空缓冲区\n                    } \n                    // 其他命令: 提示重试\n                    else {\n                        send(fds[i].fd, \"Please Try Again...\\n\", 20, 0);\n                    }\n                } \n                // 情况2: 客户端断开连接 (recvlen == 0) 或接收失败 (recvlen == -1)\n                else {\n                    if (recvlen == 0) {\n                        printf(\"User exiting, delete this listen item.\\n\"); // 打印断开提示\n                    } else {\n                        perror(\"recv call failed\");\n                    }\n                    \n                    // 关闭客户端 socket\n                    close(fds[i].fd);\n                    // 标记该 pollfd 项为空闲 (fd = -1)，不再监听\n                    fds[i].fd = -1;\n                    fds[i].events = 0;\n                    fds[i].revents = 0;\n                    // 更新已连接客户端数量\n                    client_count--;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }   \n    // 10. 服务器停止: 关闭所有连接\n    printf(\"server down...\\n\");\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c MAX_CONNECTIONS; i++) {\n        if (fds[i].fd != -1) {\n            close(fds[i].fd);\n        }\n    }  \n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-h9c5czp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-h9c5czp","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"命令查看系统可以使用的描述符最大值\tcat /proc/sys/fs/file-max\nsudo vi /etc/security/limits.conf"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0xffhb9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0xffhb9","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"POLL 模型利弊"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-y6xgad0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-y6xgad0","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"poll 可以监听的事件数量更丰富\npoll 可以对不同的 socket 进行不同的监听设置，设置方式更灵活\n进行了传入传出分离设置，event 传入监听的事件，revents 传出就绪事件"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5khgnw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5khgnw2","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"轮询问题，随着轮询数量的增长，IO 处理性能呈线性下降？\npoll 只返回就绪的数量，没有反馈就绪的 socket，需要用户自行遍历查找，开销较大\npoll 多轮使用会出现大量重复的拷贝开销和挂载监听开销"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-kjne732","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-kjne732","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"EPOLL 模型"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9rbmb28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9rbmb28","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260124132404240"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260124132404240.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n无法变更监听的 socket 只能修改监听的事件\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"epoll 监听到就绪后，会将就绪的节点传出到就绪队列中，用户只需要遍历就绪队列处理这些节点即可"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-62sws6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-62sws6t","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260124132018985"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260124132018985.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260124132207425"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260124132207425.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gk1nlsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gk1nlsr","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"epoll 的监听树在内核层创建，每个监听节点只拷贝一次并且只挂载一次，避免了重复拷贝和挂载的开销"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n红黑树，双向链表(就绪链表)，等待队列"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-kqgk4q2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-kqgk4q2","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"callback 将监听的数据变为 epitem，与网络设备绑定，实现监听"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pitem"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 不直接和「网络设备（网卡）」绑定，而是和「被监听的文件描述符（socket）」绑定，最终通过内核协议栈、中断机制间接关联到网络设备。"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vucf05f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vucf05f","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"callback(),将就绪的 epitem 传出到就绪链表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"epoll_wait，进行阻塞监听，进程挂起到等待队列中"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n**callback(),传出完就绪唤醒等待进程\t**\tpthread_cond 条件变量实现挂起唤醒"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-2jq68ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-2jq68ee","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遍历链表，有就绪则拷贝传出\t\t就绪链表使用时，采用 Spinlock 旋转锁"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-a85682i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-a85682i","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内核层就绪链表传到用户层就绪数组中 epoll_event[ ]\t当就绪链表检测到有可传出数据后，将就绪数据拷贝到用户层数组中，便于处理"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-o4lc5sf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o4lc5sf","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"EPOLL 模型利弊"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ekq81i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ekq81i4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"epoll 有强大的监听能力，而且没有额外开销，理论上可以监听系统最大描述符数量\nepoll 监听到就绪直接传出就绪的 socket 到用户层，用户直接处理即可\nepoll 有丰富的监听事件，设置监听的灵活性更好"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-s6fgdrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-s6fgdrw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"epoll 较为适合高并发低活跃场景\nselect 适用于低监听量，高活跃的场景"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-meezpja","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-meezpja","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"epoll 代码"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-x0udl7m","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-x0udl7m","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e          // 标准输入输出头文件\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e         // Unix 标准函数头文件 (close, read, write 等)\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e         // 字符串处理函数头文件 (memset, strcmp 等)\n#include \u003csys/socket.h\u003e     // socket 相关函数头文件\n#include \u003carpa/inet.h\u003e      // 网络地址转换相关函数头文件 (inet_ntop, htons 等)\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e         // 标准库函数头文件 (exit, malloc 等)\n#include \u003csys/epoll.h\u003e      // epoll 模型核心头文件\n#include \u003ctime.h\u003e           // 时间处理函数头文件 (time, ctime 等)\n#define MAX_EVENTS 20000\n// 服务器运行状态标记: 1-运行中, 0-停止\nint Shutdown = 1;\nstruct epoll_event client_array[MAX_EVENTS]; // 用于接收就绪事件的队列\n// 拼接包含客户端 IP 地址的欢迎字符串，并将该字符串发送给刚建立连接的客户端\nint return_response(int clientfd, const char *clientip);\nint socket_init(void);\nint return_response(int clientfd, const char *clientip) {\n    char response[4096]; // 存储欢迎消息的缓冲区\n    bzero(response, sizeof(response)); // 清空缓冲区\n    // 拼接欢迎消息 (包含客户端 IP)\n    sprintf(response, \"hi %s welcome test TCP server!\\n\", clientip);\n    // 发送欢迎消息给客户端 (最后一个参数 0 表示默认发送方式)\n    send(clientfd, response, strlen(response), 0);\n    return 0;\n}\n\n// 初始化 socket (保留原核心逻辑，无多余修改)\nint socket_init(void) {\n    int sockfd;                     // 监听 socket 描述符\n    struct sockaddr_in sockaddr;    // 服务器地址结构体\n    bzero(\u0026sockaddr, sizeof(sockaddr));\n    sockaddr.sin_family = AF_INET;  // 设置地址族为 IPv4\n    sockaddr.sin_port = htons(8080); // 设置监听端口 8080 (htons 转换为网络字节序)\n    sockaddr.sin_addr.s_addr = htonl(INADDR_ANY); // 监听所有网卡\n    // 创建 TCP socket\n    if ((sockfd = socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, 0)) == -1) {\n        perror(\"socket call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    // 绑定 IP 和端口\n    if ((bind(sockfd, (struct sockaddr *)\u0026sockaddr, sizeof(sockaddr))) == -1) {\n        perror(\"bind call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    // 开始监听 socket, 最大待处理连接数为 128\n    listen(sockfd, 128);\n    return sockfd; // 返回监听 socket 描述符\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int serverfd;          // 服务器监听 socket 描述符\n    int epollfd;           // epoll 实例描述符\n    int ready;             // epoll_wait 返回的就绪事件数量\n    int clientfd;          // 新连接的客户端 socket 描述符\n    struct sockaddr_in clientaddr; // 客户端地址结构体\n    socklen_t addrlen = sizeof(clientaddr); // 客户端地址结构体长度\n    char recv_buf[1500];   // 接收客户端数据的缓冲区\n    char client_ip[16];    // 存储客户端 IP 地址 (IPv4 地址最长 15 位 + 结束符)\n    time_t t;              // 时间戳变量\n    char time_buf[1024];   // 存储时间字符串的缓冲区\n    bzero(time_buf,sizeof(time_buf));\n\tbzero(recv_buf,sizeof(recv_buf));\n\tbzero(client_ip,sizeof(client_ip));\n    // epoll 核心：就绪事件队列 (替代原 pollfd 数组)\n    struct epoll_event ev;          // 用于注册事件的结构体\n    // 1. 初始化监听 socket\n    serverfd = socket_init();\n    // 2. 创建 epoll 实例 (参数 \u003e0 即可，内核会忽略具体值，仅用于兼容旧版本)\t创建监听树\n    if ((epollfd = epoll_create(1)) == -1) {\n        perror(\"epoll_create call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    // 3. 注册监听 socket 的读事件到 epoll 实例\n    ev.events = EPOLLIN;    // 监听读事件 (新连接到来)\n    ev.data.fd = serverfd;  // 绑定监听 socket 描述符\n    if (epoll_ctl(epollfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, serverfd, \u0026ev) == -1) {\n        perror(\"epoll_ctl add serverfd failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    // 4. 打印服务器启动提示\n    printf(\"testing Epoll server service Running...\\n\");\n    // 5. 服务器主循环 (Shutdown 为 1 时持续运行)\n    while (Shutdown) {\n        // 调用 epoll_wait 等待就绪事件 (核心：替代 poll，填充就绪队列 client_array)\n        // 参数说明：\n        // 1. epollfd: epoll 实例描述符\n        // 2. client_array: 接收就绪事件的缓冲区 (就绪队列)\n        // 3. MAX_EVENTS: 一次最多接收的就绪事件数\n        // 4. -1: 永久阻塞，直到有事件就绪\n        ready = epoll_wait(epollfd, client_array, MAX_EVENTS, -1);\n        if (ready == -1) {\n            perror(\"epoll_wait call failed\");\n            exit(0);\n        }\n        // 6. 遍历就绪队列，处理所有就绪事件\n        for (int i = 0; i \u003c ready; i++) {\n            // 过滤无效事件 (非读事件，直接跳过)\n            if (!(client_array[i].events \u0026 EPOLLIN)) {\n                continue;\n            }\n            // 7. 处理新客户端连接 (监听 socket 就绪)\n            if (client_array[i].data.fd == serverfd) {\n                // 接受新连接\n                clientfd = accept(serverfd, (struct sockaddr *)\u0026clientaddr, \u0026addrlen);\n                if (clientfd == -1) {\n                    perror(\"accept call failed\");\n                    continue;\n                }\n                // 转换客户端 IP 为字符串格式\n                inet_ntop(AF_INET, \u0026clientaddr.sin_addr.s_addr, client_ip, 16);\n                // 打印客户端连接信息\n                printf(\"Listen server socket success, call Accept, client ip %s client port %d\\n\", \n                       client_ip, ntohs(clientaddr.sin_port));\n                // 向新客户端发送欢迎消息\n                return_response(clientfd, client_ip);\n                // 8. 将新客户端 socket 注册到 epoll 实例，监听读事件\n                ev.events = EPOLLIN;\n                ev.data.fd = clientfd;\n                if (epoll_ctl(epollfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, clientfd, \u0026ev) == -1) {\n                    perror(\"epoll_ctl add clientfd failed\");\n                    close(clientfd);\n                    continue;\n                }\n            } \n            // 9. 处理已连接客户端的读事件 (客户端发数据/断开连接)\n            else {\n                int connfd = client_array[i].data.fd; // 取出客户端 socket 描述符\n                // 接收客户端数据\n                ssize_t recvlen = recv(connfd, recv_buf, sizeof(recv_buf) - 1, 0);\n                // 情况1: 成功接收数据 (recvlen \u003e 0)\n                if (recvlen \u003e 0) {\n                    recv_buf[recvlen] = '\\0'; // 手动添加字符串结束符 (避免乱码)\n                    // 判断客户端是否发送 \"gettime\\n\" 命令 (获取当前时间)\n                    if (strcmp(recv_buf, \"gettime\\n\") == 0) {\n                        bzero(time_buf, sizeof(time_buf));\n                        t = time(NULL);\n                        ctime_r(\u0026t, time_buf); // 线程安全版本的时间转换\n                        send(connfd, time_buf, strlen(time_buf), 0);\n                    } \n                    // 其他命令: 提示重试\n                    else {\n                        send(connfd, \"Please Try Again...\\n\", 20, 0);\n                    }\n                    // 清空 recv_buf，避免下一次接收残留垃圾数据\n                    memset(recv_buf, 0, sizeof(recv_buf));\n                } \n                // 情况2: 客户端断开连接 (recvlen == 0) 或接收失败 (recvlen == -1)\n                else {\n                    if (recvlen == 0) {\n                        printf(\"User exiting, remove this connection from epoll.\\n\");\n                    } else {\n                        perror(\"recv call failed\");\n                    }\n                    // 从 epoll 实例中删除该客户端连接\n                    epoll_ctl(epollfd, EPOLL_CTL_DEL, connfd, NULL);\n                    // 关闭客户端 socket\n                    close(connfd);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }   \n    // 10. 服务器停止: 关闭所有资源\n    printf(\"server down...\\n\");\n    close(serverfd);\n    close(epollfd);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cv42olh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cv42olh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"EPOLL+ 线程池模型"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9t6jydm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9t6jydm","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"强大的 socket 监听能力，可以快速察觉所有套接字的处理能力，大量的用户请求可以快速处理"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-w8ox53e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-w8ox53e","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"负载均衡技术"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-27c69ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-27c69ym","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260125105018402"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260125105018402.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-v8035bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-v8035bk","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量的用户请求可能导致任务分发不均，导致资源浪费，不能很好的处理和响应\n通过预先设定的分发策略，最大的尝试均匀分发业务，让每台处理机都有任务负载"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-zlhm0np","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-zlhm0np","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代理服务器"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-28rxji0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-28rxji0","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代理服务器是一个数据中转为主要职责的中间件，代理服务器可以将用户的请求中转给处理服务机，也可以将结果反馈给用户，避免用户直接访问服务器主机，提高安全性(安全策略都可以部署在代理服务器中)，还可以进行任务的控制与分发"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5lvyij7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5lvyij7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HA 高可用结构"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-drogfpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-drogfpv","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"某个处理机宕机，可以通过 HA 概念将数据任务转发给正常的处理机\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260125111433919"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260125111433919.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-uh9uee8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-uh9uee8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"察觉处理机异常快速反应"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-88hevcs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-88hevcs","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程池"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-z9geklz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-z9geklz","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处理能力——————\u003e 线程池技术"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-l8esqpx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-l8esqpx","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程池设计原则"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-mq9lvau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-mq9lvau","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提高线程重用性，线程不能与用户绑定，可以重复为多个用户处理业务，避免频繁创建销毁线程，减少不必要开销\n预创建，提前准备好部分线程待用，用户发送请求后直接选择线程处理，提高响应速度\n线程管理策略，设定线程池阈值，通过阈值管理调度线程，线程扩容与缩减\n为服务器提供并发处理能力，可以更快处理请求或业务\n提高线程池的重用性，用户实现任务，线程池负责执行任务\n线程池使用生产者消费者实现\t任务传递"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vz9ycsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vz9ycsh","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生产者，消费者，管理者"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-8ep8peu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-8ep8peu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为服务器提供了良好的线程并发处理能力，以及多线程管理能力\nEPOLL 完成大量 socket 的网络事件监听，将事件转换为业务，投递到线程池中"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6t1uf1j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6t1uf1j","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程池工作流程图"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-lfbd0rn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-lfbd0rn","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126110234864"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260126110234864.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-d9478cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-d9478cu","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260125114618762"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260125114618762.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-66z3ue9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-66z3ue9","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"管理者：使用线程池最小阈值 min 作为扩容缩减数量"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-zmv8rjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-zmv8rjq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当前任务量 \u003e=闲置消费者数量\t\t忙线程数量占存活线程数量的 70%\n当前线程数量 + 扩容量 \u003c 最大线程阈值"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vt08jt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vt08jt7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"闲置线程是忙线程的倍速，进行缩减\n当前线程数-缩减量 \u003e=最小阈值\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260125160300822.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260125155850099"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260125155850099.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-qhkv212","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qhkv212","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"EPOLL 的水平触发监听模式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bm87k2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bm87k2o","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260126163447160"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"C:/Users/zhanr/AppData/Roaming/Typora/typora-user-images/image-20260126163447160.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bso6qu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bso6qu5","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"epoll_wait 立即返回\n水平触发模式，一轮监听的事件未处理完毕，不允许进行下一轮监听，如果用户使用 epoll_wait ，函数不会阻塞，会立即返回，返回值为未处理完毕的事件数量"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hmvwetc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hmvwetc","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水平触发模式是 epoll 的默认监听模式，开销较大但是可以保证数据处理及时性和完整性"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-44udak4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-44udak4","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"EPOLL 边缘触发模式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-kn8tlni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-kn8tlni","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"监听到就绪后，只会发送一次处理通知，后续用户是否还会处理与 epoll 无关\n边缘触发模式下，一次就绪事件未处理完毕，可以使用 epoll_wait 直接进行第二轮监听"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-l48lx5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-l48lx5l","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设置监听模式以 socket 为单位，比较灵活，不同的 socket 可以用不同的监听模式"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xb17a1l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xb17a1l","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"EPOLL 线程池代码"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-et2l6lb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-et2l6lb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"server.h"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1bhtpbi","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1bhtpbi","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include\u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cunistd.h\u003e\n#include \u003csignal.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n#include \u003cpthread.h\u003e\n#include\u003cerrno.h\u003e\n#include\u003csys/socket.h\u003e\n#include\u003carpa/inet.h\u003e\n#include\u003csys/epoll.h\u003e\n\n#define TIMEOUT 1\n#define BACKLOG 128\n#define EPOLLMAX 100000\npthread_mutex_t lock;\nint\tepfd;\t//全局监听树描述符\npthread_t ptid;\t//存储输出线程的id信息\n// 任务结构体：存储业务函数指针和函数参数\ntypedef struct\n{\n\t    void *(*busines)(void *);  // 业务函数指针（对应生产者消费者模型的核心）\n\t\t    void *arg;                 // 业务函数的参数\n}bs_t;\n\n// 线程池结构体\ntypedef struct\n{\n\t    int thread_shutdown; // 线程池开关\t1开 0关\n\t    int thread_max;      // 最大线程数\n\t    int thread_min;      // 最小线程数\n\t    int thread_alive;    \n\t    int thread_busy;     // 繁忙线程数\n\t    int kill_number;    // 缩减码（预留字段）\n    \n    //任务队列\n\t    bs_t *queue;         // 任务队列\t环形队列\n\t\tint front;           // 队列头指针\n\t\tint rear;            // 队列尾指针\n\t\tint cur;             // 当前队列中的任务数\n\t\tint max;             // 队列最大容量\n\t\tpthread_cond_t Not_Full;   // 队列不满条件变量（生产者等待）\n\t\tpthread_cond_t Not_Empty;  // 队列不空条件变量（消费者等待）\n\t\tpthread_t * ctids;    // 存储消费者线程ID数组 \n\t\tpthread_t mtid;      // 存储管理者线程ID\n}pool_t; // 线程池类型\n\npool_t * PTR;\n\n// 函数声明（保持原有接口，语法无错误）\npool_t* thread_pool_create(int Max,int Min ,int Qmax); // 线程池创建初始化\nint Producer_add_task(pool_t *p , bs_t bs);        // 生产者添加任务模块，执行一次添加一次任务\nvoid *Customer_thread(void * arg);                 // 消费者线程，参数为线程池地址\nvoid *Manager_thread(void * arg);                  // 管理者线程，参数为线程池地址\nint thread_pool_destroy(pool_t *p);                // 销毁线程池资源\n\nvoid *user_business(void * arg); // 自定义实现业务（用户需自行编写具体逻辑）\nint if_thread_alive(pthread_t tid);\t//测试线程存活\n\nint Net_init(void);\t//网络初始化\nint Epoll_Create(int serverfd);\t//epoll初始化\nint Epoll_Listened(int serverfd);\t//监听\n\nvoid * Busines_Accept(void * arg);\t//连接业务\nvoid * Busines_Retime(void * arg);\t//时间业务\nvoid * print_thread(void * arg);\t//显示线程\nvoid * sig_usr(int);\t//捕捉函数\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bahqmn6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bahqmn6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"thread_pool_create.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0n95h5o","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0n95h5o","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cserver.h\u003e\n// 线程池创建与初始化函数\n// 参数：max-最大线程数，min-最小线程数，Qmax-任务队列最大容量\n// 返回值：成功返回线程池指针，失败退出程序\npool_t *thread_pool_create(int max, int min, int Qmax)\n{\n    /* ========== 1. 申请线程池结构体内存 ========== */\n    pool_t *ptr = NULL;\n    if ((ptr = (pool_t *)malloc(sizeof(pool_t))) == NULL)\n    {\n        perror(\"thread_pool_create error, malloc pool Failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    /* ========== 2. 初始化线程池核心参数 ========== */\n    ptr-\u003ethread_shutdown = 1;      // 线程池初始状态\n    ptr-\u003ethread_max = max;         // 设置最大线程数\n    ptr-\u003ethread_min = min;         // 设置最小线程数\n    ptr-\u003ethread_alive = 0;         // 当前存活线程数初始为0\n    ptr-\u003ethread_busy = 0;          // 当前繁忙线程数初始为0\n    ptr-\u003ekill_number = 0;          // 待销毁的线程数初始为0（预留的缩容字段）\n    /* ========== 3. 初始化任务队列 ========== */\n    // 为任务队列分配内存，容量为 Qmax\n    if ((ptr-\u003equeue = (bs_t *)malloc(sizeof(bs_t) * Qmax)) == NULL)\n    {\n        perror(\"thread_pool_create error, malloc queue Failed\");\n         free(ptr);  // 释放前面已经分配的线程池结构体内存\n    \t ptr = NULL;\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    /* ========== 4. 初始化消费者线程ID数组 ========== */\n    // 为线程ID数组分配内存，容量为最大线程数 max\n    if ((ptr-\u003ectids = (pthread_t *)malloc(sizeof(pthread_t) * max)) == NULL)\n    {\n        perror(\"thread_pool_create, malloc ctids Failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    // 初始化线程ID数组，清空脏数据\n    bzero(ptr-\u003ectids, sizeof(pthread_t) * max);\n    /* ========== 5. 初始化队列指针与状态 ========== */\n    ptr-\u003efront = 0;    // 队列头指针初始化为0\n    ptr-\u003erear = 0;     // 队列尾指针初始化为0\n    ptr-\u003ecur = 0;      // 当前队列任务数初始化为0\n    ptr-\u003emax = Qmax;   // 队列最大容量设置为 Qmax\n    /* ========== 6. 初始化条件变量 ========== */\n    if (pthread_cond_init(\u0026ptr-\u003eNot_Full, NULL) != 0 || \n        pthread_cond_init(\u0026ptr-\u003eNot_Empty, NULL) != 0||\n        pthread_mutex_init(\u0026lock,NULL)!=0)\n    {\n        printf(\"thread_pool_create err, init Lock or Cond Failed!\\n\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    /* ========== 7. 创建最小数量的消费者线程 ========== */\n    int err;\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c min; i++)\n    {\n        // 创建消费者线程，绑定线程函数 Customer_thread\n        if ((err = pthread_create(\u0026ptr-\u003ectids[i], NULL, Customer_thread, (void *)ptr)) \u003e 0)\n        {\n            printf(\"thread_pool_create error, create customer thread failed:%s\\n\", strerror(err));\n            exit(0);\n        }\n        ptr-\u003ethread_alive++;  // 存活线程数加1\n    }\n    /* ========== 8. 创建管理者线程 ========== */\n    if ((err = pthread_create(\u0026ptr-\u003emtid, NULL, Manager_thread, (void *)ptr)) \u003e 0)\n    {\n        printf(\"thread_pool_create error, create Manager thread failed:%s\\n\", strerror(err));\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    pthread_create(\u0026ptid,NULL,print_thread,(void*)ptr);\n    // 返回初始化完成的线程池指针\n    return ptr;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3hnqgx2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3hnqgx2","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Producer_add_task.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-vvap34z","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vvap34z","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cserver.h\u003e\n// 生产者添加任务函数\n// 参数：p - 线程池指针；bs - 要添加的任务（包含业务函数和参数）\n// 返回值：成功返回0，失败返回-1（或其他错误码）\nint Producer_add_task(pool_t *p, bs_t bs)\n{\n    // 1. 先检查线程池是否处于运行状态（thread_shutdown为0表示关闭，为1表示运行，这里逻辑与之前修正的保持一致）\n    if (p-\u003ethread_shutdown)\n    {\n        // 2. 加锁，保护任务队列的共享访问\n        pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);\n        // 3. 循环等待：如果任务队列已满，就阻塞在Not_full条件变量上\n        // 使用while而不是if，是为了防止虚假唤醒（被唤醒后再次检查队列是否真的不满）\n        while (p-\u003ecur == p-\u003emax)\n        {\n            // 等待队列不满的信号，等待期间会自动释放lock，被唤醒时重新获取lock\n            pthread_cond_wait(\u0026p-\u003eNot_Full, \u0026lock);\n            // 4. 被唤醒后，再次检查线程池是否已关闭\n            if (!p-\u003ethread_shutdown)\n            {\n                // 线程池已关闭，解锁并退出\n                pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);\n                printf(\"thread_pool is shutdown, Producer thread exit.\\n\");\n                pthread_exit(NULL);\n            }\n        }\n        // 5. 队列有空闲，添加任务到队列\n        p-\u003equeue[p-\u003efront].busines = bs.busines;  // 复制业务函数指针\n        p-\u003equeue[p-\u003efront].arg = bs.arg;          // 复制业务函数参数\n        // 6. 更新队列状态\n        p-\u003ecur++;                                // 当前任务数+1\n        p-\u003efront = (p-\u003efront + 1) % p-\u003emax;        // 队头指针循环后移\n        // 7. 解锁\n        pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);\n        pthread_kill(ptid,SIGUSR1);\n        // 8. 唤醒一个等待任务的消费者线程\n        pthread_cond_signal(\u0026p-\u003eNot_Empty);\n        // 打印日志：当前生产者线程ID、添加的业务函数地址\n        printf(\"Producer thread [0x%x] add Business success, business_addr = %p\\n\", \n               (unsigned int)pthread_self(), bs.busines);\n    }\n    else\n    {\n        // 线程池已关闭，无法添加任务\n        printf(\"thread_pool is shutdown, Producer thread exit.\\n\");\n        pthread_exit(NULL);\n    }\n    // 9. 任务添加成功\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-alxv7ka","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-alxv7ka","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Customer_thread.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-34bg7kt","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-34bg7kt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cserver.h\u003e  // 引入服务器相关的头文件，包含线程池、业务结构体等定义\n// 消费者线程函数：从线程池的任务队列中取出任务并执行\n// 参数 arg：指向线程池结构体(pool_t)的指针\nvoid *Customer_thread(void * arg)\n{\n    // 将传入的void类型参数转换为线程池结构体指针，方便操作线程池的属性\n    pool_t * ptr = (pool_t *)arg;\n    // 定义业务结构体变量bs，用于暂存从任务队列取出的业务函数和参数\n    bs_t bs;\n    // 设置当前线程为分离状态：线程结束后自动释放资源，无需主线程调用pthread_join回收\n    pthread_detach(pthread_self());\n    // 循环获取任务：thread_shutdown为线程池的运行标志，为真则持续工作\n    while(ptr-\u003ethread_shutdown)\n    {\n        // 加互斥锁：保护任务队列、cur（当前任务数）等共享资源，防止多线程竞争\n        pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);\n        // 当任务队列为空时（cur=0），进入等待状态\n        while(ptr-\u003ecur == 0)\n        {\n            // 等待条件变量Not_Empty：释放锁并阻塞，直到生产者添加任务后唤醒\n            pthread_cond_wait(\u0026ptr-\u003eNot_Empty,\u0026lock);\n            // 被唤醒后先检查线程池是否要关闭（thread_shutdown为假）\n            if(!ptr-\u003ethread_shutdown)\n            {\n                pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);  // 释放锁，避免死锁\n                // 打印线程退出日志，0x%x格式化输出线程ID（无符号十六进制）\n                printf(\"Customer thread [0x%x] shutdown its 0, exiting.\\n\",(unsigned int)pthread_self());\n                pthread_exit(NULL);  // 退出当前消费者线程\n            }\n        }\n        \tif(ptr-\u003ekill_number)\n\t\t   {\n      \t\t\tif((ptr-\u003ekill_number-1)==0)\n                     \tpthread_kill(ptid,SIGUSR1);\n    \t\t\t--ptr-\u003ethread_alive;\n   \t\t\t\t--ptr-\u003ekill_number;\n    \t\t\t printf(\"Customer thread [0x%x] exit , kill numer %d.\\n\",(unsigned int)pthread_self(),ptr-\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003ekill_number);\n    \t\t\t pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);\n   \t\t\t      pthread_exit(NULL);\n\t\t   }\n        // -------------------------- 核心逻辑：取出任务 --------------------------\n        // 从任务队列的队尾(rear)取出业务函数指针\n        bs.busines = ptr-\u003equeue[ptr-\u003erear].busines;\n        // 从任务队列的队尾取出业务函数对应的参数\n        bs.arg = ptr-\u003equeue[ptr-\u003erear].arg;\n        --(ptr-\u003ecur);  // 任务队列的当前任务数减1\n        // 队尾指针后移：通过取模实现环形队列，避免数组越界\n        ptr-\u003erear = (ptr-\u003erear + 1) % ptr-\u003emax;\n        ++ptr-\u003ethread_busy;\n        pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);  // 释放锁，其他线程可操作任务队列\n        // 唤醒生产者线程：任务队列有空闲位置了（Not_Full条件满足）\n        pthread_cond_signal(\u0026ptr-\u003eNot_Full);\n        pthread_kill(ptid,SIGUSR1);\n        // 打印日志：当前线程获取到任务，输出线程ID和业务函数地址\n        printf(\"Customer thread[0x%x] Get business_addr %p , Running.\\n\",(unsigned int)pthread_self(),bs.busines);\n        bs.busines(bs.arg);  // 执行具体的业务逻辑（核心：调用任务函数）\n        pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);\n        --ptr-\u003ethread_busy;\n        pthread_kill(ptid,SIGUSR1);\n        pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);  \n    }\n    // 线程池关闭（thread_shutdown为假），打印退出日志\n    printf(\"Customer thread [0x%x] shutdown its 0, exiting.\\n\",(unsigned int)pthread_self());\n    pthread_exit(NULL);  // 退出线程\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-xs5bkc8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-xs5bkc8","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Mananger_thread.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hldrefx","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hldrefx","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include\u003cserver.h\u003e // 引入自定义的服务器/线程池相关头文件\n// 管理者线程函数：负责动态调整线程池中的工作线程数量（扩容/缩容）\n// arg：传入线程池的结构体指针（pool_t* 类型）\nvoid *Manager_thread(void *arg)\n{\n    // 将传入的void*参数强转为线程池结构体指针\n    pool_t *ptr = (pool_t *)arg;\n    // 将管理者线程设置为分离态，避免主线程需要回收其资源\n    pthread_detach(pthread_self());\n    // 定义局部变量：\n    // alive：当前线程池存活的总线程数\n    // cur：待处理的任务数（从线程池结构体中读取）\n    // busy：当前正在处理任务的忙碌线程数\n    int alive, cur, busy;\n    // 加互斥锁：保护线程池结构体的共享数据（避免多线程读写冲突）\n    pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);\n    // 从线程池结构体中读取当前存活线程数、忙碌线程数、待处理任务数\n    alive = ptr-\u003ethread_alive;\n    busy = ptr-\u003ethread_busy;\n    cur = ptr-\u003ecur;\n    // 解锁：完成共享数据读取\n    pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);\n    // 定义局部变量：\n    // flag：循环计数器，用于遍历线程ID数组\n    // add：记录本次需要新增的线程数\n    int flag, add;\n    // 持续循环：管理者线程的核心逻辑（直到线程池收到关闭信号）\n    while(ptr-\u003ethread_shutdown)\n    {\n        // 扩容条件判断：满足以下任一条件则创建新的工作线程\n        // 条件1：待处理任务数 \u003e= 空闲线程数（alive - busy）\n        // 条件2：忙碌线程占比 \u003e=70% 且 当前存活线程数未达上限\n        // 同时要求：存活线程数 \u003e= 最小线程数 且 \u003c= 最大线程数\n        if((cur \u003e= alive - busy || (double)busy / alive * 100 \u003e= 70) \u0026\u0026 alive + ptr-\u003ethread_min \u003c= ptr-\u003ethread_max)\n        {\n            // 初始化计数器：新增线程数add=0，循环标识flag=0\n            for(flag=0, add=0; flag \u003c ptr-\u003ethread_max \u0026\u0026 add \u003c ptr-\u003ethread_min; flag++)\n            {\n                // 检查当前下标对应的线程ID是否有效：\n                // 条件1：线程ID为0（未创建） 或 条件2：线程已死亡（非存活状态）\n                if(ptr-\u003ectids[flag]==0 || !if_thread_alive(ptr-\u003ectids[flag]))\n                {\n                    // 创建新的工作线程（消费者线程）：\n                    // \u0026ptr-\u003ectids[flag]：保存新线程的ID到线程池的ID数组\n                    // NULL：使用默认线程属性\n                    // Customer_thread：工作线程的执行函数（处理具体任务）\n                    // (void *)ptr：给工作线程传入线程池结构体指针\n                    pthread_create(\u0026ptr-\u003ectids[flag], NULL, Customer_thread, (void *)ptr);\n                    add++;          // 新增线程数+1\n                    pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);  // 加锁保护共享变量\n                    ptr-\u003ethread_alive++;        // 线程池存活线程数+1\n                    pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);// 解锁\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        pthread_kill(ptid,SIGUSR1);\n        // 缩容条件判断：\n        // 忙碌线程数 * 2 \u003c= 空闲线程数（alive - busy）\n        // 且 存活线程数 -最小线程数 \u003e= 最小线程数（保证不缩到低于最小线程数）\n        // （注：原代码条件可简化为 alive \u003e= ptr-\u003ethread_min，逻辑是保证存活数不低于最小值）\n        if(busy * 2 \u003c= alive - busy \u0026\u0026 alive -ptr-\u003ethread_min \u003e= ptr-\u003ethread_min)\n        {\n            pthread_mutex_lock(\u0026lock);\n\t\t   ptr-\u003ekill_number=ptr-\u003ethread_min;\n\t\t   pthread_mutex_unlock(\u0026lock);\n\t\t   for(int i=0;i\u003cptr-\u003ethread_min;i++){\n           \t\t pthread_cond_signal(\u0026ptr-\u003eNot_Empty);\n\t\t   }\n        }\n        // 管理者线程休眠指定时间（TIME_OUT），避免频繁轮询占用CPU\n        sleep(TIMEOUT);\n    }\n    // 线程池收到关闭信号，退出循环，打印退出日志\n    printf(\"thread shutdown its 0 , manager 0x%x exiting..\\n\", (unsigned int)pthread_self());\n    // 管理者线程退出，返回NULL\n    pthread_exit(NULL);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-a92t6fa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-a92t6fa","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"if_thread_alive.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-tpu23wg","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-tpu23wg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include\u003cserver.h\u003e\nint if_thread_alive(pthread_t tid){\n    pthread_kill(tid,0);\n    if(errno==ESRCH)\n        return 0;\n    return 1;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-h4oe1vj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-h4oe1vj","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"thread_pool_destroy.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-w2cicvb","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-w2cicvb","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cserver.h\u003e\nint thread_pool_destroy(pool_t * ptr)\n{\n    pthread_mutex_destroy(\u0026lock);\n    pthread_cond_destroy(\u0026ptr-\u003eNot_Full);\n    pthread_cond_destroy(\u0026ptr-\u003eNot_Empty);\n    free(ptr-\u003ectids);\n    free(ptr-\u003equeue);\n    free(ptr);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9umm9bt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9umm9bt","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"———————————————-"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-6ms4j1h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-6ms4j1h","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Net_init.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-de20z3j","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-de20z3j","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include\u003cserver.h\u003e\nint Net_init(void)\n{\n    int sockfd;\n    struct sockaddr_in Addr;\n    bzero(\u0026Addr,sizeof(Addr));\n    Addr.sin_family = AF_INET;\n    Addr.sin_port = htons(8080);\n    Addr.sin_addr.s_addr = htonl(INADDR_ANY);\n    if((sockfd = socket(AF_INET,SOCK_STREAM,0))==-1){\n        perror(\"Net init Error, socket call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    if((bind(sockfd,(struct sockaddr *)\u0026Addr,sizeof(Addr)))==-1){\n        perror(\"Net_init Error, bind call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    listen(sockfd,BACKLOG);\n    return sockfd;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-w5goaq7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-w5goaq7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Epoll_Create.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-eg4nbf6","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-eg4nbf6","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include\u003cserver.h\u003e\nint Epoll_Create(int sockfd)\n{\n    int epfd;\n    struct epoll_event node;\t//监听节点\n    if((epfd = epoll_create(EPOLLMAX))==-1){\t//创建epoll树\n        perror(\"Epoll_Create error, epoll_create Failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n\n    //在此模型中，所有的socket都采用边缘模式监听，无论是serverfd还是clientfd\n    node.data.fd = sockfd;\n    node.events = EPOLLIN|EPOLLET; //监听读事件\n    if((epoll_ctl(epfd,EPOLL_CTL_ADD,sockfd,\u0026node))==-1){\n        perror(\"Epoll_Create error, Epoll_Ctl First Set sockfd Failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n\n    return epfd;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-di1i4ck","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-di1i4ck","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Epoll_Listen.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3811cxw","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3811cxw","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cserver.h\u003e\n/**\n * @brief Epoll事件监听核心函数\n * @param sockfd 服务器监听套接字（之前Net_init创建的fd）\n * @param ptr 线程池指针（用于提交任务到线程池处理）\n * @return 正常退出返回0，异常直接exit退出\n * @note 该函数是epoll反应堆模型的核心，循环监听事件并分发任务到线程池\n */\nint Epoll_Listened(int sockfd, pool_t *ptr)\n{\n    // 定义epoll就绪事件数组，存储epoll_wait返回的就绪fd事件\n    struct epoll_event ready_array[EPOLLMAX];\n    int ready;          // 接收epoll_wait返回的就绪事件数量\n    int flag;           // 遍历就绪事件数组的索引\n    bs_t tmp;           // 任务结构体（存储要执行的业务函数+参数）\n    // 打印运行日志，提示epoll监听线程已启动\n    printf(\"Epoll thread server , Epoll_listen Running..\\n\");\n    // 循环监听：ptr-\u003ethread_shutdown为线程池退出标志（非0时持续运行）\n    while (ptr-\u003ethread_shutdown)\n    {\n        /**\n         * epoll_wait：阻塞等待epfd上的事件（-1表示永久阻塞）\n         * @param epfd      epoll实例句柄（之前Epoll_Create返回的值，原代码漏写需确认）\n         * @param ready_array 存储就绪事件的数组\n         * @param EPOLLMAX  数组最大容量\n         * @param -1        超时时间（-1=永久阻塞，0=非阻塞，\u003e0=超时毫秒数）\n         */\n        if ((ready = epoll_wait(epfd, ready_array, EPOLLMAX, -1)) == -1)\n        {\n            // epoll_wait调用失败，打印错误并退出程序\n            perror(\"Epoll Listen error, epoll wait call failed\");\n            exit(0);\n        }\n        flag = 0; // 重置遍历索引\n        // 遍历所有就绪的事件（ready为就绪事件数量）\n        while (ready)\n        {\n            // 判断当前就绪fd是否是服务器监听套接字（有新客户端连接）\n            if (ready_array[flag].data.fd == sockfd)\n            {\n                // 配置任务：处理新连接的业务函数\n                tmp.busines = Busines_Accept;  \n                tmp.arg = (void *)\u0026sockfd;     // 传递监听套接字作为参数\n                Producer_add_task(ptr, tmp);   // 将任务添加到线程池任务队列\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                // 配置任务：处理已连接客户端的读写事件（如数据收发）\n                tmp.busines = Busines_Retime;  \n                // 传递就绪的客户端fd作为参数\n                tmp.arg = (void *)\u0026(ready_array[flag].data.fd);\n                Producer_add_task(ptr, tmp);   // 将任务添加到线程池任务队列\n            }\n            flag++;   // 索引自增，处理下一个就绪事件\n            ready--;  // 就绪事件数递减，直到处理完所有\n        }\n    }\n    // 循环退出（线程池关闭），关闭服务器监听套接字\n    close(sockfd);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-ml0n50k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-ml0n50k","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Busines_Accept.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-etbi4fa","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-etbi4fa","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/*接收客户端的新连接，给这个新连接分配专属的套接字 fd，把这个 fd 加入 epoll 监听（后续能感知客户端的读写事件），最后给客户端发一条包含其 IP 的欢迎消息。*/\n\n#include \"server.h\"\n/**\n * @brief 处理新客户端连接的业务函数（线程池执行）\n * @param arg 传入的参数，实际是服务器监听套接字sockfd的地址\n * @return 返回NULL（符合线程池任务函数的返回值要求）\n * @note 核心逻辑：接收新连接→获取客户端IP→将新fd加入epoll监听→给客户端发送欢迎消息\n */\nvoid *Busines_Accept(void *arg)\n{\n    int sockfd;                  // 服务器监听套接字\n    struct sockaddr_in newaddr;  // 存储新连接客户端的地址信息（IP+端口）\n    struct epoll_event node;     // epoll事件结构体（用于注册新fd的监听事件）\n    char response[1500];         // 存储要发送给客户端的欢迎消息\n    char ip[16];                 // 存储客户端的IP地址（IPv4字符串最长15位+结束符）\n    // 初始化缓冲区：将response数组所有字节置0，避免脏数据\n    bzero(response, sizeof(response));\n    // 初始化IP缓冲区：将ip数组所有字节置0\n    bzero(ip, sizeof(ip));\n    socklen_t addrlen;           // 客户端地址结构体的长度（accept函数需要）\n    // 从传入的void*参数中解析出监听套接字sockfd（强制类型转换+取值）\n    sockfd = *(int *)arg;\n    int newsocket;               // 新连接的客户端套接字fd（每个客户端唯一）\n    addrlen = sizeof(newaddr);   // 初始化地址长度\n    /**\n     * accept函数：从监听套接字的连接队列中取出一个新连接\n     * @param sockfd      服务器监听套接字\n     * @param \u0026newaddr    输出参数，存储客户端的地址信息\n     * @param \u0026addrlen    输入输出参数，传入地址长度，返回实际长度\n     * @return 成功返回新的客户端fd（newsocket），失败返回-1\n     */\n    if ((newsocket = accept(sockfd, (struct sockaddr *)\u0026newaddr, \u0026addrlen)) == -1) {\n        // accept调用失败，打印错误信息并退出\n        perror(\"Bsuines_accept error, accept call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n    inet_ntop(AF_INET, \u0026newaddr.sin_addr.s_addr, ip, 16);\n    // 配置epoll事件：将新客户端fd存入epoll事件结构体\n    node.data.fd = newsocket;\n    // 监听新客户端fd的读事件（EPOLLIN：客户端发数据/断开时触发）\n    node.events = EPOLLIN|EPOLLET;\n    \n    /**\n     * epoll_ctl函数：将新客户端fd添加到epoll监听集合中\n     * @param epfd        epoll实例句柄（全局变量，需在server.h中定义）\n     * @param EPOLL_CTL_ADD 操作类型：添加fd到epoll监听\n     * @param newsocket   要监听的新客户端fd\n     * @param \u0026node       要监听的事件配置\n     */\n    if ((epoll_ctl(epfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, newsocket, \u0026node)) == -1) {\n        // epoll_ctl调用失败，打印错误信息并退出\n        perror(\"Bsuines_accept error, epoll_ctl call failed\");\n        exit(0);\n    }\n\n    // 拼接欢迎消息：包含客户端IP，格式如 \"hi 192.168.1.100 wellcome epoll thread demo..\"\n    sprintf(response, \"hi %s wellcome epoll thread demo..\\n\", ip);\n    /**\n     * send函数：给客户端发送欢迎消息\n     * @param newsocket   客户端fd\n     * @param response    要发送的消息缓冲区\n     * @param strlen(response) 消息长度（不含结束符）\n     * @param MSG_NOSIGNAL 发送失败时不产生SIGPIPE信号（避免程序崩溃）\n     */\n    send(newsocket, response, strlen(response), MSG_NOSIGNAL);\n    \n    // 返回NULL，符合线程池任务函数（void* (*)(void*)）的返回值要求\n    return NULL;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hb9ykkg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hb9ykkg","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Busines_Retime.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-1sjzzwz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-1sjzzwz","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \"server.h\"\n/**\n * @brief 处理已连接客户端数据交互的业务函数（线程池执行）\n * @param arg 传入的参数，实际是客户端套接字fd的地址\n * @return 返回NULL（符合线程池任务函数的返回值要求）\n * @note 核心逻辑：非阻塞接收客户端数据→判断数据类型→响应（时间/提示）或处理客户端断开\n */\nvoid * Busines_Retime(void * arg)\n{\n    time_t tp;                // 存储时间戳（秒级）\n    int sockfd;               // 客户端套接字fd\n    char buffer[1500];        // 接收客户端数据的缓冲区\n    char time_buf[1500];      // 存储格式化后的时间字符串\n    int recvlen;              // recv函数的返回值（接收的字节数/错误码）\n    \n    // 初始化接收缓冲区：置0避免脏数据干扰\n    bzero(buffer,sizeof(buffer));\n    // 初始化时间缓冲区：置0\n    bzero(time_buf,sizeof(time_buf));\n    // 从void*参数中解析出客户端fd（强制类型转换+取值）\t用地址会有问题\n    sockfd = *(int *)arg;\n\n    /**\n     * 非阻塞接收客户端数据：\n     * MSG_DONTWAIT：非阻塞模式，没有数据时立即返回，不会阻塞线程\n     * 循环处理：仅当recv返回-1且错误码是EINTR（被信号中断）时，重试接收\n     */\n    while((recvlen = recv(sockfd,buffer,sizeof(buffer),MSG_DONTWAIT))==-1){\n        // 若错误码是EINTR（recv被信号中断），跳出循环重新尝试\n        if(errno == EINTR){\n            break;\n        }else{\n            // 其他错误（如连接异常），打印错误并退出程序\n            perror(\"Busines_Retime error , recv call failed\");\n            exit(0);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 分支1：recvlen=0 → 客户端正常关闭连接（主动断开）\n    if(recvlen == 0){\n        close(sockfd);                                      // 关闭客户端fd，释放资源\n        epoll_ctl(epfd,EPOLL_CTL_DEL,sockfd,NULL);          // 从epoll监听集合中删除该fd，避免无效监听\n    }\n    // 分支2：recvlen\u003e0 → 成功接收到客户端发送的数据\n    else if(recvlen \u003e 0){\n        // 判断客户端是否发送了\"time\\n\"指令（查询系统时间）\n        if(strcmp(buffer,\"time\\n\")==0){\n            tp = time(NULL);                                // 获取当前系统时间戳（从1970-01-01到现在的秒数）\n            ctime_r(\u0026tp,time_buf);                          // 线程安全的时间格式化：将时间戳转为字符串（如 \"Mon Jan 26 12:00:00 2026\\n\"）\n            // 给客户端发送格式化后的时间字符串\n            send(sockfd,time_buf,strlen(time_buf),MSG_NOSIGNAL);\n        }\n        // 客户端发送的不是\"time\\n\"指令\n        else{\n            // 给客户端发送错误提示，19是字符串\"Please try Again...\\n\"的字节数\n            send(sockfd,\"Please try Again...\\n\",19,MSG_NOSIGNAL);\n        }\n    }\n    // 返回NULL，符合线程池任务函数（void* (*)(void*)）的返回值要求\n    return NULL;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-czc8yhy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-czc8yhy","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——————————————————————————————————————"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cpd4mbe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cpd4mbe","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"makefile"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-7af6m6s","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-7af6m6s","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWFrZWZpbGU="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"# 头文件路径\nINCLUDE_PATH=./include/\n# 库文件路径\nLIBRARY_PATH=./library/\n# 安装路径\nINSTALL_PATH=./\n# 编译器\nCC=gcc\n# 编译选项：-I指定头文件路径，-g调试信息，-Wall显示所有警告，-c只编译不链接\nCFLAGS=-I$(INCLUDE_PATH) -g -Wall -c\n# 预处理选项（暂未使用）\nPPFLAGS=\n# 链接选项：-lpthread链接线程库（线程池依赖）\nLDFLAGS=-lpthread\n# 目标可执行文件名称\nTARGET=Thread_Epoll_ServerStart\n# 匹配当前目录下所有.c源文件\nSRCFILE=$(wildcard *.c)\n# 将所有.c文件替换为.o目标文件\nDESTFILE=$(patsubst %.c,%.o,$(SRCFILE))\n# 删除命令\nRM=rm -rf\n# 构建目标：生成可执行文件\n$(TARGET):$(DESTFILE)\n\t$(CC) $^ $(LDFLAGS) -o $@\n\n# 编译规则：将.c文件编译为.o文件\n%.o:%.c\n\t$(CC) $(CFLAGS) $\u003c -o $@\n# 清理规则：删除所有.o文件和可执行文件\nclean:\n\t$(RM) $(DESTFILE) $(TARGET)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-fyovpsc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fyovpsc","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"main.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-frgcuk7","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-frgcuk7","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cserver.h\u003e\n\nint main(void)\n{\n    // -------------------------- 信号屏蔽配置 start --------------------------\n    // 主线程设置对SIGUSR1信号的屏蔽，并继承给所有子线程（避免线程池线程被该信号中断）\n    sigset_t set, oset;       // 信号集：set（要屏蔽的信号）、oset（保存原信号掩码）\n    sigemptyset(\u0026set);        // 初始化信号集，清空所有信号\n    sigaddset(\u0026set, SIGUSR1); // 将SIGUSR1信号加入屏蔽集\n    // 设置进程信号掩码：SIG_SETMASK表示用set替换原掩码，oset保存旧掩码\n    sigprocmask(SIG_SETMASK, \u0026set, \u0026oset);\n\n    // -------------------------- 核心资源初始化 start --------------------------\n    int sockfd;               // 服务器监听套接字fd\n    pool_t *ptr = NULL;       // 线程池指针（pool_t是自定义线程池结构体）\n    sockfd = Net_init();              // 1. 网络初始化：创建+绑定+监听套接字，返回监听fd\n    epfd = Epoll_Create(sockfd);      // 2. 创建epoll实例，将监听fd加入epoll监听\n    // 3. 创建线程池：参数（任务队列最大容量300，工作线程数10，队列满时阻塞超时1000ms）\n    ptr = thread_pool_create(300, 10, 1000);\n    Epoll_Listened(sockfd, ptr);      // 4. 进入epoll事件监听循环（阻塞处理客户端事件）\n    // -------------------------- 资源清理 start --------------------------\n    // 若线程池退出标志为假（线程池需销毁），执行销毁操作\n    if (!ptr-\u003ethread_shutdown) {\n        thread_pool_destroy(ptr);     // 销毁线程池，释放线程/队列资源\n    }\n    printf(\"epoll thread server closing..\\n\"); // 服务器退出提示\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3ztz4ob","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3ztz4ob","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"touch print_thread.c"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-st5g7mq","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-st5g7mq","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include \u003cserver.h\u003e\nvoid * print_thread(void * arg)\n{\n    // 1. 将当前线程设置为分离状态\n    // 分离后线程结束时会自动释放资源，无需主线程调用pthread_join\n    pthread_detach(pthread_self());\n    // 2. 将传入的参数转换为线程池结构体指针\n    pool_t * ptr = (pool_t *)arg;\n    // 3. 定义信号处理结构体（用于捕获SIGUSR1信号）\n    struct sigaction act, oact;\n    // 4. 配置信号处理函数：指定SIGUSR1的处理函数为sig_usr\n    act.sa_handler = sig_usr;\n    // 5. 信号标志位：0表示默认行为\n    act.sa_flags = 0;\n    // 6. 清空信号屏蔽集（处理信号时不屏蔽其他信号）\n    sigemptyset(\u0026act.sa_mask);\n    // 7. 设置SIGUSR1信号的捕获规则\n    // 将act配置应用到SIGUSR1，原配置保存到oact\n    sigaction(SIGUSR1, \u0026act, \u0026oact); ////设置捕捉\n    // 8. 解除信号屏蔽：将当前线程的信号屏蔽集设置为act.sa_mask（这里是空集）\n    // 确保SIGUSR1信号不会被屏蔽，能正常被捕获\n    sigprocmask(SIG_SETMASK, \u0026act.sa_mask, NULL); ////解除屏蔽\n    PTR=ptr;\n    // 9. 循环等待退出信号：只要thread_shutdown非0，就持续休眠\n    // 线程会在休眠或运行中等待SIGUSR1信号触发（触发后可能修改thread_shutdown）\n    while (ptr-\u003ethread_shutdown) {\n        sleep(TIMEOUT); ////等待信号\n    }\n    // 10. 线程退出\n    pthread_exit(NULL);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-out3gya","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-out3gya","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"sig_usr.c"}]},{"ID":"20261006172412-4787quj","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20261006172412-4787quj","updated":"20261006172412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#include\u003cserver.h\u003e\nvoid sig_usr(int n)\n{\n    // 显示一次阈值信息（打印线程池当前状态）\n    printf(\"[Thread_Epoll_Server Info] [Alive]%d [Busy]%d [Idel]%d [Cur]%d [B/A]%.2f%% [A/M]%.2f%%\\n\",\n           PTR-\u003ethread_alive,        // 当前存活的线程数\n           PTR-\u003ethread_busy,         // 当前忙碌的线程数\n           PTR-\u003ethread_alive - PTR-\u003ethread_busy, // 当前空闲的线程数（存活 - 忙碌）\n           PTR-\u003ecur,                // 可能是当前任务数/连接数（需看pool_t定义）\n           (double)PTR-\u003ethread_busy / PTR-\u003ethread_alive * 100, // 忙碌线程占比（B/A）\n           (double)PTR-\u003ethread_alive / PTR-\u003ethread_max * 100   // 存活线程占最大线程数的比例（A/M）\n          );\n}"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}